<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#101010" />
    <meta name="description" content="Hearth & Oath: enter a remembered fantasy life at any age. Choose an origin and a face; fate writes your past. Master a trade, explore seeded roads, raise a family, and continue a legacy." />
    <title>Hearth & Oath — A dark fantasy life</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="__HO_ASSET_861bf65c139df7f9_0742__" />
    <style>/* Hearth & Oath — a pocket codex of lives, promises, and lost places. */
:root {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --soot: #101010;
  --paper: #101010;
  --surface: #191817;
  --surface-raised: #23211e;
  --ink: #ded6c8;
  --muted: #9f9a94;
  --line: #3b3937;
  --line-soft: #2e2c2a;
  --forest: #b49b6b;
  --forest-deep: #101010;
  --forest-soft: #2b2722;
  --gold: #b49b6b;
  --gold-light: #dcc8a0;
  --gold-pale: #242220;
  --rust: #8e806a;
  --red: #b9a58b;
  --illustration-tone: grayscale(1) contrast(.98);
  --serif: 'Palatino Linotype', 'Book Antiqua', Palatino, Georgia, serif;
  --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  --mono: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
  --dock-height: 80px;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1));
  font-synthesis: none;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-padding-top: 150px; background: var(--soot); }
body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 60% 0%, #2b292638, transparent 55%),var(--soot); line-height: 1.6; }
button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }
button { cursor: pointer; }
button, a, input, select, textarea { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
button, a { touch-action: manipulation; }
button:disabled { cursor: not-allowed; }
button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible, [tabindex]:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--gold-light); outline-offset: 3px; }
::selection { color: #0e0e0d; background: #b9ad9d; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { color: var(--gold-light); }
svg { display: block; flex-shrink: 0; }
button svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
img { max-width: 100%; }
h1,h2,h3,h4,p { margin-top: 0; }
h1,h2,h3,h4 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -.025em; }
h1 { font-size: 35px; line-height: 1.18; }
h2 { font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.3; }
h3 { font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.35; }
p { margin-bottom: 14px; }
small { font-size: 11px; }
hr { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin: 24px 0; }
input,select,textarea { width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 46px; padding: 10px 12px; color: var(--ink); background: #131211; border: 1px solid #4f4c48; border-radius: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; }
input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder { color: #8d8882; }
input:hover,select:hover,textarea:hover { border-color: #776f65; }
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus { border-color: var(--gold); }
select option { color: var(--ink); background: #181715; }
input[type=radio],input[type=checkbox] { accent-color: var(--gold); width: 18px; height: 18px; min-height: 18px; margin: 0; }
input[type=color] { padding: 4px; }
textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }
.sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
.boot-screen { min-height: 100vh; min-height: 100svh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 28px; }
.boot-card { width: min(100%, 34rem); text-align: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.boot-card h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
.boot-card p { color: var(--muted); }
.boot-card .button { min-width: 100px; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.small-copy { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.75; }
.eyebrow,.sidebar-label,.brand-subtitle,.sidebar-version,.gear-slot,.journal-date,.timeline-year,.life-badge { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 1.4px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.eyebrow { display: block; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6; }
.button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 46px; padding: 10px 15px; color: var(--ink); background: #1f1e1c; border: 1px solid #5a544d; border-radius: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; transition: border-color .15s,background .15s,color .15s; }
.button:hover { color: #e5dfd7; background: #282623; border-color: #8e8375; }
.button:active { background: #33302d; }
.button.primary { color: #141311; background: #9f9280; border-color: #9f9280; font-weight: 700; }
.button.primary:hover { background: #baab98; border-color: #baab98; }
.button.secondary { background: #22211f; border-color: #5c554c; color: #bfb6ab; }
.button.secondary:hover { background: #2d2b28; border-color: #988b7a; }
.button.ghost { background: transparent; border-color: transparent; color: #afa89f; }
.button.ghost:hover { background: #21201e; border-color: #44413c; }
.button.danger { background: #2a1914; border-color: #88503c; color: #dcac8e; }
.button.danger:hover { background: #3a2119; border-color: #ba7458; }
.button.small { min-height: 46px; font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 12px; }
.button:disabled { opacity: 1; background: #181716; border-color: #373431; color: #827c74; }
.badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; width: fit-content; padding: 3px 7px; font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); color: #b4ab9e; background: #22201d; border: 1px solid #484540; border-radius: 0; letter-spacing: .3px; }
.badge.gold { color: #c1b3a0; background: #24211e; border-color: #756440; }
.badge.warning,.badge.danger,.badge.red { color: #d5a28b; background: #2b1b16; border-color: #744a37; }
.badge-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; }
.notice { margin: 0 0 22px; padding: 14px 17px; color: #baae9e; background: #22201e; border: 1px solid #4e4943; border-left: 3px solid #9f9280; border-radius: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.75; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.notice.warning { border-color: #80543d; color: #ddb69a; background: #271b16; }
.notice p { margin: 0; }
.scene-return { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem .75rem; }
.scene-return .button { flex: 0 1 auto; white-space: normal; text-align: left; }
.panel { position: relative; min-width: 0; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: var(--ink); background-color: var(--surface); background-image: radial-gradient(#c8bfb407 .6px,transparent .8px); background-size: 4px 4px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0; box-shadow: none; }
.panel > p { color: #b4aea7; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
.panel > p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.panel-heading,.section-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; }
.panel-heading { padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.panel-heading h2,.panel-heading h3,.section-heading h1,.section-heading h2,.section-heading h3 { margin: 0; }
.panel-heading .eyebrow { margin: 0; }
.section-heading { margin: 27px 0 17px; }
.section-heading h2 { font-size: 26px; }
.section-heading p,.section-heading > span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
.panel > .section-heading:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.view-heading { display: block; margin-bottom: 24px; padding-bottom: 19px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.view-heading h1 { font-size: 31px; margin: 0; }
.view-heading p { color: #a6a098; font-size: 14px; max-width: 760px; margin: 10px 0 0; line-height: 1.85; }
.view-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 7px; }

/* The outer folio. */
.app-shell { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 204px minmax(0,1fr); min-height: 100vh; }
.sidebar { position: fixed; inset: 0 auto 0 0; z-index: 35; width: 204px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 29px 17px 20px; color: #c5bdb3; background: #11100f; border-right: 1px solid #423f3b; overflow-y: auto; }
.brand { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; padding-bottom: 27px; }
.brand-mark { width: 49px; height: 55px; margin-bottom: 13px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #ac9f8e; font-size: 38px; }
.brand-mark svg { width: 49px; height: 55px; }
.brand-title { display: block; color: #d4cdc4; font: 600 25px/1.3 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.045em; }
.brand-subtitle { display: block; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #a1978a; margin-top: 10px; }
.sidebar-label { color: #8f877c; margin: 12px 8px 12px; font-size: 10px; }
.sidebar nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; }
.nav-item { width: 100%; min-height: 46px; padding: 11px 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 0; color: #b3ada5; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; }
.nav-item > span:first-child { width: 20px; font-size: 20px; color: #9e9385; }
.nav-item:hover { color: #dcd6cd; background: #1f1d1b; }
.nav-item.active { color: #d5ccc0; background: #292724; border-color: #5b544a; box-shadow: inset 2px 0 #ac9f8e; }
.nav-count { margin-left: auto; font: 11px var(--mono); color: #a09484; }
.sidebar-secondary { padding-top: 14px; margin-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid #3c3934; }
.sidebar-secondary .button { width: 100%; justify-content: flex-start; font-size: 12px; padding-left: 11px; color: #b0aaa2; }
.sidebar-footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid #3b3834; }
.sidebar-motto { font: italic 15px/1.9 var(--serif); color: #a59f96; margin-bottom: 19px; }
.sidebar-version { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .5px; color: #8c8479; display: block; }
.sidebar-footer .button { width: 100%; margin-top: 15px; }
.main-shell { grid-column: 2; min-width: 0; }
#main-content { max-width: 1430px; padding: 27px 32px 46px; margin: 0 auto; }
.main-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) 275px; gap: 25px; padding: 26px 30px; max-width: 1460px; margin: auto; align-items: start; }
.content-column,.status-rail { min-width: 0; }
.status-rail { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 19px; }
.game-header,.topbar,.phone-header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 30; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding: 13px 32px; min-height: 85px; color: var(--ink); background: #151412f5; border-bottom: 1px solid #494642; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
.identity-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 0; color: var(--ink); background: transparent; border: 0; text-align: left; min-height: 46px; min-width: 0; }
.identity-bar > span { min-width: 0; }
.identity-bar strong { display: block; font: 600 22px/1.3 var(--serif); }
.identity-bar span span,.identity-bar small { display: block; font: 11px/1.55 var(--mono); color: #a69c8f; margin-top: 4px; }
.identity-bar .fantasy-avatar { width: 43px; flex: 0 0 43px; }
.header-place { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; color: #ada496; font-size: 12px; }
.header-place strong { font-weight: 500; }
.header-place small { font: 10px/1.65 var(--mono); color: #948b80; }
.header-resources,.topbar-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; margin-left: auto; font: 12px var(--mono); }
.header-resources > span { white-space: nowrap; }
.header-resources strong { color: #c9bfb2; font-weight: 400; }
.header-resources .button { padding: 8px 12px; }
.game-header .age-up-button { min-height: 46px; background: #9b5140; border-color: #bd7558; color: #f3dfc3; font: 600 19px var(--serif); }
.game-header .age-up-button:disabled { background: #34231b; color: #ae977c; border-color: #684333; }
.topbar-location small,.topbar-date span,.topbar-date strong { display: block; }
.welcome-header { justify-content: space-between; }
.welcome-header .eyebrow { margin: 0; }
.life-tools { display: none; }
.game-footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 35px; padding-top: 24px; color: #888279; }
.game-footer > span { margin-right: auto; font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .5px; }
.game-footer .button { font-size: 11px; padding: 8px; }
.bottom-nav { display: none; }

/* Narrative pages and choices are printed entries, not floating tiles. */
.scene-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.25fr) minmax(330px,.75fr); gap: 24px; align-items: start; }
.story-scene,.story-card { padding: 27px; border-color: #6d645a; border-top: 3px solid #9c8f7e; background-color: #1a1917; }
.story-scene h2,.story-card h2 { font-size: 31px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #d9d2c9; }
.scene-category { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.scene-category .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0; color: #b3a695; }
.story-body { font: 17px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #c8c2b9; }
.story-body p { margin-bottom: 18px; }
.story-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.scene-cast { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin: 20px 0; }
.scene-note { margin: 20px 0 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #3a3734; color: #a0978c; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.choice-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0; border-top: 1px solid #585147; margin-top: 25px; }
.choice-card { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 13px; min-height: 80px; padding: 18px 14px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #48443f; border-right: 1px solid #48443f; border-radius: 0; color: #d0c8be; background: #1c1b19; text-align: left; transition: background .15s; }
.choice-card:nth-child(even) { border-right: 0; }
.choice-card:hover { background: #2d2a26; }
.choice-card:disabled { color: #8e877d; background: #171614; }
.choice-card > span:not(.choice-number):not(.choice-arrow) { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
.choice-number { width: 21px; min-width: 21px; padding-top: 1px; color: #a89a87; font: 13px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.choice-label,.choice-card strong { display: block; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 7px; color: inherit; }
.choice-description { display: block; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; color: #b1aba2; }
.choice-arrow { font: 18px/1.5 var(--serif); color: #a99a87; }
.quick-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; margin: 12px 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #413e39; }
.activity-row { display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: center; min-height: 65px; width: 100%; padding: 16px 15px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #3c3934; border-radius: 0; color: #c4bcb2; background: #1b1917; text-align: left; }
.activity-row:nth-child(even) { background: #171614; }
.activity-row:hover { background: #282520; }
.activity-symbol { width: 27px; flex: 0 0 27px; font-size: 23px; color: #a39685; text-align: center; }
.activity-copy { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.activity-copy strong { display: block; font: 600 16px/1.4 var(--serif); color: #cbc4ba; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.activity-copy > span { display: block; color: #afa89f; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
.activity-cost { width: 46px; flex: 0 0 46px; color: #b3a99b; font: 11px/1.7 var(--mono); text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
.activity-row .choice-arrow { flex: 0 0 12px; }
.activity-row:disabled { background: #151413; }
.activity-row:disabled .activity-copy strong { color: #958e84; }
.activity-row:disabled .activity-copy > span { color: #9b958c; }
.activity-row:disabled .activity-symbol,.activity-row:disabled .activity-cost { color: #857d72; }
.disabled-reason { display: block; color: #c39778; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.75; margin-top: 7px; }
.activity-section { border-top: 1px solid #4a4641; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.activity-section > summary { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 46px; padding: 13px 4px; color: #bcb2a5; font: 11px/1.5 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
.activity-section > summary > span { margin-left: auto; color: #9e9384; }
.activity-section > summary::before { content: '+'; font-size: 17px; color: #ac9e8c; }
.activity-section[open] > summary::before { content: '−'; }
.activity-section > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.activity-section .quick-actions { margin-top: 0; }
.action-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 1px; background: var(--line); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.action-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; min-height: 155px; padding: 20px; color: var(--ink); text-align: left; background: #1a1917; border: 0; border-radius: 0; }
.action-card:hover { background: #292623; }
.action-icon { width: 28px; font-size: 23px; color: #a99c8b; }
.action-card h3 { font-size: 19px; margin: 0; }
.action-card p { font-size: 12px; color: #afa89f; margin: 0; }
.action-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: auto; color: #a69c8f; font: 10px var(--mono); }
.action-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
.action-top .action-icon { margin: 0; }
.activities-panel { margin-bottom: 26px; }
.growing-life .section-heading { margin-top: 0; }
.wellbeing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 18px; padding: 17px 0 9px; }
.wellbeing-stat { min-width: 0; }
.wellbeing-stat > span { display: block; font: 10px var(--mono); color: #b0a89d; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
.wellbeing-stat strong { display: block; font: 27px/1.5 var(--serif); color: #c4baab; margin: 6px 0; }
.age-unlocks { display: grid; gap: 0; margin: 21px 0; border-top: 1px solid #403c37; }
.age-unlocks > span { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #3a3631; padding: 12px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #b3aa9e; }
.age-unlocks strong { color: #a19585; font: 11px var(--mono); white-space: nowrap; }
.year-callout,.year-planner,.year-preview { background-color: #211f1d; border-color: #665c50; }
.year-callout { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
.year-callout h2 { margin-bottom: 9px; }
.year-callout p { margin: 0; }
.year-metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
.year-metrics span { display: block; font: 11px var(--mono); color: #a89e91; }
.year-metrics strong { display: block; font: 29px var(--serif); color: #cabeaf; }
.focus-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 11px; }
.focus-card { display: block; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #4e4a45; background: #191816; cursor: pointer; }
.focus-card:has(input:checked) { border-color: #aea08e; background: #2a2724; }
.focus-card strong,.focus-card span { display: block; }
.focus-card input { margin-right: 8px; }
.focus-card p { font-size: 12px; margin: 8px 0 0; color: #b1aaa0; }
.risk-preview,.event-consequence { padding: 15px; border-left: 2px solid #af7055; background: #251b14; color: #d3ad8c; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; }

/* Character, family, and the people whose names remain in the margins. */
.fantasy-avatar { width: 60px; flex-shrink: 0; margin: 0; }
.fantasy-avatar svg { width: 100%; height: auto; }
.fantasy-avatar.size-small { width: 60px; }
.fantasy-avatar.size-large { width: 104px; }
.fantasy-avatar.size-hero { width: 205px; max-width: 100%; margin: auto; }
.avatar,.portrait { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 55px; height: 65px; flex: 0 0 55px; background: #2b2926; border: 1px solid #675e53; border-radius: 0; color: #bbb0a2; font-family: var(--serif); }
.avatar svg,.portrait svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.avatar img,.portrait img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.avatar-builder { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 205px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 30px; align-items: start; }
.avatar-preview { text-align: center; min-width: 0; }
.portrait-stage { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 100%; min-height: 225px; padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid #585046; background: radial-gradient(#ac9d8a12 .7px,transparent 1px) 0 0 / 5px 5px,#161513; }
.avatar-preview > p { color: #aca397; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; }
.avatar-preview > small { color: #a19789; font-size: 11px; }
.fact-list { display: grid; gap: 0; }
.fact-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 105px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 19px; border-bottom: 1px solid #3a3733; padding: 12px 0; color: #b6ada1; font-size: 13px; }
.fact-item > span { color: #9f968b; font: 10px/1.9 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
.fact-item strong { color: #cac4bb; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.75; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.attribute-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr)); border: 1px solid #403d38; margin: 20px 0; }
.attribute { padding: 15px 8px; text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid #403d38; background: #1e1c1a; }
.attribute:last-child { border: 0; }
.attribute span { display: block; font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; color: #aba295; }
.attribute strong { display: block; font: 30px/1.6 var(--serif); color: #c0b29f; }
.skill-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 18px 25px; margin-top: 24px; }
.skill-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 9px; font-size: 13px; color: #bcb5ab; }
.skill-item > strong { color: #b2a492; font: 13px var(--mono); }
.skill-item .meter { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.stat-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; margin: 17px 0 7px; color: #b3aaa0; font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono); }
.stat-row strong { font-weight: 400; color: #c2b6a7; }
.meter { height: 7px; background: #2b2926; border: 1px solid #413d37; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 0; }
.meter-fill { height: 100%; max-width: 100%; background: #9a8d7b; border-radius: 0; transition: width .25s; }
.meter.magic .meter-fill,.meter.mp .meter-fill,.meter.focus-meter .meter-fill { background: #9a9792; }
.meter.gold .meter-fill,.meter.xp .meter-fill,.meter.experience .meter-fill { background: #b6a675; }
.meter.danger .meter-fill,.meter.hunger .meter-fill,.meter.hunger-meter .meter-fill,.stress .meter-fill { background: #b76d50; }
.resource-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 20px 0; }
.resource { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
.resource span,.resource small { display: block; color: #a49b8d; font: 10px var(--mono); }
.resource strong { color: #c8bfb4; font-size: 14px; }
.character-card { text-align: center; }
.character-card .fantasy-avatar { margin: auto; }
.character-name { font-size: 28px; margin: 15px 0 7px; }
.character-profile { display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: center; }
.character-meters { margin-top: 23px; }
.relationship-card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; padding: 17px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #423e39; }
.relationship-card h3 { font-size: 21px; margin: 0 0 5px; }
.relationship-card p { font-size: 12px; color: #aba49a; margin: 0; }
.relationship-card .meter { width: 100%; }
.relationship-card > div:not(.portrait):not(.fantasy-avatar) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.faction-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.companion-grid,.social-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 22px; margin-top: 20px; }
.companion-heading,.personal-tie { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.companion-heading > .fantasy-avatar,.personal-tie > .fantasy-avatar { width: 56px; flex: 0 0 56px; }
.companion-heading > div:not(.fantasy-avatar):not(.portrait) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.companion-heading h3 { font-size: 27px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
.companion-heading p { font-size: 12px; margin: 0; }
.companion-value { padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid #3b3833; }
.memory-list { border-top: 1px solid #423e39; padding-top: 18px; margin-top: 20px; }
.memory-list p { font: italic 15px/1.8 var(--serif); color: #bbb3a9; }
.social-card { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #423e38; background: #1d1b19; }
.social-meta,.social-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 17px; }
.social-meta { font-size: 12px; color: #aea69b; }
.people-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 254px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 23px; margin-bottom: 24px; align-items: start; }
.contact-list.panel { padding: 14px; }
.contact-list .section-heading { margin: 5px 5px 14px; }
.contact-list .section-heading h3 { font-size: 22px; }
.contact-card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; width: 100%; min-height: 78px; padding: 12px 9px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #3b3833; color: #beb5aa; background: transparent; text-align: left; }
.contact-card .fantasy-avatar { width: 42px; flex: 0 0 42px; }
.contact-card > span:not(.unread-dot) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.contact-card strong { display: block; font: 600 18px/1.4 var(--serif); color: #cec6bb; }
.contact-card small { display: block; font: 10px/1.8 var(--mono); color: #a1978a; margin-top: 5px; }
.contact-card.active,.contact-card:hover { background: #292724; }
.unread-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: #c6a071; flex: 0 0 7px; }
.conversation-thread.panel { padding: 0; }
.thread-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 17px; padding: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid #4c4842; background: #1e1c19; }
.thread-header .fantasy-avatar { width: 58px; flex: 0 0 58px; }
.thread-header > div:not(.fantasy-avatar) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.thread-header h2 { font-size: 28px; margin: 0 0 6px; }
.thread-header p { font-size: 12px; color: #b3aa9e; margin: 0; line-height: 1.75; }
.thread-messages { padding: 24px; max-height: 570px; overflow-y: auto; background: #141311; }
.message-entry { max-width: 93%; padding: 19px 21px; margin: 0 0 20px; background: #1f1d1b; border: 1px solid #48443f; border-left: 3px solid #7f7262; }
.message-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 13px; color: #aa9e8f; }
.message-meta strong { font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .6px; }
.message-meta span { font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); color: #999084; }
.message-entry p { font: 16px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #cac3ba; margin-bottom: 13px; }
.message-entry p:last-child { margin: 0; }
.message-entry.outgoing { margin-left: auto; background: #211f1d; border-color: #504b45; border-left-color: #9a8b78; }
.message-entry.narrator { border: 0; background: transparent; max-width: none; padding: 3px 4px; }
.message-entry.narrator p { font-style: italic; color: #a79f95; }
.thread-empty { text-align: center; padding: 32px 12px; }
.thread-empty > span { display: block; color: #a89a87; font-size: 37px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.thread-empty h3 { font-size: 25px; }
.thread-empty p { font: 16px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #b0a99f; }
.reply-options { padding: 25px; border-top: 1px solid #4a4641; }
.reply-options h3 { font-size: 25px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.reply-options .choice-card { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #4f4a44; margin-top: 10px; }
.thread-actions { padding: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #413d38; }
.thread-actions p { margin: 14px 0 0; color: #aba297; font-size: 13px; }
.conversation-thread > .social-actions { padding: 0 24px 24px; margin-top: 0; }
.family-summary { margin-top: 25px; }

/* Records of care and education. */
.household-layout,.household-history,.lore-introduction { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 23px; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 23px; }
.household-layout > .panel,.household-history > .panel,.lore-introduction > .panel { margin-bottom: 0; }
.family-grid { display: grid; gap: 0; margin: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid #484540; }
.family-member { display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #413d38; padding: 20px 0; }
.family-member > div:last-child { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.family-face { width: 61px; flex: 0 0 61px; align-self: flex-start; }
.family-face .fantasy-avatar { width: 61px; }
.family-face > span { display: grid; place-items: center; height: 73px; background: #1d1c1a; border: 1px dashed #686055; color: #9b9183; font-size: 24px; }
.family-member h3 { font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 5px; }
.family-member p { font-size: 12px; color: #b4aca2; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.family-member small { margin-left: 8px; font: 10px var(--mono); color: #aca395; }
.family-member .button { display: flex; width: fit-content; font-size: 12px; padding-left: 0; }
.family-member.absent h3 { color: #a39b91; }
.school-overview > h2 { font-size: 29px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.education-progress { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 16px; padding: 18px; margin: 22px 0; background: #23211e; border: 1px solid #4f4a43; }
.education-progress > div:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #47433d; }
.education-progress span { display: block; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); color: #b0a79b; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.education-progress strong { font: 25px/1.35 var(--serif); color: #c8bdae; }
.education-progress > div:first-child strong { font-size: 23px; }
.school-options > summary,.construction-section > summary { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; min-height: 46px; padding: 13px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #4d4944; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; color: #bdb3a4; font: 12px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.school-options > summary::after,.construction-section > summary::after { content: '+'; font-size: 22px; margin-left: auto; }
.school-options[open] > summary::after,.construction-section[open] > summary::after { content: '−'; }
.school-options > summary::-webkit-details-marker,.construction-section > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.school-routes { display: grid; gap: 20px; margin: 22px 0; }
.school-route { padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #413e39; }
.school-route:first-child { padding-top: 0; border: 0; }
.school-route h3 { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.school-route p { font-size: 13px; color: #b6afa5; line-height: 1.8; }
.qualification-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 18px 0; }
.offered-action { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-top: 15px; }
.offered-action small { color: #a89f94; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.75; }
.offered-action + .disabled-reason { display: none; }
.school-mentor { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 18px 0; margin: 18px 0; border-block: 1px solid #48443f; }
.school-mentor .fantasy-avatar { width: 48px; flex: 0 0 48px; }
.school-mentor p { font-size: 12px; color: #aca397; }
.remembered-entry { padding: 22px 0; border-top: 1px solid #413e39; }
.remembered-entry:first-of-type { margin-top: 20px; }
.remembered-entry strong { display: block; font: 600 23px/1.4 var(--serif); color: #c4bdb4; margin-bottom: 11px; }
.remembered-entry small { display: block; font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); color: #a1978a; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.remembered-entry p { font: 15px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #b8b0a6; }
.remembered-entry p:last-child { margin: 0; }
.preference-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #48443e; }
.preference-grid > article { padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #48443e; background: #1f1d1b; }
.preference-grid > article:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid #48443e; }
.preference-grid span { display: block; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); color: #a49b8d; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.preference-grid strong { display: block; font: 23px/1.4 var(--serif); color: #c4bbb0; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.preference-grid p { font-size: 13px; color: #b3aa9e; margin: 0; }
.preference-fields { border-top: 1px solid #433f39; padding-top: 22px; margin-top: 24px; }
.trait-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 13px; }
.trait-card { padding: 18px; background: #1e1d1b; border: 1px solid #46423c; }
.trait-card strong { display: block; font: 22px var(--serif); margin: 8px 0; color: #c3b8aa; }
.trait-card span { font: 10px var(--mono); color: #aaa093; }

/* Working materials and the marks a maker leaves. */
.resource-store .resource-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 1px; background: #46423d; border: 1px solid #46423d; }
.resource-store .resource-grid > div { padding: 17px 14px; background: #211f1c; }
.resource-store .resource-grid span { display: block; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; color: #aa9f90; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.resource-store .resource-grid strong { display: block; font: 31px/1.3 var(--serif); color: #c0b3a3; }
.materials-row,.gear-bonuses { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 11px 19px; padding: 17px 0; margin: 18px 0; border-block: 1px solid #44403b; color: #ada396; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.materials-row strong,.gear-bonuses strong { color: #c3b8aa; font-weight: 400; }
.blueprint-grid,.structure-grid,.gear-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 18px; margin: 22px 0 28px; }
.blueprint-card,.structure-card,.gear-card { min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #48443e; background: #1a1917; border-radius: 0; margin-bottom: 0; }
.blueprint-card h3,.structure-card h3,.gear-card h3 { font-size: 26px; margin: 11px 0 15px; }
.blueprint-card p,.structure-card p,.gear-card p { color: #b6ada2; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; }
.blueprint-benefit,.calling-ability { border-left: 2px solid #8b7e6d; padding-left: 13px; color: #c2b9ad; }
.blueprint-card > .badge { align-self: flex-start; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.recipe-tier { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font: 10px var(--mono); color: #b8ac9c; margin: 7px 0 17px; }
.recipe-materials { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; padding-top: 17px; border-top: 1px solid #44403b; margin-top: auto; }
.recipe-materials > span { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; border: 1px solid #4a4641; padding: 4px 8px; color: #aaa195; background: #22201d; font: 10px/1.65 var(--mono); }
.recipe-materials strong { color: #ccc3b7; font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px; }
.blueprint-card .recipe-time { color: #c2ae80; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); margin: 14px 0 0; }
.craft-filters,.section-tabs,.activity-filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 18px 0 22px; }
.craft-filters .active,.section-tabs .active,.activity-filters .selected { color: #141311; background: #9f9280; border-color: #9f9280; }
.construction-section { margin-bottom: 27px; }
.structure-card > .badge { align-self: flex-start; }
.structure-card p:first-of-type { color: #a49a8c; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.structure-card .button { margin-top: auto; }
.project-panel { border-top: 3px solid #ac9e8c; background-color: #22201d; }
.project-panel h2 { font-size: 30px; }
.project-actions { display: flex; gap: 17px; margin-top: 22px; align-items: flex-start; }
.project-actions .offered-action { flex: 1; margin: 0; }
.gear-card.equipped { background: #272522; border-color: #938776; }
.gear-slot { color: #afa597; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; font-size: 10px; }
.gear-equipped { color: #cbbeae; font-size: 10px; }
.gear-card .gear-bonuses { margin: auto 0 18px; font-size: 11px; }
.gear-card .button { margin-top: auto; }

/* Local histories occupy the same printed world as the living people. */
.lore-introduction .panel { padding: 27px; }
.lore-introduction h2 { font-size: 31px; margin-bottom: 21px; }
.lore-introduction p { font: 17px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #c0b9b0; }
.culture-card { border-color: #756a5c; background-color: #24211e; }
.ancestry-card { border-color: #745343; background-color: #241d16; }
.ancestry-card .eyebrow { color: #c99677; }
.ancestry-card .muted { font: 12px/1.85 var(--sans); color: #b5aa8b; border-top: 1px solid #624735; padding-top: 17px; margin-top: 23px; }
.lore-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 19px; margin: 20px 0 27px; }
.lore-card { margin-bottom: 0; }
.lore-card h3 { font-size: 26px; margin: 18px 0 15px; }
.lore-card p { font: 16px/1.8 var(--serif); color: #bcb4aa; }
.lore-card.discovered { background-color: #211f1d; border-color: #766a5a; }
.lore-card .button { margin-top: 9px; }

/* Seeded cartography remains data, with an engraved treatment. */
.world-layout,.map-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) 305px; gap: 23px; align-items: start; }
.world-map-panel { padding: 0; background: transparent; border: 0; }
.world-board { min-width: 0; border: 1px solid #675f54; background: #161513; }
.map-toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 17px; padding: 20px; color: #c6bdb1; background: #181715; border-bottom: 1px solid #4c4843; }
.map-toolbar strong { display: block; font: 600 26px/1.4 var(--serif); }
.map-toolbar .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 10px; }
.map-controls { display: flex; gap: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.map-controls .button { width: 46px; min-width: 46px; min-height: 46px; padding: 8px; color: #baafa1; border: 1px solid #4b4742; }
.map-viewport { overflow: auto; max-height: 760px; scrollbar-color: var(--scroll-thumb) var(--scroll-track); }
.map-canvas { position: relative; width: calc(100% * var(--map-scale,1)); aspect-ratio: 10 / 7; min-height: 330px; }
.map-terrain { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.map-biome { stroke: #675f54; stroke-width: 1.1; stroke-opacity: .5; }
.map-biome.forest { fill: #2b2926; }
.map-biome.mountain { fill: #262422; }
.map-biome.marsh { fill: #272624; }
.map-biome.water { fill: #1a1917; }
.map-road { fill: none; stroke: #877c6e; stroke-width: 5; stroke-linecap: square; opacity: .75; }
.map-road.closed { stroke: #91523c; stroke-dasharray: 6 7; opacity: .65; }
.map-selected-route { fill: none; stroke: #c0855b; stroke-width: 5; stroke-dasharray: 8 6; }
.map-region-label { fill: #877f74; opacity: .8; font: 11px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 3px; text-anchor: middle; }
.map-compass { fill: none; stroke: #968b7d; stroke-width: 1; }
.map-compass text { fill: #aca396; font: 13px var(--mono); text-anchor: middle; stroke: none; }
.map-frame { fill: none; stroke: #756c60; stroke-width: 1.2; opacity: .6; }
.map-node { position: absolute; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 46px; height: 46px; padding: 0; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); border: 0; color: #bbb1a3; background: transparent; z-index: 5; }
.map-node-pin { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 33px; height: 33px; border: 1px solid #7c7264; background: #1c1a18; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #121110bb; }
.map-node-pin > svg { width: 25px; height: 25px; }
.map-node:hover .map-node-pin,.map-node.selected .map-node-pin { color: #e3d0a9; border-color: #c1855c; background: #34281c; }
.map-node.selected { z-index: 8; }
.map-node.current .map-node-pin { color: #ccc0b0; border-color: #ac9e8b; background: #2f2c28; }
.map-node-label { position: absolute; top: 47px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: max-content; max-width: 150px; text-align: center; color: #bcb3a7; padding: 3px 5px; background: #171614e6; border: 1px solid #403c36; font: 12px/1.5 var(--serif); pointer-events: none; }
.map-node.selected .map-node-label,.map-node.current .map-node-label { color: #e2d3aa; }
.map-node.destroyed { color: #aa704f; }
.map-node.destroyed .map-node-pin { border-color: #9b6046; background: #271c14; }
.map-node.destroyed .map-node-label { color: #ba8c64; text-decoration: line-through; }
.map-node.evacuated .map-node-pin { border-style: dashed; }
.map-node.scarred .map-node-pin { color: #c59666; border-color: #8e6744; }
.map-quest-marker { position: absolute; top: -8px; right: -8px; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 18px; height: 18px; font: 12px var(--mono); background: #a89882; color: #171513; border: 1px solid #cabca9; }
.map-damage-mark { position: absolute; inset: 0; color: #b77455; font: 35px var(--serif); background: #261910a6; }
.map-piece { position: absolute; z-index: 9; width: 48px; transform: translate(-50%,-78%); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; pointer-events: none; }
.map-piece-portrait { display: block; width: 39px; margin-bottom: -10px; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
.map-piece-portrait .fantasy-avatar { width: 39px; }
.map-pawn { width: 44px; height: 42px; }
.map-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px 16px; padding: 14px 17px; border-top: 1px solid #4c4843; color: #ada498; background: #1b1917; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.map-legend > span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
.map-legend i { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: #a29380; display: inline-block; }
.map-legend .legend-quest { background: #c3ac6b; }
.map-legend .legend-damage { background: #a36242; }
.map-legend .legend-building { background: #6c6255; border: 1px solid #a99d8e; }
.map-hint { margin-left: auto; }
.map-building-marker { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 1px; position: absolute; bottom: -8px; left: -10px; min-width: 22px; height: 22px; border: 1px solid #988c7b; background: #2e2c29; color: #c9beb0; }
.map-building-marker svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
.map-building-marker > span { font: 10px var(--mono); padding-right: 3px; }
.world-board.compact .map-toolbar { padding: 14px; }
.world-board.compact .map-toolbar strong { display: none; }
.world-board.compact .map-toolbar .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; margin: 0; letter-spacing: .8px; }
.world-board.compact .map-node-label { display: none; }
.world-board.compact .map-node.current .map-node-label,.world-board.compact .map-node.selected .map-node-label,.world-board.compact .map-node:hover .map-node-label { display: block; }
.world-board.compact .map-canvas { min-height: 285px; }
.world-board.compact .map-legend { padding: 12px; font-size: 9px; gap: 8px 10px; }
.world-board.compact .map-hint { display: none; }
.map-mini-panel { padding: 17px; }
.map-mini-panel .section-heading { margin: 0 0 15px; }
.map-mini-panel .section-heading h3 { font-size: 23px; }
.map-mini-panel > p { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 18px; }
.map-inspector h2 { font-size: 29px; margin-bottom: 13px; }
.map-inspector > .badge { margin-bottom: 17px; }
.map-inspector p { font: 15px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #bab2a8; }
.route-preview,.location-leads { border-top: 1px solid #47433d; margin-top: 23px; padding-top: 21px; }
.route-preview > strong { font: 23px var(--serif); color: #d0bd8e; }
.route-preview p,.location-leads p { font-size: 14px; }
.location-leads h3 { font-size: 24px; }
.world-changes article { padding: 22px 0 0; margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #46413b; }
.map-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 19px; }
.location-card { background: #1f1d1b; border: 1px solid #4a4640; padding: 20px; }
.location-card.current-location { border-color: #a59887; }
.location-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.location-card h3 { font-size: 24px; margin: 0; }
.location-card p { font-size: 13px; color: #b3aa9f; }
.map-caption { font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); color: #a69c8f; padding: 13px 0; }
.map-illustration { height: 230px; background: #1c1a18; }

/* Oaths, dangerous places, and an inspectable fight. */
.quest-grid,.calling-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 22px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
.quest-card,.calling-card { margin: 0; padding: 25px; }
.quest-card h3,.calling-card h3 { font-size: 29px; margin: 21px 0 16px; }
.quest-card p,.calling-card p { font: 15px/1.8 var(--serif); color: #bab1a6; }
.quest-status { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); color: #a79d90; }
.quest-objective { padding: 17px 16px; border-left: 2px solid #c0835b; color: #d0c09b; background: #251e14; font: 16px/1.8 var(--serif); margin: 23px 0; }
.quest-buttons { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.quest-card.completed { opacity: .8; }
.quest-card.failed { border-color: #81513d; }
.quest-progress { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #b0a698; font: 11px var(--mono); }
.quest-history { border: 1px solid #45413b; background: #191816; padding: 18px 23px; margin: 24px 0; }
.quest-history > summary { color: #b4a99b; cursor: pointer; min-height: 46px; font-size: 14px; padding: 12px 0; }
.quest-history[open] > summary { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.fate-summary { border-color: #6e6241; background-color: #1d1b19; }
.fate-summary h2 { font-size: 31px; color: #d8c79d; }
.campaign-ending { border-color: #7a6f60; background-color: #23211e; }
.campaign-ending p { font: 17px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #cac2b7; }
.calling-card.active,.calling-card.earned { border-color: #8e816f; background-color: #24211e; }
.calling-requirements { display: flex; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 21px 0; }
.calling-requirements span { padding: 4px 7px; border: 1px solid #48443f; color: #a09689; background: #171614; font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); }
.calling-requirements .met { border-color: #746a5c; color: #c1b5a5; }
.mentor-detail { font-size: 12px !important; color: #aba195 !important; }
.calling-card .button { margin: 7px 5px 0 0; }
.condition-panel { border-color: #745340; background-color: #211c16; }
.condition-panel .eyebrow { color: #c29271; }
.condition-panel p { color: #c3b99a; }
.condition-panel.lycanthrope { border-color: #676056; background-color: #201f1d; }
.moon-forecast { padding-top: 20px; margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #4e4a44; }
.moon-forecast strong { font: 22px/1.4 var(--serif); color: #c4b9aa; }
.moon-forecast p { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px; }
.dungeon-panel { border-top: 3px solid #aa7050; background-color: #1c1a18; }
.dungeon-panel h2 { font-size: 32px; }
.dungeon-room-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 10px; margin: 25px 0; }
.dungeon-room { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 9px; padding: 18px; background: #151412; border: 1px solid #423e39; }
.dungeon-room > span { color: #938674; font-size: 20px; }
.dungeon-room strong { color: #b8afa2; font: 19px/1.4 var(--serif); }
.dungeon-room small { font: 10px var(--mono); color: #91887c; }
.dungeon-room.current { border-color: #bc885e; background: #2a2417; }
.dungeon-room.cleared { background: #23211e; border-color: #766a5a; }
.room-story { border-top: 1px solid #494540; margin-top: 23px; padding-top: 22px; }
.room-story p { font: 16px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #c2bbb1; }
.turn-order { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; margin: 18px 0 0; }
.turn-chip { padding: 7px 12px; border: 1px solid #585045; color: #b8ad9e; background: #1e1c19; font: 11px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.turn-chip.active { color: #d6cec3; border-color: #a69988; background: #34302b; }
.combat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 23px; margin: 20px 0 25px; }
.combat-grid > section > .section-heading { margin-top: 0; }
.actor-card { padding: 21px; margin-bottom: 15px; background: #1e1c19; border: 1px solid #584e42; }
.actor-card.enemy { background: #231b15; border-color: #754b35; }
.actor-card.current { border-color: #ae9f8c; box-shadow: inset 3px 0 #9e8f7c; }
.actor-card.enemy.current { border-color: #c49066; box-shadow: inset 3px 0 #b67e56; }
.actor-card.defeated { opacity: .65; }
.actor-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.actor-heading > span:first-child { color: #a09381; font-size: 23px; }
.actor-heading strong { font: 23px/1.4 var(--serif); color: #cbc4ba; flex: 1; }
.actor-card p { font-size: 12px; color: #b2a99e; margin-top: 12px; }
.actor-card.enemy .meter-fill { background: #b67855; }
.target-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 46px; border-top: 1px solid #45403a; padding-top: 14px; margin-top: 17px; font-size: 12px; color: #bcb2a4; cursor: pointer; }
.actor-card.enemy .target-label { color: #d1b591; border-color: #5c3f2e; }
.battle-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
.battle-help { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 10px 23px; margin-top: 23px; border-top: 1px solid #49453f; padding-top: 19px; }
.battle-help p { font-size: 12px; color: #b1a89c; margin: 0; }
.battle-help strong { color: #cac1b4; }
.battle-log { margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 0 0 0 22px; color: #bdb4a8; font: 14px/1.9 var(--serif); }
.battle-log li { padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #3f3b36; }

/* A chronicle is a ledger rather than a stack of cards. */
.journal-list,.yearbook-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 23px 0 0; }
.journal-entry { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 125px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 23px; border-top: 1px solid #46423d; padding: 25px 0; }
.journal-date { color: #a69b8c; padding-top: 5px; font-size: 10px; }
.journal-date .badge { display: block; margin-top: 12px; }
.journal-entry h3 { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.journal-entry p,.year-entry p,.chronicle p { font: 16px/1.9 var(--serif); color: #bfb7ac; }
.year-entry { position: relative; padding: 25px 0 25px 95px; border-top: 1px solid #433f3a; }
.timeline-year { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 28px; color: #aca192; font-size: 11px; }
.timeline-year strong { font-weight: 400; }
.year-entry h3 { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.journal-preview { display: flex; gap: 15px; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid #423d37; }
.journal-dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; flex: 0 0 5px; background: #a49785; margin-top: 11px; }
.journal-preview strong { font: 21px/1.5 var(--serif); color: #c8bfb4; }
.journal-preview p { font-size: 12px; color: #afa69b; margin: 9px 0 0; }
.chronicle { padding: 35px; }
.empty-state { padding: 35px 22px; text-align: center; color: #b4ab9f; border: 1px dashed #5f5548; }
.goal-card { background: #211f1d; border: 1px solid #4e4943; padding: 22px; }
.progress-label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; color: #b7ac9e; font: 11px var(--mono); margin: 15px 0 8px; }

/* The first page and free cosmetic controls share the same worn folio. */
.creation-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,.95fr) minmax(0,1.05fr); gap: 0; max-width: 1280px; margin: auto; }
.main-shell:has(.creation-layout) #main-content { padding: 0; max-width: none; }
.creation-hero { position: relative; padding: 48px 42px 40px; overflow: hidden; background: #141311; border-right: 1px solid #4e4943; }
.creation-hero h1 { font-size: 49px; line-height: 1.1; margin: 22px 0 26px; color: #cec5ba; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
.creation-hero > p { max-width: 430px; font: 17px/1.9 var(--serif); color: #b8afa3; }
.creation-landscape { height: 320px; margin: 28px -16px; border: 1px solid #595045; background: radial-gradient(#b3a79621 .7px,transparent 1.2px) 0 0 / 4px 4px,linear-gradient(160deg,#322e29,#131210 75%); }
.creation-summary { display: grid; gap: 0; margin: 30px 0; border-top: 1px solid #47423c; }
.creation-summary > span { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: #aaa094; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #47423c; }
.creation-summary strong { display: block; font: 24px/1.4 var(--serif); color: #c3b7a7; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.creation-form { padding: 43px 34px; margin: 0; background-color: #181715; border: 0; }
.creation-form > h2 { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
.form-grid,.control-grid,.customization-grid,.avatar-option-fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 18px 14px; }
.field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; min-width: 0; color: #b8aea0; font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono); }
.field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.field > label,.field > span,.field-label { color: #b6ab9d; font: 11px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.field > small { font: 11px/1.8 var(--sans); color: #a99f92; }
.field input,.field select,.field textarea { font: 13px/1.5 var(--sans); }
.appearance-details { border-top: 1px solid #4d4841; margin-top: 27px; }
.appearance-details > summary { display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: center; min-height: 46px; padding: 17px 0; color: #c2b7a9; font: 12px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
.appearance-details > summary::after { content: '+'; font-size: 22px; margin-left: auto; color: #a69a8a; }
.appearance-details[open] > summary::after { content: '−'; }
.appearance-details > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.appearance-details > .avatar-builder,.appearance-details > .control-grid { margin: 14px 0 26px; }
.creation-form .avatar-builder { grid-template-columns: 145px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 22px; }
.creation-form .avatar-preview { position: sticky; top: 110px; }
.creation-form .portrait-stage { min-height: 180px; padding: 7px; }
.creation-form .avatar-preview > p { font: 23px var(--serif); margin-bottom: 8px; color: #cabfb1; }
.creation-form .avatar-preview > small { display: block; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.path-fieldset { padding: 0; border: 0; margin: 25px 0; }
.path-fieldset legend { font: 11px var(--mono); color: #bbafa0; padding: 0 0 13px; }
.path-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 8px; }
.path-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #524d46; background: #201d1a; cursor: pointer; }
.path-card:has(input:checked) { background: #302c27; border-color: #b6aa99; }
.path-card small { font-size: 11px; color: #afa69a; }
.seed-input { display: flex; gap: 9px; }
.seed-input .button { flex: 0 0 46px; padding: 8px; }
.world-seed { margin-top: 28px; }
.begin-button { width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 27px; padding: 14px 20px; min-height: 55px; font: 600 20px var(--serif); }
.form-note { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #a4998a; margin: 17px 0 20px; line-height: 1.8; }
.resume-divider { margin: 23px 0; border-top: 1px solid #4f4a43; }
.birth-summary { border: 1px solid #716759; background: #272421; padding: 20px; }
.customization-section { padding-top: 24px; margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #4b4640; }
.modal-overlay { position: fixed; z-index: 90; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 30px; background: #050504d9; backdrop-filter: blur(5px); }
.modal { position: relative; width: 740px; max-width: 100%; max-height: 90dvh; overflow-y: auto; padding: 36px; border: 1px solid #847a6d; background: radial-gradient(#c8bfb408 .65px,transparent 1px) 0 0 / 4px 4px,#181715; color: #cdc5bb; box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 #09080780; }
.modal h2 { padding-right: 35px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 34px; }
.modal p { font: 16px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #bab1a5; }
.modal-close { position: absolute; right: 11px; top: 11px; width: 46px; height: 46px; padding: 5px; font-size: 27px; color: #bfb5a7; }
.modal-buttons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 27px; border-top: 1px solid #48433d; padding-top: 24px; }
.toast { position: fixed; z-index: 100; bottom: 26px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); max-width: min(620px,90vw); padding: 13px 19px; color: #dad3c9; background: #2d2a25; border: 1px solid #94897a; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; }

@media (max-width: 1260px) {
  .app-shell { grid-template-columns: 182px minmax(0,1fr); }
  .sidebar { width: 182px; padding-inline: 12px; }
  .brand-title { font-size: 23px; }
  .header-place { display: none; }
  .scene-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(300px,.9fr); gap: 20px; }
  .blueprint-grid,.structure-grid,.gear-grid,.lore-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .creation-hero { padding-inline: 32px; }
  .creation-hero h1 { font-size: 43px; }
  .creation-form { padding-inline: 27px; }
}
@media (max-width: 1040px) {
  .scene-grid,.world-layout,.map-layout,.household-layout,.lore-introduction { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .main-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .status-rail { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .life-map-panel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .life-map-panel > .map-mini-panel { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .resource-store .resource-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .people-layout { grid-template-columns: 205px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 17px; }
  .thread-header { padding: 21px; }
  .thread-header .badge { display: none; }
  .creation-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .creation-hero { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #524c45; padding: 34px; }
  .creation-hero h1 { max-width: 600px; font-size: 47px; }
  .creation-landscape { height: 250px; }
  .creation-summary { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .creation-form { padding: 35px; }
  .creation-form .avatar-builder { grid-template-columns: 185px minmax(0,1fr); }
  .creation-form .avatar-preview { position: static; }
}
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  :root { --dock-height: 80px; }
  body { background: var(--soot); }
  .app-shell { display: block; }
  .sidebar { display: none; }
  .main-shell { width: 100%; }
  #main-content { padding: 22px 16px calc(100px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .main-grid { padding: 20px 16px; }
  .panel { padding: 21px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .view-heading { padding-bottom: 17px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .view-heading h1 { font-size: 29px; }
  .view-heading p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .section-heading { gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 25px; }
  .section-heading h2 { font-size: 25px; }
  .section-heading > span { font-size: 11px; }
  .section-heading .button { font-size: 11px; padding-inline: 8px; }
  .game-header:not(.welcome-header) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap: 7px 9px; padding: calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 16px 10px; }
  .identity-bar { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
  .identity-bar strong { font-size: 20px; }
  .identity-bar .fantasy-avatar { width: 39px; flex-basis: 39px; }
  .identity-bar span span { font-size: 10px; }
  .header-place { display: flex; grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; gap: 2px; }
  .header-place strong { font-size: 10px; }
  .header-place small { font-size: 9px; }
  .header-resources { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; gap: 4px; margin: 0; font-size: 10px; }
  .header-resources .button { width: 46px; min-width: 46px; padding: 6px; }
  .game-header .age-up-button { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; justify-self: end; min-height: 46px; padding: 11px 14px; font-size: 17px; }
  .welcome-header { min-height: 65px; padding: calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 16px 10px; gap: 12px; }
  .welcome-header .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .8px; }
  .welcome-header .button { font-size: 11px; padding-inline: 9px; }
  .bottom-nav { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr)); position: fixed; z-index: 45; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 0 5px env(safe-area-inset-bottom); min-height: 66px; background: #121110f5; border-top: 1px solid #635a4d; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
  .bottom-nav button { min-width: 0; min-height: 65px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; padding: 9px 0; color: #a99f91; background: transparent; border: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; }
  .bottom-nav button > span:first-child { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1; }
  .bottom-nav button > span:last-child { font: 9px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .2px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .bottom-nav button.active { background: #2c2924; color: #d1c6b7; border-top-color: #aa9d8b; }
  .life-tools { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr .7fr; gap: 6px; padding-bottom: 17px; margin-bottom: 21px; border-bottom: 1px solid #47423c; }
  .life-tools .button { font-size: 11px; padding: 8px 5px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .life-tools .active { background: #3c3730; border-color: #a79a89; color: #d4cabc; }
  .scene-grid { gap: 19px; }
  .story-scene { padding: 24px 19px 20px; }
  .story-scene h2 { font-size: 29px; }
  .story-body { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; }
  .choice-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .choice-card { border-right: 0; padding: 17px 12px; gap: 10px; }
  .choice-label,.choice-card strong { font-size: 17px; }
  .choice-description { font-size: 12px; }
  .scene-note { font-size: 10px; }
  .activity-row { padding: 15px 10px; gap: 12px; }
  .activity-symbol { width: 23px; flex-basis: 23px; font-size: 21px; }
  .activity-cost { width: 36px; flex-basis: 36px; font-size: 10px; }
  .activity-row .choice-arrow { display: none; }
  .activity-copy strong { font-size: 16px; }
  .activity-copy > span { font-size: 12px; }
  .action-grid,.focus-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .year-callout { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
  .year-callout .button { width: 100%; }
  .year-metrics { gap: 13px; }
  .year-metrics strong { font-size: 24px; }
  .life-map-panel,.status-rail { display: block; }
  .map-toolbar { padding: 16px; gap: 11px; }
  .map-toolbar strong { font-size: 23px; }
  .map-toolbar .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .7px; }
  .map-controls .button { width: 46px; padding: 6px; }
  .world-board:not(.compact) .map-canvas { min-width: 650px; }
  .map-viewport { max-height: 465px; }
  .map-legend { padding: 13px; gap: 8px 11px; font-size: 9px; }
  .map-hint { display: none !important; }
  .world-board.compact .map-canvas { min-height: 265px; }
  .map-inspector h2 { font-size: 28px; }
  .people-layout { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
  .contact-list.panel { display: flex; gap: 9px; width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px; margin: 0; scroll-snap-type: x proximity; }
  .contact-list > .section-heading { display: none; }
  .contact-card { width: 190px; min-width: 190px; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #4e4942; min-height: 83px; scroll-snap-align: start; }
  .contact-card .fantasy-avatar { width: 36px; flex-basis: 36px; }
  .contact-card strong { font-size: 17px; }
  .contact-card small { font-size: 9px; }
  .contact-list > .button { min-width: 130px; align-self: stretch; }
  .conversation-thread { width: 100%; }
  .thread-header { padding: 20px 17px; gap: 13px; }
  .thread-header h2 { font-size: 26px; }
  .thread-header .fantasy-avatar { width: 49px; flex-basis: 49px; }
  .thread-messages { padding: 19px 15px; max-height: 500px; }
  .message-entry { max-width: 96%; padding: 17px 16px; }
  .message-entry p { font-size: 16px; }
  .message-meta { display: block; }
  .message-meta span { display: block; margin-top: 5px; }
  .reply-options,.thread-actions { padding: 21px 17px; }
  .conversation-thread > .social-actions { padding: 0 17px 22px; }
  .social-actions .button { flex: 1; }
  .household-layout,.household-history,.lore-introduction { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .household-history > .panel { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .family-member { gap: 16px; }
  .family-member h3 { font-size: 24px; }
  .school-overview > h2 { font-size: 29px; }
  .education-progress { padding: 17px; gap: 14px; }
  .education-progress span { font-size: 10px; }
  .school-route h3 { font-size: 25px; }
  .blueprint-grid,.structure-grid,.gear-grid,.lore-grid,.quest-grid,.calling-grid,.companion-grid,.social-grid,.map-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 17px; }
  .blueprint-card,.structure-card,.gear-card { padding: 23px 20px; }
  .recipe-materials > span { font-size: 11px; }
  .project-actions { flex-direction: column; }
  .project-actions .offered-action { width: 100%; }
  .resource-store .resource-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .resource-store .resource-grid > div { padding: 14px 11px; }
  .resource-store .resource-grid strong { font-size: 28px; }
  .craft-filters { gap: 6px; }
  .craft-filters .button { flex: 1; padding: 8px 5px; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  .lore-introduction .panel { padding: 25px 21px; }
  .lore-introduction h2 { font-size: 30px; }
  .lore-introduction p { font-size: 16px; }
  .lore-card p { font-size: 16px; }
  .preference-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .preference-grid > article:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 0; }
  .trait-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .avatar-builder { grid-template-columns: 155px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .portrait-stage { min-height: 195px; padding: 7px; }
  .fact-item { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 5px; padding: 12px 0; }
  .attribute-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .attribute { border-bottom: 1px solid #4e4840; }
  .attribute:nth-child(3n) { border-right: 0; }
  .attribute span { font-size: 9px; }
  .attribute strong { font-size: 29px; }
  .skill-grid { gap: 19px; }
  .skill-item { font-size: 12px; }
  .faction-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .combat-grid { gap: 14px; }
  .actor-card { padding: 16px 12px; }
  .actor-heading { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; }
  .actor-heading > span:first-child { display: none; }
  .actor-heading strong { font-size: 20px; flex-basis: 100%; }
  .actor-heading .badge { font-size: 9px; }
  .actor-card .stat-row { font-size: 9px; gap: 5px; }
  .actor-card p { font-size: 11px; }
  .actor-card .target-label { font-size: 11px; }
  .battle-actions .button { flex: 1 1 42%; }
  .battle-help { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 15px; }
  .dungeon-room-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 9px; }
  .dungeon-room { padding: 16px 12px; }
  .dungeon-room strong { font-size: 19px; }
  .journal-entry { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 13px; padding: 24px 0; }
  .journal-date { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .journal-date .badge { margin: 0; }
  .journal-entry h3,.year-entry h3 { font-size: 25px; }
  .journal-entry p,.year-entry p { font-size: 16px; }
  .year-entry { padding-left: 0; padding-top: 62px; }
  .timeline-year { top: 27px; }
  .chronicle { padding: 23px 20px; }
  .creation-hero { padding: 30px 22px; }
  .creation-hero h1 { font-size: 43px; margin: 20px 0; }
  .creation-hero > p { font-size: 16px; }
  .creation-landscape { height: 245px; margin-inline: -5px; }
  .creation-summary { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 0; margin: 23px 0; }
  .creation-summary strong { font-size: 24px; }
  .creation-form { padding: 30px 21px calc(38px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .creation-form > h2 { font-size: 33px; }
  .creation-form .avatar-builder { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .creation-form .avatar-preview { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 125px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 8px 17px; align-items: center; text-align: left; }
  .creation-form .portrait-stage { width: 125px; min-height: 155px; grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / 3; margin: 0; }
  .creation-form .avatar-preview > p { align-self: end; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
  .creation-form .avatar-preview > small { align-self: start; font-size: 10px; }
  .form-grid,.control-grid,.customization-grid,.avatar-option-fields { gap: 17px 11px; }
  .field,.field > span,.field-label { font-size: 11px; }
  .field input,.field select { font-size: 13px; }
  .path-options { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .modal-overlay { padding: 15px; }
  .modal { width: 100%; padding: 30px 21px; max-height: calc(100dvh - 30px - env(safe-area-inset-top) - env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .modal h2 { font-size: 31px; }
  .modal p { font-size: 16px; }
  .modal .avatar-builder { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .modal .avatar-preview { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; text-align: left; }
  .modal .portrait-stage { width: 125px; flex: 0 0 125px; min-height: 155px; }
  .modal .avatar-preview > p { font: 12px/1.8 var(--sans); }
  .modal-buttons .button { flex: 1 1 45%; }
  .toast { bottom: calc(85px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); padding: 13px 15px; font-size: 12px; }
  .game-footer { gap: 3px; padding-top: 21px; margin-top: 29px; }
  .game-footer > span { flex-basis: 100%; margin-bottom: 13px; font-size: 9px; }
}
@media (max-width: 370px) {
  #main-content { padding-inline: 13px; }
  .panel { padding-inline: 16px; }
  .game-header:not(.welcome-header) { padding-inline: 13px; }
  .identity-bar { gap: 8px; }
  .identity-bar strong { font-size: 19px; }
  .header-resources { gap: 1px; }
  .header-resources .button { padding: 4px; }
  .game-header .age-up-button { padding-inline: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
  .life-tools .button { font-size: 10px; }
  .activity-row { gap: 9px; }
  .creation-hero h1 { font-size: 39px; }
  .avatar-builder { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .avatar-preview { max-width: 190px; margin: auto; }
  .creation-form .avatar-preview { max-width: none; width: 100%; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *,*::before,*::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
}

/* Volume I: the phone-sized life book and its persistent commands. */
.button { min-width: 46px; }
.ui-glyph { width: 22px; height: 22px; color: currentColor; }
.nav-item > .ui-glyph { flex: 0 0 21px; width: 21px; height: 21px; color: #9f9280; }
.sidebar-secondary .button > .ui-glyph { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex: 0 0 18px; }
body.has-dialog { overflow: hidden; }
.phone-header.game-header { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 0; padding: 0 32px 16px; background: #12110ff7; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
.header-bookmark { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 51px; border-bottom: 1px solid #373431; margin-bottom: 13px; }
.header-bookmark .menu-trigger { width: 46px; padding: 9px; margin-left: -10px; color: #bbb0a2; }
.header-booktitle { font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 1.8px; color: #c8c1b7; white-space: nowrap; }
.header-booktitle small { font-size: 9px; color: #8f887e; margin-left: 10px; }
.header-bookmark .header-resources { font-size: 12px; gap: 9px; }
.header-bookmark .header-resources .button { width: 46px; padding: 7px; font-size: 18px; }
.header-person { display: flex; gap: 27px; align-items: center; min-width: 0; }
.header-person .identity-bar { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.header-person .identity-bar strong { font-size: 24px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.header-person .header-place { padding-left: 23px; border-left: 1px solid #3f3c38; }
.header-person .header-place strong { color: #bfb8ae; font: 17px/1.3 var(--serif); }
.header-person .header-place small { font-size: 10px; }
.desktop-age-control { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 5px; margin-left: auto; min-width: 115px; }
.desktop-age-button { gap: 20px; min-width: 120px; }
.desktop-age-button strong { font: 13px var(--mono); }
.desktop-age-reason { color: #a2998d; font: 10px/1.5 var(--mono); max-width: 180px; text-align: right; }
.status-bars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 13px; }
.status-bar { min-width: 0; }
.bar-caption { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 6px; font: 10px/1.4 var(--mono); color: #bbb3a8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .7px; }
.bar-caption strong { font: inherit; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0; color: #cac3ba; }
.bar-track { height: 5px; background: #2c2a28; border: 1px solid #494641; }
.bar-ink { height: 100%; background: #9f9280; }
.status-bar[data-stat=health] .bar-ink { background: #9f9280; }
.status-bar[data-stat=joy] .bar-ink { background: #ac9d89; }
.status-bar[data-stat=focus] .bar-ink { background: #948e87; }
.status-bar[data-stat=stress] .bar-ink { background: #b87357; }
.mobile-command-dock { display: none; }
.life-phone-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.45fr) minmax(300px,.8fr); gap: 25px; align-items: start; }
.life-book,.life-current { min-width: 0; }
.life-current:empty { display: none; }
.life-feed { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; border-color: #5b544a; background-color: #171615; }
.feed-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; padding: 22px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #4b4742; }
.feed-heading .eyebrow { font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 7px; letter-spacing: 1.1px; }
.feed-heading h2 { font-size: 29px; margin: 0; }
.feed-heading .button { font: 10px/1.5 var(--mono); color: #b0a494; }
.life-feed-list { max-height: 665px; overflow-y: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: var(--scroll-thumb) var(--scroll-track); }
.life-feed-list:focus-visible { outline-offset: -3px; }
.age-ledgers,.life-entries { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.age-ledgers > li { border-bottom: 1px solid #4c4843; }
.age-ledgers > li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.age-ledger > summary { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 54px; padding: 10px 24px; color: #bfb3a2; background: #1f1e1c; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
.age-ledger > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.age-ledger > summary::after { content: '+'; font: 18px/1 var(--mono); color: #9f9280; margin-left: 3px; }
.age-ledger[open] > summary::after { content: '−'; }
.age-stamp { font: 600 23px/1.4 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.025em; }
.age-entry-count { margin-left: auto; font: 10px/1.5 var(--mono); color: #9f9587; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.life-entry { position: relative; margin: 0 24px; padding: 22px 0 23px 17px; border-bottom: 1px solid #373532; border-left: 1px solid #433f3a; }
.life-entry:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.life-entry::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 31px; left: -3px; width: 5px; height: 5px; background: #9f9280; }
.life-entry[data-kind=crime]::before,.life-entry[data-kind=danger]::before,.life-entry[data-kind=death]::before { background: #b9785d; }
.life-entry-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 9px; }
.life-entry-heading strong { font: 600 19px/1.45 var(--serif); color: #d4cdc4; }
.life-entry-heading time { flex-shrink: 0; color: #979086; font: 9px/1.7 var(--mono); text-align: right; }
.life-entry p { color: #c1bbb4; font: 16px/1.85 var(--serif); margin: 0 0 10px; }
.life-entry p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.life-actions-shortcuts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); border: 1px solid #4d4943; margin-top: -1px; }
.life-actions-shortcuts .button { min-width: 0; min-height: 68px; gap: 9px; padding: 12px 10px; border: 0; border-right: 1px solid #4d4943; color: #bcb2a5; background: #1c1a18; font-size: 12px; }
.life-actions-shortcuts .button:last-child { border-right: 0; }
.life-actions-shortcuts .button:hover { background: #2b2824; }
.life-actions-shortcuts .ui-glyph { width: 21px; height: 21px; }
.next-age-unlock { padding: 16px 0; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); color: #aaa093; }
.next-age-unlock span { color: #7b7368; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-right: 7px; }
.life-obligations > div { position: relative; padding: 15px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #46433d; }
.life-obligations > div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }
.life-obligations > div > strong { font: 600 20px/1.5 var(--serif); margin-right: 12px; }
.life-obligations p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: #aca69e; font-size: 12px; }
.life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel { display: block; }
.life-map-panel .map-toolbar { padding: 12px; }
.life-map-panel .map-toolbar strong { font-size: 19px; }
.life-map-panel .map-controls { gap: 3px; }
.life-map-panel .map-controls .button { min-width: 46px; width: 46px; }
.life-map-panel .map-mini-panel > p { font: 14px/1.8 var(--serif); color: #b4aca3; }
.life-activity-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0; margin-bottom: 28px; border: 1px solid #4d4943; }
.activity-category { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; min-height: 94px; padding: 21px; color: #c1b9ae; background: #1c1b19; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #46423d; border-right: 1px solid #46423d; text-align: left; }
.activity-category:nth-child(even) { border-right: 0; }
.activity-category:nth-last-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 0; }
.activity-category:hover { background: #2a2724; }
.activity-category > .ui-glyph { width: 28px; height: 28px; color: #9f9280; flex: 0 0 28px; }
.activity-category > span:nth-child(2) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.activity-category strong { display: block; font: 600 21px/1.35 var(--serif); color: #d4cec7; }
.activity-category small { display: block; font: 12px/1.7 var(--sans); color: #afa89f; margin-top: 6px; }
.activity-category > span:last-child { color: #928677; font: 24px var(--serif); }
.activities-detail .activities-panel { margin-bottom: 0; }
.drawer-overlay { justify-content: flex-end; padding: 0; backdrop-filter: blur(5px); }
.menu-drawer.modal { width: min(500px,100%); height: 100dvh; max-height: 100dvh; margin: 0; padding: 37px 29px calc(25px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); border: 0; border-left: 1px solid #6d655a; background: #151412; }
.drawer-heading { margin: 0 35px 28px 0; padding-bottom: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid #585046; }
.drawer-heading .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1.4px; margin-bottom: 11px; }
.drawer-heading h2 { font-size: 34px; margin: 0; }
.drawer-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.drawer-links > button { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; min-height: 77px; padding: 16px 12px; color: #b9b1a6; background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #3b3833; text-align: left; }
.drawer-links > button:hover { background: #23211e; }
.drawer-links > button[aria-current=page] { background: #2b2824; box-shadow: inset 2px 0 #9f9280; }
.drawer-links > button > .ui-glyph { width: 24px; height: 24px; flex: 0 0 24px; color: #9f9280; }
.drawer-links > button > span:nth-child(2) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.drawer-links strong { display: block; font: 600 23px/1.35 var(--serif); color: #d4cec7; }
.drawer-links small { display: block; font: 11px/1.7 var(--sans); margin-top: 5px; color: #aba49a; }
.drawer-links > button > span:last-child { font: 23px var(--serif); color: #9e9282; }
.drawer-section-label { color: #9f9384; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 28px 0 14px; }
.drawer-tools { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 10px; }
.drawer-tools .button:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.creation-landscape { height: 405px; background-image: url('__HO_ASSET_2558632c655ad2a3_0736__'); background-size: cover; background-position: center 40%; border: 1px solid #686157; box-shadow: inset 0 0 35px #08080799; }
.map-road { stroke: #8c7956; stroke-width: 3px; filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 0 #0b0b0a); }
.map-road.closed { stroke: #a36443; }
input[type=radio],input[type=checkbox] { width: 46px; min-width: 46px; height: 46px; min-height: 46px; padding: 0; appearance: none; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle,transparent 0 6px,#877c6e 6px 7px,transparent 7px); }
input[type=radio]:checked,input[type=checkbox]:checked { background: radial-gradient(circle,#b9ac9a 0 4px,transparent 4px 6px,#9f9280 6px 7px,transparent 7px); }

@media (max-width: 1260px) {
  .header-person { gap: 18px; }
  .header-person .header-place { padding-left: 18px; }
  .life-phone-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(290px,.8fr); gap: 20px; }
  .feed-heading { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .life-entry-heading { display: block; }
  .life-entry-heading time { display: block; margin-top: 4px; text-align: left; }
  .life-actions-shortcuts .button { flex-direction: column; font-size: 11px; gap: 7px; }
}
@media (max-width: 999px) {
  :root { --dock-height: 135px; }
  .app-shell { display: block; }
  .sidebar { display: none; }
  .main-shell { width: 100%; }
  #main-content { padding: 23px 22px calc(165px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .new-life #main-content { padding-bottom: 35px; }
  .phone-header.game-header { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 0; padding: env(safe-area-inset-top) 22px 14px; }
  .header-bookmark { min-height: 50px; margin-bottom: 10px; gap: 6px; }
  .header-bookmark .menu-trigger { margin-left: -9px; }
  .header-booktitle { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .header-booktitle small { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .4px; margin-left: 6px; }
  .header-bookmark .header-resources { margin-left: auto; gap: 4px; font-size: 11px; }
  .header-person { justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; }
  .header-person .identity-bar { gap: 11px; flex: 1; grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; }
  .header-person .identity-bar strong { font-size: 23px; }
  .header-person .identity-bar .fantasy-avatar { width: 40px; flex-basis: 40px; }
  .header-person .identity-bar span span { font-size: 10px; margin-top: 3px; }
  .header-person .header-place { display: flex; gap: 3px; grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; padding-left: 14px; max-width: 42%; }
  .header-person .header-place strong { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .header-person .header-place small { font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .desktop-age-control { display: none; }
  .status-bars { gap: 15px; margin-top: 13px; }
  .bar-caption { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .4px; gap: 5px; }
  .bar-caption strong { font-size: 9px; }
  .bar-track { height: 5px; }
  /* The fixed bottom bar already carries Menu; the command bar's copy would sit right above it. */
  .game-commandbar .command-menu-button { display: none; }
  .mobile-command-dock { display: block; position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 45; padding: 0 0 env(safe-area-inset-bottom); background: #151412f9; border-top: 1px solid #6f665b; box-shadow: 0 -9px 28px #08070699; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
  .command-age-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; min-height: 72px; padding: 12px 22px 11px; border-bottom: 1px solid #46433e; }
  .command-age-button.button { flex: 0 0 145px; min-height: 47px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; padding: 10px 15px; color: #e5d4b7; background: #934e3b; border: 1px solid #bd7657; font: 600 23px/1.1 var(--serif); }
  .command-age-button.button strong { font: 12px var(--mono); }
  .command-age-button.button:hover { background: #aa6248; }
  .command-age-button.button:disabled { background: #37251d; border-color: #785038; color: #c0a78d; }
  .command-reason { flex: 1; min-width: 0; margin: 0; color: #bbb2a6; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); }
  .mobile-command-dock .bottom-nav { position: static; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr)); width: 100%; padding: 0 6px; min-height: 61px; background: transparent; border: 0; backdrop-filter: none; }
  .bottom-nav button { min-width: 46px; min-height: 61px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5px; padding: 8px 1px; color: #a99f92; background: transparent; border: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; }
  .bottom-nav .ui-glyph { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
  .bottom-nav button > span:last-child { font: 9px/1.5 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .15px; }
  .bottom-nav button.active { background: #2c2925; color: #cdc3b5; border-top-color: #9f9280; }
  .life-phone-layout { display: block; }
  .life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel { display: none; }
  .life-feed-list { max-height: min(610px,68dvh); }
  .feed-heading { flex-wrap: nowrap; }
  .life-entry-heading { display: flex; }
  .life-entry-heading time { text-align: right; margin: 0; }
  .life-actions-shortcuts .button { flex-direction: row; }
  .toast { bottom: calc(148px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .creation-landscape { height: 360px; background-position: center 43%; }
  .creation-hero { padding: 35px 30px; }
  .life-activity-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  #main-content { padding: 18px 15px calc(160px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .phone-header.game-header { padding-inline: 15px; padding-bottom: 13px; }
  .header-bookmark { min-height: 47px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .header-booktitle { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1.25px; }
  .header-booktitle small { display: none; }
  .header-bookmark .header-resources { gap: 0; font-size: 10px; }
  .header-bookmark .header-resources .button { width: 46px; min-width: 46px; padding: 7px; font-size: 17px; }
  .header-bookmark .coin-count { margin-right: 4px; }
  .header-person { gap: 13px; }
  .header-person .identity-bar { gap: 9px; }
  .header-person .identity-bar strong { font-size: 21px; }
  .header-person .identity-bar .fantasy-avatar { width: 38px; flex-basis: 38px; }
  .header-person .identity-bar span span { font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .header-person .identity-bar b { color: #d1c7ba; }
  .header-person .header-place { max-width: 35%; padding-left: 12px; }
  .header-person .header-place strong { font-size: 14px; }
  .header-person .header-place small { font-size: 8px; }
  .status-bars { gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .bar-caption { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .bar-caption strong { font-size: 9px; }
  .bar-track { height: 5px; }
  .command-age-row { min-height: 75px; padding: 11px 15px; gap: 13px; }
  .command-age-button.button { flex-basis: 137px; font-size: 22px; padding-inline: 13px; }
  .command-reason { font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .life-feed { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .feed-heading { padding: 20px 18px 18px; gap: 8px; }
  .feed-heading .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .7px; margin-bottom: 7px; }
  .feed-heading h2 { font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.25; }
  .feed-heading .button { max-width: 86px; padding: 7px; font-size: 9px; text-align: right; }
  .life-feed-list { max-height: 55dvh; }
  .age-ledger > summary { min-height: 52px; padding: 9px 18px; }
  .age-stamp { font-size: 23px; }
  .age-entry-count { font-size: 9px; }
  .life-entry { margin: 0 18px; padding: 18px 0 21px 14px; }
  .life-entry::before { top: 27px; }
  .life-entry-heading { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .life-entry-heading strong { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .life-entry-heading time { display: block; margin-top: 4px; text-align: left; font-size: 8px; }
  .life-entry p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .life-actions-shortcuts { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .life-actions-shortcuts .button { justify-content: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; min-height: 49px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #46433d; font-size: 13px; }
  .life-actions-shortcuts .button:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .next-age-unlock { font-size: 10px; padding: 14px 3px; }
  .life-activity-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .activity-category { min-height: 83px; padding: 18px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #46423d; gap: 15px; }
  .activity-category:nth-last-child(2) { border-bottom: 1px solid #46423d; }
  .activity-category > .ui-glyph { width: 26px; height: 26px; flex-basis: 26px; }
  .activity-category strong { font-size: 22px; }
  .activity-category small { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .menu-drawer.modal { padding: calc(29px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 20px calc(29px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); border-left: 0; }
  .drawer-heading { margin-bottom: 18px; padding-bottom: 22px; }
  .drawer-heading h2 { font-size: 32px; }
  .drawer-heading .eyebrow { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .8px; }
  .drawer-links > button { gap: 14px; padding: 15px 10px; min-height: 77px; }
  .drawer-links strong { font-size: 23px; }
  .drawer-links small { font-size: 11px; }
  .creation-hero { padding: 29px 21px; }
  .creation-landscape { height: 330px; margin: 25px -5px; background-position: center 40%; }
  .new-life #main-content { padding-bottom: 22px; }
}
@media (max-width: 370px) {
  .header-booktitle { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .header-person .identity-bar strong { font-size: 19px; }
  .header-person .identity-bar span span { font-size: 8px; }
  .header-person .header-place { padding-left: 9px; }
  .header-person .header-place strong { font-size: 13px; }
  .header-person .header-place small { font-size: 8px; }
  .status-bars { gap: 9px; }
  .command-age-button.button { flex-basis: 127px; font-size: 21px; }
  .command-reason { font-size: 8px; }
}
@media (max-width: 999px) {
  .life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel { display: block; margin-top: 8px; }
  .life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel > .map-mini-panel,
  .life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel > .current-lead { display: none; }
  .life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel > .condition-panel { display: block; }
}
/* Intrinsic SVG dimensions must never push the portrait's grid track outward. */
.portrait-stage { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; }
.portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { width: 100%; max-width: 205px; min-width: 0; }
.age-ledger > summary { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 2; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #4c4843; }
/* Recipe disclosures fill the ledger width; their cards remain a separate grid. */
.recipe-tier { display: block; margin: 0 0 24px; font: inherit; }
@media (min-width: 761px) and (max-width: 999px) {
  .life-tools { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 22px; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #413e39; }
}
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .life-tools { display: none; }
}

/* Lives and legacies: work, care, travel, and the next household. */
.career-summary,.health-summary { border-top: 2px solid #9f9280; }
.career-summary h2,.health-summary h2 { font-size: 31px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.career-stats,.travel-metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 18px; padding: 19px 0; margin: 19px 0; border-block: 1px solid #48443f; }
.career-stats > div,.travel-metrics > div { min-width: 0; }
.career-stats span,.travel-metrics span { display: block; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); color: #aca396; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .8px; }
.career-stats strong,.travel-metrics strong { display: block; font: 27px/1.5 var(--serif); color: #d0cac1; margin-top: 4px; }
.career-grid,.health-grid,.heir-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 21px 0 26px; }
.career-card,.health-card,.heir-card { min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 24px; margin: 0; border: 1px solid #4b4742; background: #1a1816; }
.career-card h3,.health-card h3,.heir-card h3 { font-size: 27px; margin: 12px 0; }
.career-card > p,.health-card > p,.heir-card > p { color: #bbb4aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
.career-rank,.health-kind,.health-status { font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); color: #b9aea0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .9px; }
.career-card.current { border-color: #998c7a; background: #22201e; }
.career-requirements { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; padding: 17px 0; margin: 12px 0 18px; border-block: 1px solid #423f3a; }
.career-requirements > span { color: #b4aca2; font: 11px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.career-card > .button:last-child,.heir-card > .button:last-child { margin-top: auto; }
.career-project { border-top: 3px solid #9f9280; background-color: #201e1c; }
.career-history,.lineage-list { display: grid; gap: 0; }
.business-panel { border-color: #6e6253; background-color: #1c1b19; }
.health-card.physical { border-left: 2px solid #ad9870; }
.health-card.mental,.health-card.wellbeing { border-left: 2px solid #9b968f; }
.health-card.recovering { border-color: #7d7264; }
.health-symptoms { margin: 7px 0 20px; padding: 14px 0 14px 19px; border-block: 1px solid #43403c; color: #c2bcb3; font: 15px/1.9 var(--serif); }
.health-symptoms li { padding-left: 2px; }
.health-symptoms li::marker { color: #9e9384; }
.care-options { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 17px; }
.care-options .button { flex: 1 1 170px; }
.care-support { border-left: 2px solid #9f9280; padding: 15px 18px; background: #22201d; color: #c0b9b0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
.legacy-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr); padding: 0; overflow: hidden; border-color: #6a6053; background: #191816; }
.legacy-hero > div:not(.dynasty-illustration) { min-width: 0; padding: 28px; align-self: center; }
.legacy-hero h2 { font-size: 34px; margin: 0 0 15px; }
.legacy-hero p { color: #beb7ae; font: 16px/1.9 var(--serif); }
.dynasty-illustration { min-width: 0; min-height: 295px; background: #141311 url('__HO_ASSET_4be1ee519336ef32_0737__') center / cover no-repeat; border-left: 1px solid #595146; }
.legacy-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(280px,.7fr); gap: 24px; align-items: start; }
.generation-card,.legacy-record { position: relative; min-width: 0; padding: 25px 0 25px 28px; border-left: 1px solid #5b5349; border-bottom: 1px solid #3d3a35; }
.generation-card::before,.legacy-record::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 7px; height: 7px; left: -4px; top: 36px; background: #9f9280; }
.generation-card:last-child,.legacy-record:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.generation-number { font: 10px/1.8 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #aa9d8d; }
.generation-card h3,.legacy-record h3 { margin: 9px 0 14px; font-size: 28px; }
.generation-card p,.legacy-record p { font: 15px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #bcb5ac; }
.heir-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; min-width: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.heir-heading > .fantasy-avatar { width: 61px; flex: 0 0 61px; }
.heir-heading > div:not(.fantasy-avatar) { min-width: 0; }
.heir-heading h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 25px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.heir-heading small { display: block; color: #b0a99f; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.heir-card.eligible { border-color: #7e7262; background: #201e1b; }
.inheritance-list { display: grid; margin: 14px 0; }
.inheritance-list > div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #413d38; color: #bbb3a9; font-size: 13px; }
.inheritance-list strong { color: #cbc3b9; font-weight: 400; text-align: right; }
.travel-plan { border-color: #6c6254; background-color: #1b1917; }
.travel-plan h3 { font-size: 27px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.travel-plan fieldset { min-width: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; border: 0; }
.travel-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 18px 0; }
.travel-option,.travel-options > label { display: flex; align-items: center; min-width: 0; padding: 9px 10px; gap: 10px; color: #beb7ad; border: 1px solid #4e4a44; background: #171614; cursor: pointer; }
.travel-option:has(input:checked),.travel-options > label:has(input:checked) { background: #2d2a26; border-color: #998c7b; }
.travel-option input,.travel-options > label input { flex-shrink: 0; }
.travel-option > span,.travel-options > label > span { min-width: 0; }
.travel-option strong,.travel-options > label strong { display: block; font: 600 19px/1.4 var(--serif); }
.travel-option small,.travel-options > label small { display: block; color: #aea79e; font: 12px/1.75 var(--sans); margin-top: 5px; }
.travel-summary { padding-top: 18px; margin-top: 21px; border-top: 1px solid #4d4841; }
.travel-summary p { color: #bdb5aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
.travel-risk { color: #d2ab87; border-left: 2px solid #a16345; padding: 13px 15px; background: #261e14; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; }
.journey-leg-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 19px 0 0; }
.journey-leg { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #48443e; color: #aea69b; font-size: 13px; }
.journey-leg strong { font: 600 19px/1.4 var(--serif); color: #c2bbb2; }
.journey-leg.complete { color: #968c7e; }
.journey-leg.current { color: #c5bbad; }
.audio-settings { border-top: 1px solid #514d47; margin-top: 23px; padding-top: 23px; }
.audio-settings h3 { font-size: 25px; margin-bottom: 9px; }
.audio-settings p { color: #aea69c; font: 12px/1.8 var(--sans); margin-bottom: 15px; }
.audio-toggle { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
.audio-volume { margin-top: 18px; }
.audio-volume > label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; color: #b6ac9f; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); margin-bottom: 5px; }
input[type=range] { appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; min-height: 46px; padding: 0; background: transparent; border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track { height: 5px; background: #4f4b45; border: 1px solid #6f6558; }
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb { appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; height: 20px; width: 15px; margin-top: -8px; background: #baafa0; border: 1px solid #c8bfb4; border-radius: 0; }
input[type=range]::-moz-range-track { height: 4px; background: #4f4b45; border: 1px solid #6f6558; }
input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb { height: 18px; width: 13px; background: #baafa0; border: 1px solid #c8bfb4; border-radius: 0; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  .menu-drawer { animation: open-folio .19s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
  .toast:not([hidden]) { animation: reveal-note .16s ease-out; }
  .map-node-pin { transition: color .15s,border-color .15s,background .15s,transform .15s; }
  .map-node:hover .map-node-pin { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .bar-ink { transition: width .23s ease-out; }
}

/* v9cartography: an engraved regional chart, using the saved travel geometry. */
.v9-cartography { background: #1d1c1a; border-color: #6d675e; }
.v9-cartography .map-toolbar { background: #1b1a18; border-color: #5b554d; }
.v9-cartography .map-toolbar strong { color: #c9c2b8; }
.map-atlas-subtitle { display: block; font: italic 13px/1.5 var(--serif); color: #979188; margin-top: 3px; }
.v9-cartography .map-terrain { background: #1d1c1a; }
.map-open-water { fill: #191715; }
.map-shore-shadow { fill: none; stroke: #6c665f; stroke-width: 17; stroke-opacity: .16; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.map-shore-surf { fill: none; stroke: #89847d; stroke-width: 8; stroke-opacity: .24; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.map-landmass { fill: #262421; }
.map-shoreline { fill: none; stroke: #8e877e; stroke-width: 1.25; stroke-opacity: .75; }
.v9-cartography .map-biome { stroke-width: .7; stroke-opacity: .23; fill-opacity: .8; }
.v9-cartography .map-print-hatch { opacity: .55; }
.map-elevation-contour { fill: none; stroke: #898177; stroke-width: .65; stroke-opacity: .2; stroke-dasharray: 3 2; }
.map-river-bank { fill: none; stroke: #908980; stroke-opacity: .3; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.map-river-water { fill: none; stroke: #1c1916; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.map-river-current { fill: none; stroke: #968f86; stroke-width: .7; stroke-opacity: .7; stroke-dasharray: 8 13; }
.map-ridge-back { fill: none; stroke: #100f0d; stroke-width: 19; stroke-opacity: .25; stroke-linecap: round; }
.map-ridge-crest { fill: none; stroke: #877f74; stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-opacity: .6; }
.map-ridge-hachures { fill: none; stroke: #8c857c; stroke-width: .8; stroke-opacity: .45; }
.map-countryside { opacity: .86; }
.map-field-boundary { fill: #877d6f; fill-opacity: .09; stroke: #988f82; stroke-width: .7; stroke-opacity: .38; }
.map-field-furrows { fill: none; stroke: #877f74; stroke-width: .6; stroke-opacity: .5; }
.map-settlement-engraving { opacity: .83; }
.map-road-shadow { fill: none; stroke: #0c0b0a; stroke-width: 5.5; stroke-opacity: .6; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.v9-cartography .map-road { stroke: #b0a178; stroke-width: 2; stroke-opacity: .85; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; filter: none; }
.v9-cartography .map-road.closed { stroke: #ad7855; stroke-dasharray: 5 7; }
.v9-cartography .map-road.ferry { stroke: #97918a; stroke-dasharray: 3 8; }
.v9-cartography .map-road-warning { fill: none; stroke: #c18d61; stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-opacity: .9; }
.v9-cartography .map-selected-route { stroke: #d09b64; stroke-width: 3.8; stroke-opacity: .95; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-linecap: round; }
.v9-cartography .map-region-label { fill: #b2a99d; opacity: .7; font: 12px var(--serif); font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: 2px; paint-order: stroke; stroke: #1d1c1a; stroke-width: 3; stroke-linejoin: round; }
.v9-cartography .map-label-water { fill: #a49e95; stroke: #191715; }
.map-water-label { fill: #b1aca6; font: italic 11px var(--serif); letter-spacing: .5px; paint-order: stroke; stroke: #201e1c; stroke-width: 2.5; }
.map-scale-rule { fill: none; stroke: #968c81; stroke-width: .7; opacity: .6; }
.map-scale-rule text { fill: #aca59c; stroke: none; font: 8px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .5px; }
.v9-cartography .map-node-pin { border-color: #90867a; background: #1f1e1cef; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #171614a6; }
.v9-cartography .map-node-label { left: calc(50% + var(--map-caption-x,0px)); top: calc(50% + var(--map-caption-y,37px)); transform: translate(-50%,-50%); max-width: 142px; color: #cac3ba; background: #1d1c1aed; border-color: #56514a; box-shadow: 0 1px 5px #090807a6; }
.v9-cartography .map-node.current .map-node-label,.v9-cartography .map-node.selected .map-node-label { color: #f0dec0; border-color: #a58a5c; }
.v9-cartography .map-caption-leader { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 46px; height: 46px; overflow: visible; pointer-events: none; fill: none; stroke: #8b8378; stroke-width: .8; stroke-opacity: .6; }
.v9-cartography.compact .map-caption-leader { display: none; }
.v9-cartography .map-node-pin { z-index: 1; }
.v9-cartography .map-node-label { z-index: 2; }
.v9-cartography .map-legend { background: #1c1a18; color: #b2aca4; border-color: #5b554d; }
.v9-cartography .legend-ferry { background: #989289; height: 2px; width: 12px; }
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .v9-cartography:not(.compact) .map-canvas { min-width: 720px; }
  .v9-cartography .map-toolbar strong { font-size: 22px; }
  .v9-cartography .map-atlas-subtitle { font-size: 12px; }
}
@keyframes open-folio { from { opacity: .7; transform: translateX(16px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); } }
@keyframes reveal-note { from { opacity: 0; translate: 0 3px; } to { opacity: 1; translate: 0 0; } }
@media (max-width: 1040px) {
  .legacy-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .legacy-hero { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .dynasty-illustration { min-height: 300px; }
}
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .career-grid,.health-grid,.heir-grid,.travel-options { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .career-card,.health-card,.heir-card { padding: 22px 19px; }
  .career-summary h2,.health-summary h2 { font-size: 29px; }
  .career-stats,.travel-metrics { gap: 12px; }
  .career-stats strong,.travel-metrics strong { font-size: 24px; }
  .career-stats span,.travel-metrics span { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .4px; }
  .legacy-hero { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .legacy-hero > div:not(.dynasty-illustration) { padding: 26px 22px; }
  .legacy-hero h2 { font-size: 31px; }
  .legacy-hero p { font-size: 15px; }
  .dynasty-illustration { width: 100%; min-height: 240px; border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid #595146; background-position: center; }
  .generation-card,.legacy-record { padding-left: 19px; }
  .generation-card h3,.legacy-record h3 { font-size: 25px; }
  .care-options { flex-direction: column; }
  .care-options .button { flex: auto; width: 100%; }
  .travel-option { padding: 8px 10px; }
  .journey-leg { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .audio-toggle { gap: 13px; }
  .audio-settings p { font-size: 12px; }
}

/* The working and family records share the book's quiet ledger rhythm. */
.career-progress-pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 9px 18px; margin: 22px 0; }
.career-progress-pair > .stat-row:first-child { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
.career-progress-pair > .meter:nth-child(2) { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; }
.career-progress-pair > .stat-row:nth-child(3) { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
.career-progress-pair > .meter:nth-child(4) { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; }
.career-progress-pair .stat-row { align-items: start; gap: 9px; margin: 0; }
.career-staff-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 22px 0; }
.career-staff { min-width: 0; padding: 18px 0; border-block: 1px solid #574e43; }
.career-staff h3 { font-size: 23px; }
.staff-terms { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; color: #b3aa9f; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.health-summary .wellbeing-stat > .stat-row { display: none; }
.health-summary .wellbeing-stat > strong { font-size: 26px; }
.health-summary .wellbeing-stat > span { line-height: 1.7; letter-spacing: .7px; }
.health-summary .wellbeing-stat > .meter { margin-bottom: 14px; }
.health-symptoms:not(ul) { padding-left: 0; }
.health-card .health-since { color: #a8a096; font: 11px/1.75 var(--mono); }
.care-routines { margin-top: 21px; border-top: 1px solid #48443e; }
.care-routines > div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; padding: 13px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #3c3935; }
.care-routines strong { color: #c1b8ab; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
.care-routines span { color: #a8a095; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); text-align: right; }
.care-support { margin-bottom: 24px; }
.child-traits { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 17px 0; padding: 15px 0; border-block: 1px solid #47433e; }
.child-traits span { display: block; color: #b0a89d; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
.child-traits strong { display: block; margin-top: 4px; color: #cac1b6; font: 25px/1.4 var(--serif); }
.child-skills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px 13px; margin: 0 0 17px; color: #b0a79c; font: 11px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.child-skills strong { font-weight: 400; color: #cac1b6; }
.child-learning-record { margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 0; }
.child-learning-record > summary { font-size: 10px; }
.legacy-chronicle { padding-top: 18px; color: #bcb4aa; font: 16px/1.9 var(--serif); }
.legacy-continuation > .offered-action { max-width: 360px; }
.view-attention > .button { margin-left: 7px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .career-staff-list { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 7px; }
  .career-progress-pair { display: block; }
  .career-progress-pair > .stat-row { margin: 15px 0 8px; }
  .career-progress-pair > .meter { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .health-summary .wellbeing-stat > strong { font-size: 22px; }
  .health-summary .wellbeing-stat > span { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .3px; }
  .care-routines > div { display: block; }
  .care-routines span { display: block; margin-top: 3px; text-align: left; }
  .view-attention > .button { display: flex; margin: 10px 0 0; justify-content: flex-start; }
}

/* Playtest: keep everyday interaction readable and stable on a phone. */
.calling-group > summary { display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: center; padding: 18px 2px; }
.calling-group > summary > span:first-child { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.calling-group > summary small { display: block; color: #afa89f; font: 12px/1.8 var(--sans); letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; margin-top: 7px; }
.calling-group > summary .badge { flex: 0 0 auto; }
.calling-group .calling-grid { margin: 0 0 20px; }
.calling-steps { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin-top: 15px; }
.calling-card .offered-action { margin-top: 15px; }
.calling-card .offered-action .button { margin: 0; }
.calling-card .offered-action small { display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: #afa89e; font: 12px/1.7 var(--sans); }
.conversation-thread .social-actions { display: block; }
.conversation-thread .social-actions .quick-actions { margin-top: 0; }
.conversation-thread .social-actions .activity-row { border: 1px solid #413d38; }
.view-attention { line-height: 1.8; }

.living-cost-note { display: block; color: #aca397; font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.7 var(--sans); margin-top: 8px; }
.household-priorities > h3 { font-size: 24px; margin: 23px 0 12px; }
.household-budget .career-stats strong { font-size: 23px; }

/* Lives beyond the main quest: readable agreements, wishes and public works. */
.roleplay-section { margin: 30px 0; min-width: 0; }
.roleplay-section > .section-heading { align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
.roleplay-section .career-grid, .adoption-section .heir-grid { margin-top: 16px; }
.roleplay-section .panel { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.roleplay-section .panel > .button { margin-top: 10px; }
.known-preferences { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }
.known-preferences > div { border: 1px solid #413d38; padding: 13px; }
.known-preferences span, .known-preferences strong, .known-preferences small { display: block; }
.known-preferences span, .known-preferences small { font: 11px/1.8 var(--sans); color: #b3ada4; }
.known-preferences strong { margin: 5px 0; color: #dad1c5; }
.learning-project-records article { border-top: 1px solid #413d38; padding: 14px 0; }
.learning-project-records article h3 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0; }
.experience-commitment, .expedition-purpose { border-left: 3px solid #a0917e; }
.expedition-purpose { padding: 15px 18px; margin: 20px 0; background: #1c1a18; }
.expedition-purpose h3 { font-size: 25px; margin: 8px 0; }
.community-ambition > .meter { margin: 16px 0; }
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .roleplay-section { margin: 22px 0; }
  .roleplay-section > .section-heading { display: block; }
  .roleplay-section > .section-heading > .badge { margin-top: 10px; }
  .known-preferences { gap: 8px; }
  .known-preferences > div { padding: 10px; }
  .expedition-purpose { padding: 13px; }
}

/* v9lifeUI: familiar faces, hearth-side news and the hours between. */
.social-life-section,.pastime-section { padding: 23px 25px; border: 1px solid #484540; background: linear-gradient(115deg,#1c1b19,#181715); }
.social-life-section > .section-heading,.pastime-section > .section-heading { margin-bottom: 19px; }
.social-life-section h2,.pastime-section h2 { font-size: 30px; margin: 7px 0 0; }
.life-ui-empty { color: #b6b0a7; font: 15px/1.85 var(--serif); margin: 14px 0 21px; }
.social-circles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 15px; }
.social-circle { min-width: 0; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #3f3c37; background: #171614; }
.social-circle h3 { margin: 0 0 13px; color: #beb6ab; font-size: 20px; }
.social-circle-people { display: grid; gap: 5px; }
.social-person-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; width: 100%; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 8px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: #d0c8bd; font: 13px/1.6 var(--sans); text-align: left; cursor: pointer; }
.social-person-link > .fantasy-avatar { flex: 0 0 36px; width: 36px; height: 36px; }
.social-person-link > span:first-of-type { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.social-person-arrow { margin-left: auto; color: #a29687; font-size: 19px; }
.social-person-link:hover { background: #2c2926; }
.social-person-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #a99c8a; outline-offset: 2px; }
.social-person-link.small { width: auto; min-width: 46px; min-height: 46px; flex: 0 1 auto; padding: 4px 0; font-size: 13px; }
.social-person-link.small .social-person-arrow { display: none; }
.social-known-name { color: #d0c8bd; font: 13px/1.6 var(--sans); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.social-ties { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0 20px; margin: 16px 0; }
.social-tie { min-width: 0; border-top: 1px solid #403d39; padding: 11px 0 15px; }
.social-tie-people { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 9px; }
.social-tie-thread { color: #806d49; flex: 0 0 auto; }
.social-tie-label { display: block; color: #aca193; font: 10px/1.8 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .6px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.social-tie p { font: 14px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #bbb5ac; margin: 5px 0 0; }
.social-hearth-notes { padding-top: 13px; }
.social-hearth-notes h3 { margin: 3px 0 16px; font-size: 24px; }
.social-hearth-notes ol { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
.social-notice { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 13px; padding: 15px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3e3b38; }
.social-note-mark { flex: 0 0 14px; color: #8b7e6e; font-size: 13px; padding-top: 2px; }
.social-notice > div { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
.social-notice-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.social-notice-heading strong { color: #cbc2b7; font: 15px/1.7 var(--serif); }
.social-notice-heading time,.pastime-records time { color: #9c9388; font: 10px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.social-notice p { margin: 5px 0 0; font: 14px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #bcb6ad; }
.life-ui-disclosure { margin: 17px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid #46433e; }
.life-ui-disclosure > summary { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; min-height: 48px; padding: 12px 0; color: #c2b9ae; font: 12px/1.8 var(--sans); cursor: pointer; }
.life-ui-disclosure > summary::after { content: '+'; color: #a19687; font-size: 18px; margin-left: auto; }
.life-ui-disclosure[open] > summary::after { content: '−'; }
.life-ui-disclosure > summary > span { font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); color: #9f968a; }
.life-ui-disclosure > .quick-actions { margin-top: 0; }
.social-life-section .quick-actions,.pastime-section .quick-actions { margin-bottom: 0; }
.social-life-section .activity-row,.pastime-section .activity-row { border-inline: 1px solid #3c3935; }
.pastime-cards { display: grid; gap: 13px; }
.pastime-card { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 18px; min-width: 0; padding: 15px 0; border-top: 1px solid #413e39; }
.pastime-card > div { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
.pastime-emblem { flex: 0 0 38px; width: 38px; height: 38px; margin-top: 4px; color: #a99d8e; }
.pastime-card-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.pastime-card h3 { color: #d4ccc1; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
.pastime-card p { margin: 6px 0 9px; color: #bab4ab; font: 14px/1.85 var(--serif); }
.pastime-card small { color: #a0978b; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.pastime-active { color: #b2a799; font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.pastime-pet { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 18px; min-width: 0; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid #47433e; }
.pastime-pet > div:last-child { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
.pastime-pet-portrait { flex: 0 0 62px; height: 70px; border: 1px solid #585148; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #baafa1; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%,#322f2b,#1a1917); }
.pastime-pet-portrait svg { width: 46px; height: 46px; }
.pastime-pet h3 { font-size: 26px; margin: 6px 0 0; }
.pastime-pet p { margin: 7px 0 0; color: #bab3a9; font: 14px/1.8 var(--serif); }
.pastime-pet .pastime-pet-meta { color: #a99f92; font: 10px/1.8 var(--mono); margin: 3px 0 10px; }
.pastime-pet.remembered .pastime-pet-portrait { opacity: .65; }
.pastime-records { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
.pastime-records li { padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3d3a35; }
.pastime-records li > div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.pastime-records strong { color: #c8c0b5; font: 15px/1.7 var(--serif); }
.pastime-records p { color: #b8b0a6; font: 14px/1.9 var(--serif); margin: 5px 0 0; }
.pastime-section.compact { margin-top: 20px; }
.pastime-section.compact { padding: 16px 18px; }
.pastime-section.compact > .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.pastime-section.compact > .section-heading > .badge { margin-top: 0; }
.pastime-section.compact h2 { font-size: 24px; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-card { padding: 12px 0; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-card p,.pastime-section.compact .pastime-active { display: none; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-card small { display: block; margin-top: 6px; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-emblem { flex-basis: 27px; width: 27px; height: 27px; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-pet { align-items: center; padding: 12px 0; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-pet .eyebrow,.pastime-section.compact .pastime-pet p:not(.pastime-pet-meta) { display: none; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-pet h3 { font-size: 23px; margin-top: 0; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-pet .pastime-pet-meta { margin: 3px 0 0; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-pet-portrait { flex-basis: 43px; height: 49px; }
.pastime-section.compact .pastime-pet-portrait svg { width: 35px; height: 35px; }
.pastime-section.compact .quick-actions { margin-top: 8px; }
.pastime-section.compact .activity-row { padding: 10px 9px; }
.pastime-section.compact .activity-copy > span { display: none; }
.pastime-section.compact > .button { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .social-life-section,.pastime-section { padding: 20px 17px; }
  .social-circles,.social-ties { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .social-circle { padding: 13px; }
  .social-circle-people { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 3px 8px; }
  .social-person-link { gap: 7px; padding-inline: 2px; font-size: 12px; }
  .social-person-link > .fantasy-avatar { flex-basis: 30px; width: 30px; height: 30px; }
  .social-tie-people { gap: 6px; }
  .social-tie-people .social-person-link { font-size: 13px; }
  .social-life-section h2,.pastime-section h2 { font-size: 27px; }
  .pastime-emblem { flex-basis: 31px; width: 31px; height: 31px; }
  .pastime-card { gap: 13px; }
  .pastime-card h3 { font-size: 22px; }
  .pastime-pet { gap: 14px; }
  .pastime-pet-portrait { flex-basis: 54px; height: 63px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  .social-person-link { transition: background-color .18s ease; }
}

/* The threshold: title, save chambers, and the making of a soul. */
:root {
  --game-black: #0b0a09;
  --game-dark: #131211;
  --game-gold: #a3976d;
  --game-brass: #696055;
  --game-parchment: #ded5b8;
  --game-dim: #8e8881;
  --game-frame: #44413d;
}
body.title-mode, body.creation-mode { background: var(--game-black); }
body.title-mode #app, body.creation-mode #app { min-height: 100dvh; }
button { transition: color .15s, background-color .15s, border-color .15s; }
.title-screen, .menu-screen {
  position: relative;
  isolation: isolate;
  min-height: 100dvh;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--game-parchment);
  background: #0c0c0b;
}
.title-backdrop {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: -3;
  inset: 0;
  background: #11100e url('__HO_ASSET_3aebaefa7d87a0db_0738__') 62% 50% / cover no-repeat;
}
.title-backdrop::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #080706e8 0%, #09090899 32%, #09090810 62%, #07060540 100%);
}
.title-vignette {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: -2;
  inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 68% 40%, transparent 24%, #040403a1 93%), linear-gradient(0deg, #070605e8 0%, transparent 28%, transparent 78%, #06060580);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.title-screen::after, .menu-screen::after, .creator-screen::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 16px;
  border: 1px solid #78716830;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #0505041a, inset 0 0 0 5px #78716815;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: -1;
}
.title-topline, .title-bottomline {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 1;
  left: 42px;
  right: 42px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
  color: #8e8881;
  font: 9px/1.6 var(--mono);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 2.6px;
}
.title-topline { top: 37px; }
.title-topline > span:last-child { color: #9c9284; letter-spacing: 1.6px; }
.title-content {
  position: relative;
  width: min(600px, 47vw);
  padding: clamp(120px, 16vh, 160px) 0 104px;
  margin-left: clamp(64px, 8vw, 138px);
}
.title-crest { width: 34px; color: #aca193; margin: 0 0 23px 3px; font: 33px/1 var(--serif); }
.title-crest svg { width: 36px; height: 48px; }
.title-wordmark {
  margin: 0;
  color: #d5cec4;
  font: 400 clamp(68px, 6.7vw, 110px)/.93 var(--serif);
  letter-spacing: -.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-shadow: 0 2px 22px #0009;
}
.title-wordmark > span { display: block; }
.title-wordmark .ampersand, .title-wordmark em { color: #8d8476; font-weight: 400; font-size: .7em; font-style: italic; }
.title-wordmark > span + span { margin-top: 9px; }
.title-wordmark > small { display: inline; font-size: .7em; color: #92887d; }
.title-tagline {
  max-width: 340px;
  margin: 28px 0 33px 4px;
  color: #aba6a0;
  font: italic 15px/1.7 var(--serif);
  letter-spacing: .15px;
}
.title-menu { width: min(355px,100%); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; margin-left: -11px; }
.title-menu-item {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  width: 100%;
  gap: 17px;
  min-height: 52px;
  padding: 12px 17px;
  color: #bfb9b1;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: transparent;
  text-align: left;
  font: 400 21px/1.3 var(--serif);
  letter-spacing: .5px;
}
.title-menu-item .menu-index { font: 9px/1.4 var(--mono); color: #767069; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.title-menu-item .menu-arrow { margin-left: auto; color: #a1978a; font-size: 21px; opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-6px); transition: opacity .15s, transform .15s; }
.title-menu-item:hover, .title-menu-item:focus-visible, .title-menu-item.selected {
  color: #dbd2c7;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3a373255, #3a373215);
  border-color: #786f6240;
}
.title-menu-item:hover .menu-arrow, .title-menu-item:focus-visible .menu-arrow, .title-menu-item.selected .menu-arrow { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
.title-menu-item:hover .menu-index, .title-menu-item:focus-visible .menu-index { color: #b3a898; }
.title-menu-item:disabled { color: #6c6863; }
.title-menu-item:disabled .menu-index { color: #54514c; }
.title-bottomline { bottom: 36px; color: #7a746d; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.4px; }
.title-bottomline p { margin: 0; }
.title-settings { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
.title-settings .button { color: #ada79e; border: 1px solid #68615755; background: #100f0ea6; min-height: 34px; min-width: 34px; padding: 8px 12px; font: 9px/1.4 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.title-settings .button:hover { color: #d8cec2; border-color: #908577; background: #201e1bcc; }
.title-settings > span { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
.menu-screen { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 80px 30px 60px; }
.menu-screen .title-backdrop { filter: brightness(.45); }
.menu-screen .title-vignette { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#0b0b0aeb 0%,#0b0b0a99 50%,#0b0b0a66); }
.menu-panel {
  position: relative;
  width: min(720px,100%);
  margin: auto;
  padding: 33px 42px 39px;
  border-block: 1px solid #6c645a45;
  background: linear-gradient(100deg, #151412de, #100f0ed6);
  box-shadow: 0 24px 80px #0005;
}
.menu-panel::before, .menu-panel::after { content: '◆'; position: absolute; left: calc(50% - 5px); color: #887e71; font-size: 9px; }
.menu-panel::before { top: -8px; }
.menu-panel::after { bottom: -8px; }
.menu-panel .eyebrow { color: #988e81; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
.menu-panel h1 { color: #d4ccc2; font: 400 45px/1.1 var(--serif); margin: 10px 0 16px; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
.menu-panel > p { color: #a8a29b; font: 15px/1.8 var(--serif); }
.menu-panel > .button { margin-top: 18px; }
.menu-panel .button.ghost { padding-left: 0; font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono); }
.slot-list { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin-top: 29px; }
.save-slot {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  width: 100%;
  gap: 18px;
  min-height: 114px;
  padding: 14px 19px;
  color: #c7c0b6;
  background: #18171577;
  border: 1px solid #564f45;
  border-radius: 0;
  text-align: left;
}
button.save-slot:hover { background: #23201db0; border-color: #948879; }
.slot-number { color: #93897b; font: 10px/1.8 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 1px; min-width: 30px; align-self: flex-start; padding-top: 3px; }
.slot-portrait { flex: 0 0 49px; width: 49px; height: 72px; overflow: hidden; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #635b50; background: #0f0e0c; color: #887e71; }
.slot-portrait .fantasy-avatar { width: 48px; }
.slot-portrait svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.slot-info { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
.slot-info strong { display: block; color: #d1c9bf; font: 400 24px/1.3 var(--serif); margin-bottom: 5px; }
.slot-info small, .slot-info > span { display: block; color: #9f988e; font: 10px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.slot-info p { margin: 3px 0 0; color: #857e74; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.empty-slot { background: #14131150; border-style: dashed; border-color: #4a4742; color: #a0988e; min-height: 95px; }
.empty-slot .slot-info strong { color: #ada59a; font-size: 22px; }
.empty-slot .slot-portrait { border-style: dashed; font-size: 25px; color: #72695e; border-color: #494540; }
.slot-tools { display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; }
.slot-tools .button { min-height: 37px; min-width: 37px; padding: 7px 10px; font: 9px/1.6 var(--mono); }
.menu-panel .slot-tools .button { padding-inline: 10px; }
.menu-panel .save-warning { margin: 20px 0 0; color: #b7a686; font: 12px/1.8 var(--serif); }
.menu-panel label { color: #a9a299; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.menu-panel input[type=range] { padding: 0; }

/* An original etched effigy is dressed in a dedicated character forge. */
.creator-screen {
  position: relative;
  isolation: isolate;
  min-height: 100dvh;
  padding: 28px clamp(30px,5vw,90px) 28px;
  color: #ccc4b9;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 25% 48%,#211f1c53,transparent 50%), radial-gradient(#e8dbc307 .7px,transparent .8px) 0 0 / 4px 4px, #100f0e;
}
.creator-topline { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; min-height: 46px; padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #5f584f55; }
.creator-topline .button { padding: 8px 0; min-height: 35px; color: #aea79d; font: 9px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.1px; }
.creator-topline .button:hover { background: transparent; border-color: transparent; color: #e0d5af; }
.creator-topline .eyebrow { color: #9e9385; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0; }
.creator-topline h1, .creator-topline strong { font: 400 20px/1.2 var(--serif); letter-spacing: .1px; margin: 0; color: #cdc4b9; }
.creator-steps { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0; width: min(840px,100%); margin: 24px auto 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid #484540; }
.creator-step { position: relative; flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 11px; min-height: 44px; padding: 8px 13px 14px; background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; color: #7e776e; font: 10px/1.5 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.1px; }
.creator-step > span:first-child { color: #665f56; font-size: 9px; }
.creator-step.active, .creator-step[aria-current=step], .creator-step[aria-selected=true] { color: #c6bcaf; border-bottom-color: #998e80; background: linear-gradient(0deg,#685f5216,transparent); }
.creator-step.active > span:first-child, .creator-step[aria-current=step] > span:first-child { color: #a99d8d; }
.creator-step:hover { color: #beb6ac; background: #2a272322; }
.creator-workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(250px,.88fr) minmax(0,1.22fr); width: min(1180px,100%); margin: 0 auto; gap: clamp(30px,4vw,65px); align-items: start; }
.creator-portrait { position: relative; min-width: 0; text-align: center; padding: 3px 0 0; }
.creator-portrait-stage { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 470px; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#2b292650,#14131130 60%,transparent); border: 1px solid #665c4e48; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 5px #0f0e0d, inset 0 0 0 6px #58504542; }
.creator-portrait-stage::before, .creator-portrait-stage::after { content: '✦'; position: absolute; left: calc(50% - 5px); color: #867c6f; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1; z-index: 2; }
.creator-portrait-stage::before { top: -6px; }
.creator-portrait-stage::after { bottom: -6px; }
.creator-plate-caption { padding: 19px 13px 0; margin: 0; color: #948d83; font: 9px/1.9 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .7px; }
.creator-plate-caption h2, .creator-plate-caption strong { display: block; color: #c2b9ad; font: 400 25px/1.3 var(--serif); letter-spacing: 0; margin-bottom: 7px; }
.creator-plate-caption small { display: block; color: #837c72; font: 9px/1.9 var(--mono); }
.creator-controls { min-width: 0; padding: 11px 0 4px; }
.creator-fieldset { min-width: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
.creator-intro { margin-bottom: 24px; }
.creator-intro .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1.6px; color: #9f9486; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.creator-intro h1, .creator-intro h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font: 400 36px/1.13 var(--serif); color: #d6cec3; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
.creator-intro p { max-width: 520px; font: 15px/1.75 var(--serif); color: #aca69e; margin: 0; }
.creator-control-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 17px 16px; }
.creator-control-grid .field { gap: 6px; color: #a69e94; }
.creator-control-grid .field.full, .creator-control-grid .creator-full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.creator-control-grid label, .creator-control-grid .field > span { color: #928a7f; font: 9px/1.5 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .8px; }
.creator-screen input, .creator-screen select, .creator-screen textarea { min-height: 42px; padding: 9px 11px; color: #cac0b4; background: #151412; border-color: #4e4a44; font: 14px/1.5 var(--serif); }
.creator-screen input:hover, .creator-screen select:hover { border-color: #867b6d; }
.creator-screen input:focus, .creator-screen select:focus { border-color: #a49787; background: #1b1916; }
.creator-screen input::placeholder { color: #706a62; }
.creator-screen select { padding-right: 30px; }
.creator-screen .field > small { color: #827c73; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.creator-section-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; margin: 25px 0 12px; padding-top: 17px; border-top: 1px solid #46423d; }
.creator-section-heading h3 { margin: 0; color: #b6ada3; font: 400 20px/1.3 var(--serif); }
.creator-section-heading > span, .creator-section-heading > small { color: #847c72; font: 9px/1.5 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .7px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.creator-option-group { padding: 0; margin: 20px 0 0; border: 0; }
.creator-option-group legend { width: 100%; padding: 0 0 11px; color: #a49b90; font: 9px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
.creator-choice-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 8px; }
.creator-choice { position: relative; min-width: 0; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 7px; min-height: 94px; padding: 13px 10px; background: #191715; color: #b4aca2; border: 1px solid #48443e; cursor: pointer; }
.creator-choice:hover { background: #25221e; border-color: #7e7467; }
.creator-choice:has(input:checked) { background: #2b2823; border-color: #9b9082; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #141210; }
.creator-choice input[type=radio] { flex: 0 0 20px; width: 20px; min-width: 20px; height: 26px; min-height: 26px; padding: 0; margin: -3px 0 0; }
.creator-choice-text { min-width: 0; }
.creator-choice-text strong { display: block; font: 400 16px/1.35 var(--serif); margin: 0 0 5px; color: #c6beb4; }
.creator-choice-text small, .creator-choice-text > span { display: block; font: 10px/1.5 var(--serif); color: #a0978b; }
.creator-random { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 37px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #675f54; background: #1c1916; color: #b2a89b; font: 9px/1.4 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .5px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.creator-random:hover { background: #2a2723; border-color: #988b7b; color: #d7cec2; }
.creator-random svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
.creator-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; max-width: 1180px; margin: 28px auto 0; padding-top: 19px; border-top: 1px solid #574f4577; }
.creator-footer > p, .creator-footer > span { margin: 0; color: #91897e; font: 9px/1.8 var(--mono); max-width: 380px; }
.creator-footer .button { min-height: 43px; padding: 12px 20px; font: 400 17px/1.2 var(--serif); letter-spacing: .2px; }
.creator-footer .button.primary { color: #d9cfc1; border-color: #867b6d; background: linear-gradient(#433e38,#302c27); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #131210; }
.creator-footer .button.primary:hover { background: linear-gradient(#5c5245,#3f3a34); border-color: #b5a896; }
.creator-review { margin-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid #585045; }
.creator-review-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 25px; padding: 13px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #403c37; color: #aaa196; font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono); }
.creator-review-row strong { text-align: right; color: #c7bfb4; font: 400 16px/1.4 var(--serif); }
.creator-review-row > span:first-child { color: #90877b; font-size: 9px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .9px; }
.creator-review + p, .creator-controls .creator-birth-note { margin: 18px 0 0; color: #a39a90; font: italic 13px/1.75 var(--serif); }

/* In play, the book is framed by a compact game HUD. */
body.game-mode { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 65% 40%,#201d1a38,transparent 75%),#0b0b0a; }
.app-shell.has-life { display: block; padding: 20px clamp(16px,2.1vw,36px) 20px; min-height: 100dvh; }
.app-shell.has-life::before { content: ''; position: fixed; pointer-events: none; inset: 10px; border: 1px solid #665e5330; z-index: 75; }
.app-shell.has-life .main-shell { width: 100%; max-width: 1460px; margin: auto; border: 1px solid #504c46; background: #100f0d; }
.app-shell.has-life .sidebar { position: relative; inset: auto; width: 100%; max-width: 1460px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 27px; padding: 0 24px; height: 68px; overflow: visible; border: 1px solid #504c46; border-bottom: 0; background: #0f0e0c; }
.app-shell.has-life .brand { flex: 0 0 169px; flex-direction: row; gap: 11px; padding: 0; text-align: left; }
.app-shell.has-life .brand-mark { width: 22px; height: 32px; margin: 0; color: #908577; font-size: 28px; }
.app-shell.has-life .brand-title { font: 400 17px/1.1 var(--serif); color: #cac2b8; letter-spacing: -.1px; white-space: nowrap; }
.app-shell.has-life .brand-title br { display: none; }
.app-shell.has-life .brand-subtitle { margin-top: 5px; font-size: 6px; letter-spacing: 1.25px; color: #7d766d; }
.app-shell.has-life .sidebar nav { flex: 1; flex-direction: row; gap: 0; height: 100%; align-items: stretch; }
.app-shell.has-life .nav-item { flex: 1; justify-content: center; padding: 10px 11px; min-height: 66px; gap: 9px; color: #948b81; font: 10px/1.5 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .8px; text-transform: uppercase; border: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; }
.app-shell.has-life .nav-item:hover { color: #c6bdb1; background: #24211c2e; }
.app-shell.has-life .nav-item.active { color: #cec4b8; background: linear-gradient(0deg,#695e5025,transparent); border-bottom-color: #978d80; box-shadow: none; }
.app-shell.has-life .nav-item > .ui-glyph { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-basis: 18px; color: currentColor; }
.app-shell.has-life .sidebar-label, .app-shell.has-life .sidebar-secondary, .app-shell.has-life .sidebar-footer { display: none; }
.app-shell.has-life .phone-header.game-header { position: relative; padding: 0 27px 17px; background: linear-gradient(0deg,#151412,#100f0e); border-bottom-color: #4f4a44; backdrop-filter: none; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark { min-height: 41px; margin-bottom: 13px; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-booktitle { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.35px; color: #867e75; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-booktitle small { font-size: 7px; color: #6e685f; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark .menu-trigger { width: 33px; min-width: 33px; height: 35px; min-height: 35px; padding: 7px; margin-left: -7px; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark .menu-trigger .ui-glyph { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark .header-resources { font-size: 10px; gap: 8px; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark .header-resources .button { min-width: 34px; width: 34px; min-height: 34px; height: 34px; padding: 5px; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-person .identity-bar { gap: 15px; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-person .identity-bar .fantasy-avatar { width: 44px; flex-basis: 44px; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-person .identity-bar strong { font: 400 25px/1.3 var(--serif); color: #cec5ba; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-person .identity-bar span span { font-size: 9px; color: #958d82; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place strong { font: 400 16px/1.3 var(--serif); color: #bbb2a6; }
.app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place small { font-size: 8px; }
.app-shell.has-life .status-bars { gap: 27px; margin-top: 15px; }
.app-shell.has-life .bar-caption { font-size: 8px; color: #958b7e; letter-spacing: 1px; }
.app-shell.has-life .bar-track { height: 4px; border: 0; background: #2c2925; }
.app-shell.has-life .bar-ink { background: #8d7f6c; }
.app-shell.has-life #main-content { padding: 27px; max-width: none; }
.app-shell.has-life .game-footer { display: none; }
.app-shell.has-life .view-heading h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400; }
.app-shell.has-life .view-heading p { font: 15px/1.75 var(--serif); color: #a29a8f; }
.app-shell.has-life .view-heading .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; }
.app-shell.has-life .panel { border-color: #423e39; background-color: #161514; background-image: radial-gradient(#b7ac9e06 .6px,transparent .8px); }
.app-shell.has-life .panel h2 { font-weight: 400; }
.app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.42fr) minmax(280px,.85fr); gap: 24px; }
.app-shell.has-life .feed-heading { padding: 20px 23px; }
.app-shell.has-life .feed-heading h2 { font: 400 26px/1.3 var(--serif); }
.app-shell.has-life .feed-heading .eyebrow { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.4px; }
.app-shell.has-life .feed-heading .button { font-size: 8px; }
.app-shell.has-life .age-ledger > summary { background: #211e1b; color: #b5aa9b; min-height: 44px; }
.app-shell.has-life .age-stamp { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; }
.app-shell.has-life .life-entry-heading strong { font-weight: 400; font-size: 19px; color: #c3bbb0; }
.app-shell.has-life .life-entry p { font: 16px/1.85 var(--serif); color: #b5ada2; }
.app-shell.has-life .life-entry-heading time { font-size: 8px; color: #898073; }
.app-shell.has-life .life-entry { border-left-color: #4d4841; border-bottom-color: #322f2a; }
.app-shell.has-life .life-actions-shortcuts { border-color: #4f4a43; }
.app-shell.has-life .life-actions-shortcuts .button { min-height: 54px; font: 9px/1.5 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; color: #ada396; background: #1d1a17; }
.app-shell.has-life .map-mini-panel { padding: 18px; }
.app-shell.has-life .map-mini-panel .section-heading { margin: 0 0 15px; }
.app-shell.has-life .map-mini-panel h3 { font-weight: 400; font-size: 25px; }
.app-shell.has-life .story-scene { border-top: 1px solid #817566; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#201d1a,#161513); }
.app-shell.has-life .story-scene h2 { font: 400 30px/1.2 var(--serif); color: #d4cbbf; }
.app-shell.has-life .story-body { font-size: 17px; color: #bdb6ac; }
.app-shell.has-life .choice-card { background: #1a1816; border-color: #48443e; padding: 15px 12px; }
.app-shell.has-life .choice-card:hover { background: #2e2b26; }
.app-shell.has-life .choice-card strong { font-weight: 400; color: #beb5a9; }
.app-shell.has-life .choice-description { color: #948b7f; font-size: 11px; }
.app-shell.has-life .activity-row { background: #181715; border-color: #403c36; }
.app-shell.has-life .activity-row:nth-child(even) { background: #151311; }
.app-shell.has-life .activity-row:hover { background: #292623; }
.app-shell.has-life .activity-copy strong { font-weight: 400; }
.app-shell.has-life .button.primary { color: #d5c9ba; border-color: #847869; background: #3e3a34; }
.app-shell.has-life .button.primary:hover { border-color: #b7a777; background: #524c45; }
.app-shell.has-life .desktop-age-button { background: linear-gradient(#61482b,#49361f); color: #e5d6ad; border-color: #9d8253; min-height: 44px; font-size: 17px; }
.app-shell.has-life .desktop-age-button:disabled { background: #24221f; color: #888279; border-color: #565047; }
.app-shell.has-life .desktop-age-reason { font-size: 8px; color: #90867a; }
body.game-mode .modal, body.title-mode .modal, body.creation-mode .modal { background: radial-gradient(#d4c6b308 .6px,transparent .8px) 0 0 / 4px 4px,#151412; border-color: #766d60; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px #0c0c0b,0 0 0 6px #685f5380,0 25px 85px #0009; }
body.game-mode .modal h2, body.title-mode .modal h2, body.creation-mode .modal h2 { font-weight: 400; color: #cac0b4; }
body.game-mode .toast, body.title-mode .toast, body.creation-mode .toast { font: 11px/1.7 var(--mono); border-color: #7c7264; background: #211f1c; color: #cac1b5; }

@media (min-width: 1600px) {
  .title-content { padding-top: 17vh; }
  .title-wordmark { font-size: 112px; }
  .title-menu { margin-top: 35px; }
  .creator-workspace { gap: 80px; }
}
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .title-content { width: 52vw; margin-left: 7vw; }
  .title-wordmark { font-size: 80px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .sidebar { padding-inline: 18px; gap: 14px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .brand { flex-basis: 140px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .nav-item { gap: 6px; padding-inline: 8px; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .4px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .nav-item > .ui-glyph { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-basis: 16px; }
  .creator-workspace { gap: 35px; grid-template-columns: minmax(240px,.82fr) minmax(0,1.18fr); }
  .creator-screen { padding-inline: 40px; }
  .creator-portrait-stage { min-height: 438px; }
}
@media (max-width: 999px) {
  .app-shell.has-life { padding: 12px 12px 0; }
  .app-shell.has-life .sidebar { display: none; }
  .app-shell.has-life .phone-header.game-header { padding: env(safe-area-inset-top) 20px 15px; }
  .app-shell.has-life #main-content { padding: 23px 20px calc(160px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout { display: block; }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel { display: none; }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-actions-shortcuts .button { font-size: 9px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place { display: flex; }
  body.game-mode .mobile-command-dock { background: #131210f9; border-top-color: #6d6459; }
  body.game-mode .command-age-button.button { background: #564329; border-color: #978452; font-weight: 400; }
  body.game-mode .command-age-button.button:disabled { background: #242220; border-color: #585249; color: #91887c; }
  body.game-mode .command-reason { color: #a49b90; font-size: 9px; }
  body.game-mode .bottom-nav button.active { background: linear-gradient(0deg,#2c2925,#1a1815); color: #c6bcaf; border-color: #988d7f; }
}
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .title-topline { top: 29px; left: 29px; right: 29px; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; }
  .title-topline > span:last-child { font-size: 7px; }
  .title-content { width: 65vw; margin-left: 9vw; padding-top: 20vh; padding-bottom: 134px; }
  .title-wordmark { font-size: 72px; }
  .title-crest { margin-bottom: 23px; font-size: 27px; }
  .title-tagline { max-width: 260px; font-size: 14px; margin-block: 25px; }
  .title-backdrop { background-position: 65% 50%; }
  .title-backdrop::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#080807bf,#08080780 40%,#08080726); }
  .title-menu { width: 300px; }
  .title-menu-item { min-height: 48px; font-size: 21px; }
  .title-bottomline { left: 29px; right: 29px; bottom: 30px; font-size: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 13px; }
  .title-settings .button { font-size: 8px; }
  .title-settings > span { display: none; }
  .menu-screen { padding: 75px 27px 50px; }
  .menu-panel { padding: 29px 22px 30px; }
  .menu-panel h1 { font-size: 39px; }
  .save-slot { gap: 12px; padding: 13px 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .slot-tools { margin-left: auto; }
  .slot-info strong { font-size: 21px; }
  .slot-number { min-width: 22px; font-size: 9px; }
  .slot-portrait { width: 42px; flex-basis: 42px; height: 62px; }
  .creator-screen { padding: 24px 29px 29px; }
  .creator-topline { padding-bottom: 15px; gap: 12px; }
  .creator-topline h1, .creator-topline strong { font-size: 17px; }
  .creator-topline .eyebrow { font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .creator-steps { margin-block: 16px 25px; }
  .creator-step { gap: 7px; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .5px; padding-inline: 8px; }
  .creator-workspace { grid-template-columns: minmax(180px,.75fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap: 26px; }
  .creator-portrait-stage { min-height: 365px; }
  .creator-control-grid { gap: 13px 11px; }
  .creator-intro h1, .creator-intro h2 { font-size: 30px; }
  .creator-intro p { font-size: 13px; }
  .creator-choice-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .creator-choice { min-height: 65px; align-items: center; }
  .creator-choice-text strong { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .creator-choice-text small { font-size: 11px; }
  .creator-plate-caption { padding-inline: 4px; font-size: 8px; }
  .creator-plate-caption h2, .creator-plate-caption strong { font-size: 22px; }
  .creator-footer { margin-top: 24px; gap: 12px; }
  .creator-footer .button { padding: 11px 15px; font-size: 16px; }
  .creator-footer > p { font-size: 8px; max-width: 180px; }
  .app-shell.has-life::before { inset: 6px; }
  .app-shell.has-life { padding: 8px 8px 0; }
  .app-shell.has-life .phone-header.game-header { padding-inline: 16px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person { gap: 10px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .identity-bar strong { font-size: 22px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .identity-bar { gap: 10px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .identity-bar .fantasy-avatar { width: 35px; flex-basis: 35px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place { max-width: 43%; padding-left: 12px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place strong { font-size: 14px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .status-bars { gap: 15px; margin-top: 13px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .bar-caption { font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .6px; }
  .app-shell.has-life #main-content { padding: 22px 16px calc(160px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .app-shell.has-life .feed-heading { padding: 17px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .feed-heading h2 { font-size: 24px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .age-ledger > summary { padding-inline: 17px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-entry { margin-inline: 17px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-entry-heading strong { font-size: 18px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-entry p { font-size: 15px; }
  body.game-mode .modal-overlay, body.title-mode .modal-overlay, body.creation-mode .modal-overlay { padding: 21px; }
}
@media (max-width: 570px) {
  .title-screen::after, .menu-screen::after, .creator-screen::after { inset: 10px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #0505041a,inset 0 0 0 5px #78716810; }
  .title-screen { min-height: max(700px,100dvh); }
  .title-topline { top: 26px; left: 25px; right: 25px; font-size: 7px; }
  .title-topline > span:last-child { display: none; }
  .title-content { width: 84%; margin-left: 10%; padding-top: 120px; padding-bottom: 116px; }
  .title-backdrop { background-position: 61% center; }
  .title-backdrop::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#080807bc,#08080766 60%,#08080740); }
  .title-vignette { background: linear-gradient(0deg,#050504f7 0%,#0505045c 40%,transparent 75%,#05050488); }
  .title-crest { margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .title-wordmark { font-size: clamp(67px,17.3vw,84px); }
  .title-tagline { max-width: 270px; margin-block: 23px 24px; font-size: 14px; }
  .title-menu { width: 285px; max-width: 100%; }
  .title-menu-item { min-height: 49px; padding-block: 11px; font-size: 21px; }
  .title-menu-item .menu-arrow { opacity: .7; transform: none; }
  .title-bottomline { left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 28px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 15px; }
  .title-settings { width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
  .title-bottomline > span { font-size: 7px; }
  .menu-screen { padding: 78px 21px 55px; }
  .menu-panel { padding: 25px 15px 26px; }
  .menu-panel > p { font-size: 14px; }
  .menu-panel h1 { font-size: 35px; }
  .save-slot { gap: 11px; }
  .slot-number { flex: 0 0 17px; min-width: 17px; }
  .slot-info { flex-basis: calc(100% - 96px); }
  .slot-tools { width: 100%; padding-top: 3px; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .slot-info strong { font-size: 22px; }
  .slot-info small, .slot-info > span { font-size: 9px; }
  .creator-screen { padding: 23px 23px 26px; }
  .creator-topline { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .creator-topline > .eyebrow { display: none; }
  .creator-steps { margin-block: 13px 20px; }
  .creator-step { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .2px; gap: 6px; padding-inline: 5px; }
  .creator-step > span:first-child { font-size: 8px; }
  .creator-workspace { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 24px; }
  .creator-portrait { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 140px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 18px; align-items: center; text-align: left; }
  .creator-portrait-stage { min-height: 216px; height: 216px; }
  .creator-plate-caption { padding: 0; font-size: 8px; }
  .creator-plate-caption h2, .creator-plate-caption strong { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 9px; }
  .creator-plate-caption small { font-size: 8px; }
  .creator-controls { padding: 0; }
  .creator-intro { margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .creator-intro h1, .creator-intro h2 { font-size: 33px; margin-bottom: 11px; }
  .creator-intro p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .creator-control-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 15px 12px; }
  .creator-control-grid label, .creator-control-grid .field > span { font-size: 8px; }
  .creator-screen input, .creator-screen select { min-height: 43px; font-size: 14px; }
  .creator-choice-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 6px; }
  .creator-choice { display: block; min-height: 103px; padding: 10px 8px; }
  .creator-choice input[type=radio] { margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .creator-choice-text strong { font-size: 15px; }
  .creator-choice-text small { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .creator-footer { flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 18px; }
  .creator-footer > p, .creator-footer > span { order: 2; flex-basis: 100%; max-width: none; margin-top: 3px; font-size: 8px; }
  .creator-footer .button { font-size: 16px; padding-inline: 15px; }
  .creator-review-row { gap: 18px; }
  .creator-review-row strong { font-size: 15px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .identity-bar strong { font-size: 21px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place strong { font-size: 13px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place small { font-size: 7px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .feed-heading { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .feed-heading .button { padding: 0; min-height: 25px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-entry-heading { display: block; }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-entry-heading time { text-align: left; margin-top: 5px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .story-scene { padding: 21px 18px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .story-scene h2 { font-size: 27px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .choice-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .app-shell.has-life .choice-card { border-right: 0; }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-actions-shortcuts .button { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .1px; padding-inline: 7px; gap: 6px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .life-actions-shortcuts .ui-glyph { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
}
@media (max-width: 370px) {
  .title-content { margin-left: 9%; width: 85%; }
  .title-wordmark { font-size: 66px; }
  .title-tagline { font-size: 13px; }
  .creator-screen { padding-inline: 20px; }
  .creator-portrait { grid-template-columns: 121px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 14px; }
  .creator-portrait-stage { height: 194px; min-height: 194px; }
  .creator-plate-caption h2, .creator-plate-caption strong { font-size: 21px; }
  .creator-step { font-size: 7px; }
  .creator-control-grid { column-gap: 10px; }
  .creator-choice-text strong { font-size: 13px; }
  .creator-choice-text small { font-size: 9px; }
  .app-shell.has-life .header-person .identity-bar strong { font-size: 18px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  .title-content { animation: threshold-arrive .9s ease both; }
  .title-backdrop { animation: ruin-awakens 1.5s ease both; }
  .menu-panel { animation: threshold-arrive .3s ease both; }
  .creator-workspace { animation: threshold-arrive .3s ease both; }
  @keyframes threshold-arrive { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @keyframes ruin-awakens { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
  *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: .01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; }
}

/* Title and menu controls. */
.title-wordmark { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content max-content; column-gap: .13em; width: fit-content; }
.title-wordmark > span:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.title-wordmark > em { grid-column: 1; align-self: center; font: italic .64em/1 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.06em; margin-top: .12em; }
.title-wordmark > span:last-child { grid-column: 2; margin-top: .07em; }
.title-menu-item > span:nth-child(2) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.title-menu-item small { display: block; font: 8px/1.6 var(--mono); color: #8b8378; letter-spacing: .3px; margin-top: 4px; }
.title-menu-item:disabled small { color: #6e6861; }
.title-screen > .title-settings { position: absolute; right: 43px; bottom: 78px; }
.title-topline .button { min-height: 33px; min-width: 33px; padding: 6px 11px; font: 8px/1.6 var(--mono); color: #928b81; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; border: 1px solid #776f6435; background: #100f0e55; }
.title-topline .button:hover { color: #c6bcae; border-color: #8b8175; background: #221f1b; }
.menu-panel > .creator-topline { padding-bottom: 14px; margin-bottom: 27px; min-height: 38px; }
.menu-panel > .creator-topline > span { color: #867c70; font: 8px/1.5 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .8px; }
.save-slot > .menu-arrow { flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: auto; color: #938879; font: 9px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.save-slot:disabled { background: #11100ed0; opacity: .55; }
.save-slot:disabled > .menu-arrow { display: none; }
.menu-panel > .slot-tools { justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid #413d37; padding-top: 18px; margin-top: 24px; }
.menu-panel .form-note { margin: 18px 0 0; font: 9px/1.75 var(--mono); color: #7c756b; }
.audio-settings { margin: 28px 0 24px; }
.audio-settings .drawer-section-label { margin: 0 0 11px; color: #958c81; font: 9px/1.7 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 1.5px; }
.audio-setting { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 135px minmax(0,1fr); align-items: center; gap: 8px 22px; padding: 17px 0; border-top: 1px solid #48443e; }
.audio-setting .button { grid-row: 1 / 3; min-height: 42px; font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); }
.audio-setting label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #aaa195; font: 9px/1.8 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .6px; }
.audio-setting label strong { font: inherit; color: #bbb1a3; }
.audio-setting input[type=range] { min-height: 20px; height: 20px; width: 100%; padding: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; accent-color: #9b8e7d; cursor: pointer; }
@media (max-height: 820px) and (min-width: 571px) {
  .title-content { padding-top: 89px; padding-bottom: 94px; }
  .title-crest { font-size: 27px; margin-bottom: 17px; }
  .title-wordmark { font-size: clamp(68px,6.5vw,91px); }
  .title-tagline { margin-block: 20px 22px; font-size: 14px; }
  .title-menu-item { min-height: 45px; padding-block: 8px; font-size: 20px; }
  .title-menu-item small { margin-top: 2px; }
  .title-screen > .title-settings { bottom: 66px; }
  .title-bottomline { bottom: 29px; }
}
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .title-screen > .title-settings { right: 29px; bottom: 74px; }
  .title-screen > .title-settings > span { display: none; }
  .menu-panel > .creator-topline > span { font-size: 7px; max-width: 140px; text-align: right; }
}
@media (max-width: 570px) {
  .title-content { padding-top: 99px; padding-bottom: 134px; }
  .title-crest { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .title-tagline { margin-block: 20px 21px; }
  .title-menu-item { min-height: 44px; padding-block: 8px; }
  .title-screen > .title-settings { left: 25px; right: 25px; bottom: 78px; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .title-bottomline { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
  .title-bottomline > span:last-child { text-align: right; }
  .title-topline .button { min-height: 31px; padding-inline: 8px; font-size: 7px; }
  .save-slot > .menu-arrow { flex-basis: 100%; text-align: right; margin-top: 3px; }
  .audio-setting { grid-template-columns: 114px minmax(0,1fr); column-gap: 16px; }
  .audio-setting .button { font-size: 9px; padding-inline: 8px; }
}

/* Creator text contracts: fieldsets retain their original semantic headings. */
.creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { padding: 0; margin: 0; }
.creator-intro h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; }
.creator-plate-caption .eyebrow { color: #92897d; font: 8px/1.8 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 1.4px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.creator-plate-caption h2 { margin: 0 0 9px; font-weight: 400; }
.creator-plate-caption p { margin: 0; color: #888075; font: 9px/1.9 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .2px; }
h3.creator-section-heading { color: #b6ada3; font: 400 20px/1.3 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.1px; }
.creator-name { margin-bottom: 19px; }
.creator-name .field-label { color: #928a7f; font: 9px/1.5 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .8px; }
.creator-name > small { color: #827c73; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); }
.creator-name input { font-size: 20px; min-height: 49px; }
.creator-note { color: #958d82; font: italic 12px/1.8 var(--serif); margin: 23px 0 0; max-width: 520px; }
.creator-review > .creator-section-heading { margin: 17px 0 7px; border: 0; padding-top: 0; }
.creator-review > p { color: #948b81; font: italic 12px/1.75 var(--serif); margin: 18px 0 0; }
.creator-fieldset > .creator-option-group + .creator-field { margin-top: 20px; }
.creator-option-group:has(input[name="household"]) .creator-choice-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
.creator-step.is-complete { color: #aca396; }
.creator-step.is-complete .creator-step-number { color: #92887b; }
.creator-step.is-current .creator-step-number { color: #b0a290; }
.creator-footer .creator-footer-note { color: #938a7e; font: 9px/1.8 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  h3.creator-section-heading { font-size: 19px; }
  .creator-plate-caption .eyebrow { font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .creator-plate-caption p { font-size: 8px; }
}
@media (max-width: 570px) {
  .creator-intro h1 { margin-bottom: 11px; }
  .creator-plate-caption h2 { margin-bottom: 9px; }
  .creator-option-group:has(input[name="household"]) .creator-choice { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; min-height: 94px; gap: 6px; padding: 12px 9px; }
  .creator-option-group:has(input[name="household"]) .creator-choice input { flex: 0 0 18px; }
  .creator-option-group:has(input[name="household"]) .creator-choice-text strong { font-size: 15px; }
  .creator-option-group:has(input[name="household"]) .creator-choice-text small { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .creator-footer .creator-footer-note { order: 2; text-align: center; flex-basis: 100%; margin-top: 7px; font-size: 8px; }
}

/* Registered ink plates share one head position. Equipment never selects a plate. */
.fantasy-avatar { display: block; line-height: 0; }
.raster-portrait { position: relative; display: block; width: 100%; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate; border: 1px solid #77684c; border-radius: 2px; background: #0a0908; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #0e0e0d, 0 2px 8px #0006; }
.raster-portrait::before { content: ''; display: block; padding-top: 100%; }
.portrait-crop { position: absolute; inset: 0; transform: translateY(3%) scale(.94); transform-origin: 50% 50%; }
.portrait-layer { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
.portrait-part-crop { position:absolute; inset:0; display:block; pointer-events:none; }
.portrait-part-fit { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; transform-origin: 0 0; pointer-events: none; }
.portrait-atlas { position: absolute; display: block; max-width: none; max-height: none; object-fit: fill; pointer-events: none; user-select: none; }
.portrait-field-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 6px; min-height: 22px; }
.portrait-lock { padding: 2px 6px; border: 1px solid #655d4333; background: transparent; color: #989086; font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); cursor: pointer; }
.portrait-lock:hover, .portrait-lock.is-locked { color: #e2d3a8; border-color: #a18b5b; background: #a18b5b22; }
.portrait-lock:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #c5b581; outline-offset: 2px; }
.portrait-roll-help { display: block; color: #968e84; font: 10px/1.7 var(--mono); margin-top: 8px; }
.creator-plate-caption .button { margin-top: 12px; }
.scene-person { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; margin: 20px 0; padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid #6c635744; }
.scene-person .fantasy-avatar { flex: 0 0 84px; width: 84px; }
.scene-person strong { font: 20px/1.5 var(--serif); }
.scene-person small { display: block; color: #989086; font: 10px/1.8 var(--mono); }
.fantasy-avatar .portrait-marks { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; pointer-events: none; }
.portrait-patina { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px #0008,inset 0 0 0 2px #96826524; background: linear-gradient(120deg,#cfb78708,transparent 40%,#0a0a0930); }
.condition-vampire :is(.portrait-base,.portrait-base-extra,.portrait-base-kin,.portrait-base-infants,.portrait-base-children,.portrait-base-adolescents,.portrait-base-children-alt,.portrait-base-elders) { filter: grayscale(.8) brightness(.95) !important; }
.condition-lycanthrope .portrait-patina { background: linear-gradient(120deg,#a1917b10,transparent 60%,#0a0a0930); }
.fantasy-avatar.size-hero .raster-portrait { border-color: #918062; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #0e0d0b,0 0 0 4px #635a3c,0 15px 30px #0008; }
.creator-portrait { position: sticky; top: 28px; align-self: start; }
.creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { width: 100%; max-width: 410px; aspect-ratio: 1; min-height: 0; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px; background: #0b0b0a; border: 1px solid #675d41; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #141311,inset 0 0 0 5px #87784a30,0 20px 45px #0005; overflow: visible; }
.creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { width: 100%; max-width: none; }
.creator-portrait-stage::before, .creator-portrait-stage::after { color: #9c8c60; }
.creator-plate-caption { padding-top: 25px; }
.creator-plate-caption h2 { font-size: 30px; }
.portrait-selector { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0,1fr) 32px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; background: #11100e; border: 1px solid #59534b; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #0b0b0a; }
.portrait-field .portrait-selector select { width: 100%; min-width: 0; height: 42px; min-height: 42px; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: transparent; padding: 8px 5px; text-align: center; color: #d5cbaa; font: 14px/1.4 var(--serif); cursor: pointer; }
.portrait-selector:focus-within { border-color: #b4a573; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #b4a57355; }
.portrait-cycle { display: grid; place-items: center; min-width: 0; padding: 0; min-height: 42px; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: #2a282644; color: #9c9080; font: 25px/1 var(--serif); cursor: pointer; }
.portrait-cycle:first-child { border-right: 1px solid #59534b55; }
.portrait-cycle:last-child { border-left: 1px solid #59534b55; }
.portrait-cycle:hover { background: #3c3833; color: #dbcfc0; }
.portrait-cycle:active { background: #615534; }
.portrait-cycle:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #c5b581; outline-offset: -3px; }
.creator-control-grid .portrait-field > .field-label { color: #9c958b; }
.creator-control-grid .portrait-field .portrait-selector { font: inherit; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; }
.creator-option-group:first-of-type .creator-section-heading { margin-top: 14px; }
.modal:has(#appearance-form) { width: 960px; }
#appearance-form .avatar-builder { grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 32px; }
#appearance-form .portrait-stage { min-height: 0; aspect-ratio: 1; padding: 9px; background: #0b0b0a; border-color: #675d41; }
#appearance-form .portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { max-width: none; }
#appearance-form .avatar-preview > p { font: 12px/1.8 var(--serif); color: #98928a; }
.portrait-option-fields { gap: 17px 16px; }
.portrait-option-fields .field-label { font: 9px/1.7 var(--mono); color: #9c958b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .8px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .creator-portrait { top: 18px; }
  .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { padding: 9px; }
  .portrait-selector { grid-template-columns: 27px minmax(0,1fr) 27px; }
  .portrait-field .portrait-selector select { font-size: 12px; }
  #appearance-form .avatar-builder { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 20px; }
  #appearance-form .avatar-preview { display: flex; align-items: center; text-align: left; gap: 24px; max-width: none; }
  #appearance-form .portrait-stage { width: 175px; flex: 0 0 175px; }
}
@media (max-width: 570px) {
  .creator-portrait { position: static; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 145px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 21px; align-items: center; }
  .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { min-height: 0; height: auto; padding: 6px; }
  .creator-plate-caption { padding: 0; }
  .creator-plate-caption h2 { font-size: 25px; }
  .creator-plate-caption p { font-size: 9px; }
  .creator-control-grid, .portrait-option-fields { column-gap: 11px; }
  .portrait-selector { grid-template-columns: 25px minmax(0,1fr) 25px; }
  .portrait-field .portrait-selector select { min-height: 44px; height: 44px; padding-inline: 2px; font-size: 11px; }
  .portrait-cycle { min-height: 44px; }
  #appearance-form .portrait-stage { width: 145px; flex-basis: 145px; }
  #appearance-form .avatar-preview { gap: 17px; }
}
@media (max-width: 370px) {
  .creator-portrait { grid-template-columns: 120px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 15px; }
  .creator-control-grid:has(.portrait-field), .portrait-option-fields { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .portrait-field .portrait-selector select { font-size: 14px; }
}

/* Charcoal, bone, and worn brass: the menu belongs to the same world as its ink plates. */
:root {
  --game-black: #101010;
  --game-dark: #191817;
  --game-gold: #b49b6b;
  --game-brass: #786951;
  --game-parchment: #ded6c8;
  --game-dim: #aaa093;
  --game-frame: #49423a;
}
body, body.game-mode { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 60% 0%, #65544118, transparent 60%), #101010; }
.title-backdrop { filter: grayscale(.95) sepia(.12) contrast(1.06); }
.menu-screen .title-backdrop { filter: grayscale(.95) sepia(.12) brightness(.4); }
.title-backdrop::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0a0909ee 0%, #0a0909ab 34%, #0a09091a 70%, #0a090955); }
.title-vignette { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 68% 40%, transparent 24%, #080707b3 93%), linear-gradient(0deg, #080707ee, transparent 28%, transparent 78%, #08070780); }
.title-wordmark { color: #e1d9c9; font-weight: 400; }
.title-wordmark .ampersand, .title-wordmark em, .title-crest { color: #b49b6b; }
.title-tagline { color: #b6ac9d; }
.title-menu-item { color: #d0c6b6; }
.title-menu-item:is(:hover,:focus-visible,.selected) {
  color: #eee3cd;
  border-color: #af93633d;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ad8f5738, #ad8f5708 85%, transparent);
  box-shadow: inset 2px 0 #b49b6b;
}
.title-menu-item .menu-arrow { color: #b49b6b; }
.menu-panel { background: linear-gradient(110deg, #1c1917eb, #111010ed); border-color: #78695180; }
.save-slot { background: #171615aa; border-color: #4f473d; }
button.save-slot:hover { background: #302a22aa; border-color: #b49b6b; }
.creator-screen { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 25% 48%, #7f68451c, transparent 55%), radial-gradient(#e8dbc307 .7px, transparent .8px) 0 0 / 4px 4px, #141313; }
.creator-screen :is(input,select), .portrait-selector { background-color: #131212; }
.creator-choice:has(input:checked), .focus-card:has(input:checked) { background: #2b251e; border-color: #a28a63; }
.creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { background: #0c0b0b; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #191614, inset 0 0 0 5px #b49b6b30, 0 20px 45px #0005; }
.button.primary, .creator-footer .button.primary {
  color: #e5d6b7;
  background: linear-gradient(#3a3227, #29231c);
  border-color: #8b7654;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #191613;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.button.primary:hover, .creator-footer .button.primary:hover { background: linear-gradient(#51432f, #362c21); border-color: #c2a576; color: #f0e3cc; }
.app-shell.has-life :is(.main-shell,.sidebar) { border-color: #49423a; background-color: #141313; }
.app-shell.has-life .game-header { background: #191715f7; border-color: #49423a; }
.app-shell.has-life .nav-item.active { color: #eadbc0; border-color: #9c835b; background: linear-gradient(0deg, #ad8f5722, transparent); box-shadow: none; }
.panel { background-color: #1a1817; background-image: radial-gradient(#e8dbc305 .6px, transparent .8px); border-color: #403b35; }
.story-scene, .story-card { background-color: #1b1917; border-color: #5b4f3d; border-top: 1px solid #927b54; }
.choice-card { background: #191715; border-color: #474038; }
.choice-card:hover, .activity-row:hover { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ad8f5733, #27221c); }
.choice-card:focus-visible { outline-offset: -3px; }
.activity-row, .activity-row:nth-child(even) { background: #181615; border-color: #423b33; }
.activity-row:nth-child(even) { background: #1c1917; }
.game-header .age-up-button { background: #3a3024; border-color: #a18960; color: #e8d9bc; }
.game-header .age-up-button:hover { background: #51422e; border-color: #cfb382; }
.raster-portrait { background: #0a0a0a; }
.portrait-patina { background: linear-gradient(120deg, #cfb78708, transparent 40%, #08080830); }
/* Keep the muzzle visible beneath human-shaped hair layers on wolf faces. */
.raster-portrait:is(.ancestry-beastfolk,.condition-lycanthrope) :is(.portrait-hair,.portrait-hair-extra) {
  clip-path: polygon(evenodd, 0 0,100% 0,100% 100%,0 100%,0 0, 0 40%,46% 40%,62% 57%,64% 88%,0 88%,0 40%);
}
/* Hoods need an open left edge around a wolf's projecting muzzle. */
.raster-portrait:is(.ancestry-beastfolk,.condition-lycanthrope):is([data-headgear=cowl],[data-headgear=wool],[data-headgear=bonehood],[data-headgear=frayedhood]) :is(.portrait-cover,.portrait-cover-extra) {
  clip-path: polygon(evenodd, 0 0,100% 0,100% 100%,0 100%,0 0, 0 35%,50% 33%,70% 47%,70% 76%,50% 90%,0 90%,0 35%);
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .title-menu-item .menu-arrow, .meter-fill { transition: none; }
}

.personal-stories { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
.personal-stories > summary, .recovery-plans > summary { color: #d3c3a1; }
.personal-return { border-left: 2px solid #72644b; padding: .75rem 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; background: #151411; }
.personal-return p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.65; }

/* One persistent portrait and age control; only two creation chapters. */
.creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { display: block; aspect-ratio: auto; }
.creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 0; }
.creator-age { margin: 26px auto 0; max-width: 410px; text-align: left; padding: 18px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid #6f604342; }
.creator-age-label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; color: #b6ab99; font: 10px/1.5 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
.creator-age output { color: #e2d4b7; font: 400 32px/1 var(--serif); letter-spacing: 0; }
.creator-screen input[type=range] { width: 100%; min-height: 28px; padding: 0; margin: 11px 0 0; accent-color: #bba073; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: 0; }
.creator-age-marks { position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #918675; font: 9px/1.5 var(--mono); }
.creator-age-marks span:nth-child(2) { position: absolute; left: 22.5%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
.creator-age-marks span:nth-child(3) { position: absolute; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
.creator-age-marks span:nth-child(4) { position: absolute; left: 81.25%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
.creator-age p { color: #b1a593; font: 14px/1.65 var(--serif); margin: 16px 0 0; }
.creator-age .creator-past-note { color: #80766a; font: italic 12px/1.6 var(--serif); margin-top: 9px; }
.creator-origin-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.creator-origin { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; min-width: 0; min-height: 150px; gap: 12px; padding: 22px 17px; border: 1px solid #51463a; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#29231c77,#171413); cursor: pointer; }
.creator-origin:hover { background-color: #30271b; border-color: #998160; }
.creator-origin:has(input:checked) { border-color: #b39a6f; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #13110e; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#493b2655,#211c16); }
.creator-origin:has(input:focus-visible) { outline: 2px solid #d1b484; outline-offset: 3px; }
.creator-origin input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; width: 1px; height: 1px; min-height: 0; padding: 0; }
.origin-sigil { color: #ad946d; font: 20px/1.5 var(--serif); min-width: 22px; }
.creator-origin strong { display: block; color: #d9cbb4; font: 400 20px/1.3 var(--serif); margin-bottom: 9px; }
.creator-origin small { display: block; color: #aa9e8c; font: 13px/1.65 var(--serif); }
.is-age-locked .portrait-selector { opacity: .48; }
.is-age-locked .portrait-cycle, .is-age-locked select, .is-age-locked .portrait-lock { cursor: default; }
.portrait-age-lock { display: block; color: #b3a080; font: 10px/1.6 var(--mono); text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; margin-top: 6px; }
.creator-screen [aria-busy=true] { opacity: .8; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .creator-origin { padding: 17px 13px; min-height: 152px; gap: 9px; }
  .creator-origin strong { font-size: 18px; }
}
@media (max-width: 570px) {
  .creator-age { grid-column: 1 / -1; width: 100%; max-width: none; margin-top: 0; }
  .creator-origin-grid { gap: 10px; }
  .creator-origin { padding: 16px 12px; min-height: 170px; }
  .creator-origin small { font-size: 12px; }
  .origin-sigil { display: none; }
  .creator-footer { flex-wrap: wrap; }
}
@media (max-width: 360px) { .creator-origin-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .creator-origin { min-height: 0; } }

/* v18: complete painted portraits. The single image uses a registered whole-cell rectangle. */
.preset-portrait-img { position: absolute; display: block; max-width: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; object-fit: fill; pointer-events: none; }
.preset-window { position: absolute; display: block; overflow: hidden; background: #0a0a0a; }

/* The portrait book displays the same complete crops as the game portrait. */
.creator-heritage-field { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.creator-heritage-field small { color: var(--muted); font: 12px/1.7 var(--serif); }
.creator-plate-caption > .button { margin-top: 12px; }
.portrait-gallery-modal.modal { width: min(1020px,100%); padding: 35px; }
.portrait-gallery-intro { max-width: 720px; color: #a49b8e; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
.portrait-gallery-header { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 130px minmax(0,1fr); align-items: center; gap: 24px; margin: 22px 0; }
.portrait-gallery-current > .fantasy-avatar { display: block; width: 100%; }
.portrait-gallery-header h3 { margin: 6px 0 10px; }
.portrait-gallery-header p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 7px 0; }
.portrait-gallery-help { color: #9e9588; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
.portrait-heritages { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 18px 0; }
.portrait-heritage { padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid #51483b; background: #191714; color: #b8b0a3; font: 12px var(--sans); cursor: pointer; }
.portrait-heritage:disabled { opacity: .55; cursor: default; }
.portrait-heritage.is-selected { opacity: 1; border-color: #ad956b; color: #e0d4bf; background: #2b251d; }
.portrait-age-locks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(90px,1fr)); gap: 6px; border-top: 1px solid #51483b; border-bottom: 1px solid #51483b; padding: 12px 0; }
.portrait-age-lock { padding: 7px; color: #857d71; }
.portrait-age-lock strong { display: block; font: 13px var(--serif); }
.portrait-age-lock small { display: block; margin-top: 5px; font: 10px/1.5 var(--sans); }
.portrait-age-lock.is-current { color: #e0d4bf; background: #2b251d; box-shadow: inset 0 -2px #a88e63; }
.portrait-gallery-filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: end; gap: 14px; margin: 20px 0 12px; }
.portrait-gallery-filters label { display: grid; gap: 6px; flex: 1 1 160px; color: #b8b0a3; font: 11px var(--sans); }
.portrait-gallery-filters select { width: 100%; min-height: 40px; padding: 7px 10px; background: #121110; color: #d9cdbc; border: 1px solid #655a49; border-radius: 0; font: 13px var(--serif); }
.portrait-gallery-count { margin: 14px 0; color: #b9ac95; font: 11px/1.5 var(--sans); }
.portrait-gallery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.portrait-choice { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; padding: 7px; border: 1px solid #484034; background: #0d0c0b; color: #cec2af; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; }
.portrait-choice > .fantasy-avatar { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: none; }
.portrait-choice .raster-portrait { width: 100%; border: 0; box-shadow: none; }
.portrait-choice:hover:not(:disabled), .portrait-choice.is-selected { border-color: #bea477; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #bea477; background: #211b14; }
.portrait-choice:focus-visible, .portrait-heritage:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #efe0ba; outline-offset: 3px; }
.portrait-choice-caption { font: 11px/1.5 var(--serif); }
.portrait-choice small { color: #9c907e; font: 9px/1.5 var(--sans); }
.portrait-choice.is-selected small { color: #e5c792; }
.portrait-choice:disabled { cursor: default; }
.portrait-choice.is-locked { border-style: dashed; }
.portrait-choice.is-locked small { color: #ad8f78; }
.portrait-gallery-pagination { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin: 20px 0; gap: 15px; font: 12px var(--sans); color: #bba98b; }
@media(max-width:780px) {
  .portrait-gallery-modal.modal { padding: 30px 20px; }
  .portrait-gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 8px; }
  .portrait-gallery-header { grid-template-columns: 100px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 16px; }
}
@media(max-width:480px) {
  .portrait-gallery-modal.modal { padding: 29px 14px 22px; }
  .portrait-gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 7px; }
  .portrait-choice { padding: 5px; }
  .portrait-choice-caption { font-size: 10px; }
  .portrait-age-locks { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .portrait-gallery-header { grid-template-columns: 78px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 12px; }
  .portrait-gallery-header p { font-size: 12px; }
  .portrait-gallery-filters .button { width: 100%; }
}
.preset-portrait { aspect-ratio: 1; border-color: #756e63; background: #0a0a0a; }
.creator-identity-grid, .creator-attribute-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.creator-traits { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0 20px; margin: 0 0 30px; }
.creator-traits > div { padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #80766530; }
.creator-traits dt { font: 10px/1.7 var(--sans); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .13em; color: #a69a89; }
.creator-traits dd { margin: 4px 0 0; color: #d4cbbd; font: 17px/1.6 var(--serif); }
.creator-attribute { min-width: 0; border: 1px solid #80766535; padding: 16px; background: #141312; }
.creator-attribute > span { display: block; color: #d4cbbd; font: 16px/1.5 var(--serif); }
.creator-attribute > strong { display: block; margin: 5px 0 9px; color: #a99c88; font: 12px/1.5 var(--sans); }
.creator-attribute > small { display: block; color: #8e877e; font: 12px/1.7 var(--serif); }
@media(max-width:420px) { .creator-identity-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); } .creator-attribute-grid { gap: 10px; } .creator-attribute { padding: 12px; } }
.rpg-person { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1.2rem; margin:0 0 1.3rem; }
.rpg-person > .fantasy-avatar { flex:0 0 108px; width:108px; max-width:108px; }
.rpg-person h3 { margin:0 0 .4rem; }
.rpg-person p { margin:.3rem 0; }
.rpg-summary { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.8rem 1.5rem; padding:1rem 0; color:var(--muted); border-block:1px solid var(--line); margin:0 0 1.5rem; }
.rpg-contracts,.rpg-regions { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,310px),1fr)); gap:1.1rem; }
.rpg-contracts .rpg-person > .fantasy-avatar { flex-basis:78px; width:78px; }
.rpg-facts { display:grid; gap:.6rem; }
.rpg-facts div,.rpg-loot { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; padding:.6rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
.rpg-facts dt,.rpg-loot span { color:var(--muted); }
.rpg-facts dd { margin:0; text-align:right; }
.actor-heading > .fantasy-avatar { flex:0 0 88px; width:88px; height:auto; }
.actor-heading { align-items:center; }
.enemy-portrait { border:1px solid #5d554b; background:#080807; }
.actor-card.defeated .enemy-portrait { opacity:.45; }
@media(max-width:600px){.rpg-person > .fantasy-avatar{flex-basis:84px;width:84px}.actor-heading > .fantasy-avatar{flex-basis:72px;width:72px}}

/* Nature is a part of the character sheet, with the same ink and bone palette. */
.creator-name-field{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:12px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:22px}
.creator-name-field>.button{margin-top:28px}
.personality-builder{margin:25px 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.personality-builder .section-heading{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.trait-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
.trait-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;min-width:0;padding:16px;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);background:#171615;border:1px solid var(--line);line-height:1.5;font-size:13px}
.trait-card:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--gold);background:#25221e}
.trait-card.is-selected{border-color:var(--gold);background:#29241d;box-shadow:inset 3px 0 var(--gold)}
.trait-card:disabled{opacity:.65}
.trait-card.is-selected:disabled{opacity:1}
.trait-card-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}
.trait-card-heading strong{font:600 19px var(--serif)}
.trait-card-heading>span{font-size:11px;color:var(--gold-light);white-space:nowrap}
.trait-bonuses,.nature-impact{color:var(--gold-light)}
.trait-reason{color:var(--muted)}
.nature-impact{display:block;font-size:11px;margin-top:9px;line-height:1.55}
.personality-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:18px 0}
.personality-summary article{padding:15px;border:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
.personality-summary h3{margin:0 0 8px}
.personality-summary p{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px}
.personality-panel details{margin-top:16px}
.map-name-lore{margin:18px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.map-name-lore summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--gold-light)}
.map-name-lore p:first-of-type{margin-top:12px}
@media(max-width:650px){.trait-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.creator-name-field{grid-template-columns:1fr}.creator-name-field>.button{margin-top:0;justify-self:start}.personality-summary{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* v21: charcoal cartography and a persistent exploration workspace. */
html[data-reading-font="plain"] { --serif: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
html[data-reading-font="plain"] body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
.game-content p,.panel > p,.activity-copy > span,.small-copy,.choice-card strong,.reply-options small,.message-entry p,.help-copy p,.creator-description,.origin-option-description { font-size:calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.game-content .badge,.game-content .muted,.message-meta,.activity-cost,.button,.button.small,.creator-field label { font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.game-content .eyebrow,.game-content small,.creator-form small { font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.navigation-group { margin:4px 0 12px; }
.navigation-group summary { cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;padding:10px 6px;text-transform:uppercase; }
.menu-drawer .navigation-group .nav-item { width:100%;text-align:left; }
.display-settings { display:grid;gap:12px;padding:20px 0; }
.import-slots { display:grid;gap:10px;margin:18px 0; }
.import-slots label { display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #5a544d; }
.import-slots input { width:20px;min-height:20px; }
.trait-preview,.known-weakness { display:block;color:#d5c398;line-height:1.6;margin-top:6px; }
.combat-outlook { padding: 9px 12px; margin: 10px 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 3px solid #95866c; border-radius: 5px; background: rgba(126,115,90,.09); color: var(--ink); font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.5; }
.combat-outlook p { margin: 6px 0 0; }
.combat-training { margin-top: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
.attribute small, .skill-item > small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.battle-action-option { flex: 1 1 100%; min-width: 0; padding-bottom: 7px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.battle-action-option > .button { width: 100%; }
.battle-action-option .action-preview { margin: 5px 0 0; line-height: 1.45; overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: var(--muted); }
.spatial-breadcrumbs { color:#c2b48d;line-height:1.8;font-size:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1));margin:0 0 18px;overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.spatial-moment { border-left:2px solid #8c7c58;padding-left:18px;margin-bottom:28px; }
.hex-board { width:100%;background:#171613;border:1px solid #4f493e; }
.hex-map-scroll { overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain; }
.hex-map-canvas { position:relative;min-width:720px;width:100%; }
.hex-map-canvas > svg { width:100%;height:100%;display:block; }
.hex-cell { position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:45px;height:44px;min-height:44px;background:transparent;border:0;color:#b9ae93;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer; }
.hex-cell small { display:block;position:absolute;top:32px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:105px;white-space:normal;font-size:10px!important;line-height:1.15;background:#1b1916d9;padding:2px;pointer-events:none;z-index:2; }
.hex-cell.current { color:#f1dfaa;font-size:26px; }
.hex-cell.selected,.hex-cell:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #d9c78e;outline-offset:0;background:#b5a36b22;z-index:3; }
.hex-cell.fogged { color:#575145; }
.hex-board.compact .hex-map-scroll { max-height:340px; }
.hex-board .map-toolbar,.hex-board .map-legend { padding:14px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap; }
.hex-board .map-toolbar strong { display:block;margin-top:5px; }
.known-place-list,.city-room-list { display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap; }
.known-place-list .button { display:grid;justify-items:start;min-width:140px;text-align:left; }
.city-room-list { margin:18px 0; }
.dungeon-graph svg { width:100%;max-height:360px;background:#181714; }
.dungeon-graph line { stroke:#837656;stroke-width:2; }
.dungeon-graph circle { fill:#2c2922;stroke:#a29473;stroke-width:1.5; }
.dungeon-graph .current circle { fill:#665b3e;stroke:#e2cda2;stroke-width:3; }
.dungeon-graph .unseen circle { fill:#12110f;stroke-dasharray:3 3; }
.dungeon-graph text { fill:#d0c4a7;font-size:15px; }
.dungeon-graph text.room-label { font-size:11px; }
.journal-search { display:grid;gap:12px; }
.reply-options small { display:block;margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400; }
@media (max-width:1000px){.world-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.world-map-panel{min-width:0}.spatial-moment{padding-left:10px}.hex-cell small{font-size:11px!important}.city-room-list .button{flex:1 1 160px}.known-place-list .button{flex:1 1 140px}.game-content{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.mobile-command-dock small,.bottom-nav span,.mobile-command-dock .eyebrow{font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))!important}}
.city-room-map{position:relative;max-width:650px;width:100%;aspect-ratio:560/405;background:#171613;border:1px solid #514938;margin:20px 0}.city-room-map svg{width:100%;height:100%}.city-room-map line{stroke:#6c6250;stroke-width:2}.city-room-map circle{fill:#302c24;stroke:#a2977c}.city-room-map circle.current{fill:#756548;stroke:#e9d7aa;stroke-width:2}.city-map-door{position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:46px;height:46px;background:transparent;border:0;color:#c8b993;font-size:24px}.city-map-door:disabled{opacity:.75}.city-map-door small{position:absolute;left:50%;top:46px;transform:translateX(-50%);width:135px;font-size:11px!important;line-height:1.2;color:#c5bdab}.city-map-door:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #e0ca90}.city-map-door[aria-current]{color:#fff1c0}
/* Keep the dense country chart legible; names are also in the synchronized list. */
.hex-cell small{display:none}.hex-cell.selected small,.hex-cell:focus-visible small,.hex-cell:hover small{display:block}

/* v22: a bounded game screen. Long records scroll within their own workspace. */
:root {
  --game-shell: #10100f;
  --game-pane: #191817;
  --game-rule: #48433a;
  --game-bone: #e0d7c7;
  --game-muted: #b0a797;
  --game-brass: #ae956a;
  --game-rust: #b6a185;
  --game-paper: #c8b794;
  --game-ink: #302b22;
  --control-size: 44px;
}
html { scrollbar-gutter: auto; }
body.game-mode, body.creation-mode, body.title-mode {
  height: 100vh;
  height: 100dvh;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #0c0c0b;
}
body.game-mode #app, body.creation-mode #app, body.title-mode #app {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 164px minmax(0,1fr);
  gap: 0;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1680px;
  height: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--game-bone);
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life::before { display: none; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .sidebar {
  position: relative;
  inset: auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 14px;
  width: auto;
  max-width: none;
  height: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 14px 10px;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  overflow-y: auto;
  background: var(--game-shell);
  border: 1px solid var(--game-rule);
  border-right: 0;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .brand {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: var(--control-size);
  padding: 8px 6px 12px;
  color: var(--game-bone);
  background: transparent;
  border: 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule);
  text-align: left;
  font: 400 19px/1.2 var(--serif);
  letter-spacing: -.025em;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .sidebar nav {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 4px;
  height: auto;
  min-width: 0;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .nav-item {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-start;
  gap: 10px;
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: var(--control-size);
  padding: 10px 9px;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  border-left: 2px solid transparent;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--game-muted);
  text-align: left;
  font: 400 calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--sans);
  letter-spacing: 0;
  text-transform: none;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .nav-item > .ui-glyph {
  flex: 0 0 20px;
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  color: currentColor;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .nav-item:hover {
  background: #28251f;
  color: var(--game-bone);
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .nav-item.active,
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .nav-item[aria-current="page"] {
  border-color: #736348;
  border-left-color: var(--game-brass);
  background: #2b261d;
  color: #f0dfb9;
  box-shadow: none;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .main-shell {
  grid-column: 2;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: none;
  height: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  margin: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--game-rule);
  background: var(--game-shell);
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .phone-header.game-header {
  position: relative;
  top: auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 8px;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  padding: 10px 16px 9px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule);
  background: #161513;
  backdrop-filter: none;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark { display: none; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(120px,auto) auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .identity-bar {
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: var(--control-size);
  gap: 10px;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .identity-bar .fantasy-avatar {
  flex: 0 0 44px;
  width: 44px;
  height: auto;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .identity-bar strong {
  color: var(--game-bone);
  font: 400 calc(20px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.2 var(--serif);
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .identity-bar span span {
  margin-top: 3px;
  color: var(--game-muted);
  font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--sans);
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place {
  display: flex;
  max-width: 340px;
  min-width: 0;
  gap: 3px;
  padding-left: 14px;
  border-left: 1px solid var(--game-rule);
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place strong {
  color: var(--game-bone);
  font: 400 calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--serif);
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place small {
  color: var(--game-muted);
  font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--sans);
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-resources {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--game-bone);
  font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--mono);
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-resources .button,
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark .menu-trigger {
  width: var(--control-size);
  height: var(--control-size);
  min-width: var(--control-size);
  min-height: var(--control-size);
  padding: 10px;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .status-bars {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap: 16px;
  margin: 0;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .bar-caption {
  margin-bottom: 4px;
  color: var(--game-muted);
  font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.2 var(--sans);
  letter-spacing: 0;
  text-transform: none;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .bar-caption strong { font: inherit; color: var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .bar-track { height: 3px; border: 0; background: #38342e; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .bar-ink { background: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .status-bar[data-stat="stress"] .bar-ink { background: var(--game-rust); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life #main-content {
  display: flex;
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  max-width: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}
body.game-mode .game-content {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  padding: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
body.game-mode .game-content > :not(.workspace-body) { flex: 0 0 auto; }
body.game-mode .workspace-body {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  padding: 2px 4px 10px 2px;
  overflow: auto;
  overscroll-behavior: contain;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: var(--scroll-thumb) var(--scroll-track);
  scroll-padding: 10px;
}
body.game-mode .workspace-body:focus-visible { outline-offset: -3px; }
body.game-mode .map-content .workspace-body,
body.game-mode .life-content .workspace-body:has(> .life-phone-layout),
body.game-mode .life-content .workspace-body:has(> .battle-workspace) { display: flex; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .game-content .panel {
  padding: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--game-rule);
  background: var(--game-pane);
  box-shadow: none;
}
body.game-mode .game-content .panel > p { color: var(--game-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
body.game-mode .game-content .view-heading {
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  padding: 0 0 10px;
  border-color: var(--game-rule);
}
body.game-mode .game-content .view-heading h1 {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--game-bone);
  font: 400 calc(24px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.2 var(--serif);
}
body.game-mode .game-content .view-heading p { margin: 6px 0 0; max-width: 76ch; font: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .game-content .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--game-brass); font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing: .8px; }
body.game-mode .game-content h2 { font-size: calc(23px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.25; }
body.game-mode .game-content h3 { font-size: calc(19px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.3; }
body.game-mode .game-content p { font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.6; }
body.game-mode .game-content .small-copy,
body.game-mode .game-content .muted { color: var(--game-muted); font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .game-content .badge { padding: 2px 6px; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.35; }
body.game-mode .game-content .notice,
body.game-mode .current-moment-banner {
  max-height: min(100px,20dvh);
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  padding: 9px 12px;
  overflow: auto;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1));
  line-height: 1.45;
}
body.game-mode .game-content .button,
body.game-mode .game-commandbar .button,
body.game-mode .modal .button {
  min-width: var(--control-size);
  min-height: var(--control-size);
  padding: 8px 12px;
  font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1));
  line-height: 1.3;
}
body.game-mode .game-content .section-heading { margin: 16px 0 10px; gap: 10px; }
body.game-mode .game-content .panel > .section-heading:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
body.game-mode .game-commandbar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 52px;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule);
  background: #211e19;
}
body.game-mode .game-commandbar .command-age-control { display: flex; flex: 0 0 auto; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
body.game-mode .game-commandbar .command-note {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-width: 0;
  max-height: 72px;
  margin: 0;
  overflow: auto;
  color: var(--game-muted);
  font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--sans);
}
body.game-mode .game-commandbar .age-up-button {
  min-width: 124px;
  gap: 12px;
  border-color: #9e8457;
  background: #4b3c26;
  color: #f0dfb9;
}
body.game-mode .game-commandbar .age-up-button:disabled { border-color: #62594a; background: #2b2823; color: #b0a594; }
body.game-mode .mobile-command-dock { display: none; }

/* The current moment stays beside its place; the historical book has its own mode. */
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(270px,.8fr);
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 12px;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
}
body.game-mode .life-book {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr) auto;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--game-rule);
  background: #171615;
}
body.game-mode .life-current { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; padding: 16px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .life-current:empty { display: block; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .story-scene { padding: 0; margin: 0 0 12px; border: 0; background: transparent; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .story-scene h2 { margin: 10px 0 12px; color: var(--game-bone); font: 400 calc(26px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.2 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .story-body { max-width: 78ch; font: calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.6 var(--serif); color: var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .story-body p { margin-bottom: 12px; font: inherit; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .choice-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); margin-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .choice-card {
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  min-height: 56px;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border-right: 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule);
  background: #201d18;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .choice-card:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #332c20; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .choice-card strong { margin-bottom: 3px; color: var(--game-bone); font: 400 calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .choice-description,
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .choice-card small { color: var(--game-muted); font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .nature-impact,
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .trait-preview { color: #dfc799; margin-top: 5px; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .choice-number { padding: 0; font: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.2 var(--mono); color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-actions-shortcuts { margin: 0; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-actions-shortcuts .button { min-height: var(--control-size); padding: 8px 6px; gap: 7px; font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--sans); letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: auto;
  overscroll-behavior: contain;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
}
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .map-mini-panel { flex: 1 1 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 180px; padding: 0; margin: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; }
body.game-mode .place-summary { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .place-summary h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; }
body.game-mode .place-summary p { margin-bottom: 8px; }
body.game-mode .place-summary .button { padding: 8px; }

/* Country, streets and depths occupy the same chart table. Names remain live data. */
body.game-mode .exploration-workspace { display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; gap: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .spatial-context { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 6px 14px; min-width: 0; max-height: min(140px,30dvh); padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); overflow: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .spatial-context > div { flex: 1 1 160px; min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .spatial-context > div strong { display: block; color: var(--game-bone); font: 400 calc(17px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--serif); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.game-mode .spatial-context > div span { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: var(--game-muted); font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .spatial-context .spatial-mode-tabs { padding: 0; border: 0; }
body.game-mode .spatial-objective { flex: 1 1 100%; color: #dfc799; font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--sans); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.game-mode .map-content .workspace-body > .spatial-moment { flex: 1 1 auto; width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; margin: 0; overflow: auto; }
body.game-mode :is(.spatial-tabs,.spatial-mode-tabs),
body.game-mode .record-tabs,
body.game-mode .pack-tabs { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode :is(.spatial-tabs,.spatial-mode-tabs) .button,
body.game-mode .record-tabs .button,
body.game-mode .pack-tabs .button { border-color: transparent; background: transparent; color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode :is(.spatial-tabs,.spatial-mode-tabs) .button[aria-current],
body.game-mode :is(.spatial-tabs,.spatial-mode-tabs) .button[aria-pressed="true"],
body.game-mode .record-tabs .button[aria-pressed="true"],
body.game-mode .pack-tabs .button[aria-pressed="true"],
body.game-mode :is(.spatial-tabs,.spatial-mode-tabs) .button.active,
body.game-mode .record-tabs .button.active,
body.game-mode .pack-tabs .button.active { border-color: #9d8459; background: #2d261b; color: #efdab2; }
body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .world-layout,
body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .settlement-layout,
body.game-mode .exploration-workspace :is(.depths-layout,.dungeon-workspace) {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(245px,310px);
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 12px;
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}
body.game-mode .world-map-panel,
body.game-mode .settlement-map,
body.game-mode :is(.depths-map,.dungeon-graph) { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .map-inspector,
body.game-mode .settlement-inspector,
body.game-mode :is(.depths-inspector,.dungeon-inspector) { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; padding: 14px; margin: 0; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .map-inspector h2,
body.game-mode .settlement-inspector h2 { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: calc(23px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .map-inspector > .badge { margin-bottom: 10px; }
body.game-mode .map-inspector p { font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.55; }
body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .dungeon-graph { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; margin: 0; padding: 12px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-graph > .section-heading { flex: 0 0 auto; margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-graph > svg { flex: 1 1 auto; width: 100%; height: auto; min-height: 0; max-height: none; background: #161411; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-graph > .small-copy { flex: 0 0 auto; margin: 0; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .dungeon-graph > .quick-actions { flex: 0 1 auto; min-height: 0; max-height: 45%; margin: 0; overflow: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .settlement-map > .section-heading { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 100%; margin: 0 0 8px; }
body.game-mode .settlement-map > .small-copy { flex: 0 0 auto; max-height: 80px; margin: 8px 0 0; overflow: auto; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; }
body.game-mode .settlement-inspector:has(> .conversation-panel-v22) { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .settlement-inspector:has(> .conversation-panel-v22) > :not(.conversation-panel-v22) { flex: 0 0 auto; margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .settlement-inspector > .conversation-panel-v22.conversation-thread { flex: 1 1 auto; width: 100%; height: auto; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .spatial-breadcrumbs { flex: 0 0 auto; margin: 0; padding: 0 0 6px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; }
body.game-mode .spatial-moment { min-height: 0; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 0; overflow: auto; }
body.game-mode .route-preview,
body.game-mode .location-leads { margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 12px; }
body.game-mode .hex-board {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid #736449;
  background: var(--game-paper);
  color: var(--game-ink);
}
body.game-mode .hex-board .map-toolbar,
body.game-mode .hex-board .map-legend {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 6px 12px;
  padding: 9px 12px;
  background: #201c16;
  color: #d6c5a5;
  border-color: #736449;
}
body.game-mode .hex-board .map-toolbar strong { margin: 0; color: var(--game-bone); font: 400 calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.2 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .hex-board .map-toolbar .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 3px; color: #c3aa7b; }
body.game-mode .hex-board .map-legend { justify-content: flex-start; font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .hex-board .map-legend > span { min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .hex-board.compact .hex-map-scroll,
body.game-mode .hex-map-scroll { flex: 1 1 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; max-height: none; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; container-type: size; }
body.game-mode .hex-map-canvas { position: relative; flex: 0 0 auto; width: calc(100% * var(--map-scale,1)); min-width: 0; max-width: none; margin: auto; }
body.game-mode .hex-map-canvas > svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
body.game-mode .paper-map-svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; max-width: none; transform: none; transform-origin: center; }
body.game-mode .map-selection-caption { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 10px; padding: 6px 10px; border-top: 1px solid #8a7650; font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--sans); color: #332a1b; }
body.game-mode .map-selection-caption strong { font-weight: 600; }
body.game-mode .map-selection-caption span { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .hex-cell { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; color: #3f382a; text-shadow: 0 1px #e8d7b0; }
body.game-mode .hex-cell.current { color: #271e12; }
body.game-mode .hex-cell.selected,
body.game-mode .hex-cell:focus-visible { outline-color: #4b3920; background: #eddab080; }
body.game-mode .hex-cell small { background: #e0cda8f2; color: #2a231a; border: 1px solid #665436; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))!important; padding: 4px; z-index: 5; }
body.game-mode .known-place-list,
body.game-mode .city-room-list { gap: 6px; }
body.game-mode .known-place-list .button { min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; }
body.game-mode .city-room-list { margin: 10px 0; }
body.game-mode .city-room-list .button { flex: 1 1 130px; text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; }
body.game-mode .neighbor-route-controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 6px; margin: 8px 0 10px; }
body.game-mode .neighbor-route-controls .route-control { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 3px; min-width: 0; min-height: 44px; padding: 8px 6px; text-align: center; }
body.game-mode .route-control strong { font: 500 calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--sans); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.game-mode .route-control span { color: var(--game-muted); font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.2 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .settlement-map { align-items: stretch; justify-content: flex-start; container-type: normal; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .city-room-map { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-height: 0; margin: auto; background: transparent; border: 0; }
body.game-mode .city-room-map line { stroke: #66583d; stroke-width: 2; }
body.game-mode .city-room-map circle { fill: #baa77e; stroke: #5b4b31; }
body.game-mode .city-room-map circle.current { fill: #76572d; stroke: #392b19; }
body.game-mode .city-map-door { width: var(--control-size); height: var(--control-size); min-width: var(--control-size); min-height: var(--control-size); color: #382a17; text-shadow: 0 1px #e3cda2; }
body.game-mode .city-map-door[aria-current] { color: #f5e5c4; text-shadow: 0 1px #3a2c18; }
body.game-mode .city-map-door small { color: #30291c; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))!important; background: #d2bf99e6; padding: 3px; }
@supports (width: 1cqh) {
  body.game-mode .hex-map-canvas { width: calc(min(100cqw,100cqh * var(--atlas-ratio,1.5)) * var(--map-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .city-room-map { width: min(100%,calc(100cqh * 1.382716)); }
}

/* Battle panels use the same command density, with full portraits and target labels. */
body.game-mode .combat-grid { gap: 12px; margin: 12px 0; }
body.game-mode .actor-card { padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; background: #1b1916; border-color: #67583f; }
body.game-mode .actor-card.enemy { background: #211915; border-color: #79513f; }
body.game-mode .actor-heading { align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
body.game-mode .actor-heading > .fantasy-avatar { width: 60px; flex-basis: 60px; height: auto; }
body.game-mode .actor-heading strong { font: 400 calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.2 var(--serif); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.game-mode .actor-heading .badge { flex: 0 1 auto; }
body.game-mode .actor-card p { margin: 6px 0; }
body.game-mode .actor-card .stat-row { margin: 8px 0 3px; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .target-label { min-height: var(--control-size); margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 0; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .turn-order { margin-top: 8px; gap: 5px; }
body.game-mode .turn-chip { padding: 5px 8px; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.3; }
body.game-mode .battle-actions { gap: 6px; }
body.game-mode .battle-help { margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; gap: 8px 14px; }
body.game-mode .battle-help p { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.45; }
body.game-mode .battle-log { margin-top: 10px; font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; }
body.game-mode .battle-log li { padding: 5px 0; }
body.game-mode .battle-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(230px,320px); gap: 12px; height: 100%; min-height: 0; }
body.game-mode .battle-party,
body.game-mode .battle-command-panel { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }

/* Reading and records retain their full contents inside the active workspace. */
body.game-mode .activity-row { min-height: var(--control-size); padding: 10px 12px; gap: 10px; }
body.game-mode .activity-copy strong { margin-bottom: 3px; font-size: calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .activity-copy > span { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; }
body.game-mode .action-card { min-height: 112px; padding: 14px; gap: 7px; }
body.game-mode .action-card h3 { font-size: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .activity-category { min-height: 72px; padding: 13px; gap: 10px; }
body.game-mode .activity-category strong { font-size: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .activity-category small { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; }
body.game-mode .quest-grid,
body.game-mode .calling-grid,
body.game-mode .gear-grid,
body.game-mode .lore-grid { gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
body.game-mode .quest-card h3,
body.game-mode .calling-card h3,
body.game-mode .gear-card h3 { margin: 10px 0 8px; font-size: calc(21px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .quest-objective { margin: 12px 0; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.5; }
body.game-mode .people-layout { gap: 12px; }
body.game-mode .contact-card { min-height: 64px; padding: 8px; gap: 8px; }
body.game-mode .contact-card strong { font-size: calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .contact-card small { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.35; }
body.game-mode .thread-header { padding: 14px; gap: 12px; }
body.game-mode .thread-header h2 { font-size: calc(23px * var(--reading-scale,1)); margin-bottom: 5px; }
body.game-mode .thread-messages { padding: 14px; max-height: none; }
body.game-mode .message-entry { padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
body.game-mode .message-entry p { font: calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.6 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .reply-options,
body.game-mode .thread-actions { padding: 14px; }
body.game-mode .reply-options h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
body.game-mode .life-feed { margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .life-feed-list { max-height: none; overflow: visible; }
body.game-mode .feed-heading { padding: 12px 16px; }
body.game-mode .life-entry { margin: 0 16px; padding: 14px 0 14px 14px; }
body.game-mode .life-entry p { font: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.55 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .life-entry-heading time { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .journal-search { margin-bottom: 12px; }

/* Every overlay keeps its close affordance inside a viewport-bounded surface. */
body.game-mode .modal-overlay,
body.title-mode .modal-overlay,
body.creation-mode .modal-overlay { padding: 16px; overflow: hidden; backdrop-filter: none; background: #070706d9; }
body.game-mode .modal,
body.title-mode .modal,
body.creation-mode .modal { max-height: calc(100dvh - 32px); min-height: 0; padding: 20px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; border: 1px solid #a08a63; background: #1b1916; box-shadow: 0 12px 48px #000b; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .modal-close,
body.title-mode .modal-close,
body.creation-mode .modal-close { position: sticky; top: 0; right: auto; float: right; z-index: 5; min-width: var(--control-size); min-height: var(--control-size); margin: -6px -6px 0 6px; border: 1px solid #776448; background: #262118; color: var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .modal h2,
body.title-mode .modal h2,
body.creation-mode .modal h2 { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: calc(27px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .drawer-overlay { padding: 0; }
body.game-mode .menu-drawer.modal { width: min(520px,100%); height: 100%; max-height: 100%; padding: 16px 20px; border: 0; border-left: 1px solid #a08a63; }
body.game-mode .drawer-heading { margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; }
body.game-mode .menu-drawer .navigation-group { margin: 0 0 8px; }
body.game-mode .menu-drawer .navigation-group summary { min-height: var(--control-size); padding: 10px 4px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .menu-drawer .navigation-group .nav-item { display: flex; gap: 10px; min-height: var(--control-size); padding: 10px 12px; font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }
body.game-mode .drawer-tools { gap: 6px; }

/* Creation keeps a complete portrait and its tools beside locally scrolling choices. */
body.creation-mode .creator-screen {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: auto auto minmax(0,1fr);
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1440px;
  height: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 14px 28px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #171615;
}
body.creation-mode .creator-screen::after { display: none; }
body.creation-mode .creator-topline { min-height: var(--control-size); padding-bottom: 8px; gap: 10px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-topline .button { min-height: var(--control-size); padding: 8px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing: .2px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-topline .eyebrow { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing: .6px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-steps { width: 100%; min-width: 0; margin: 8px 0 12px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-step { min-height: var(--control-size); padding: 8px 12px; gap: 8px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing: .2px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-step > span:first-child { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode #character-form { display: grid; grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr) auto; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
body.creation-mode .creator-workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(230px,.75fr) minmax(0,1.25fr); gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-height: 0; padding: 0; overflow: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 100%; height: clamp(170px,32dvh,330px); min-height: 170px; max-height: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; aspect-ratio: auto; overflow: hidden; container-type: normal; border: 1px solid #655842; box-shadow: none; background: #100f0e; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage::before,
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage::after { display: none; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { display: block; width: min(100%,300px); min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; }
body.creation-mode .creator-plate-caption { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 0; letter-spacing: 0; }
body.creation-mode .creator-plate-caption .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-plate-caption h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: calc(22px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.2; }
body.creation-mode .creator-plate-caption small { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; }
body.creation-mode .creator-plate-caption > .button { margin-top: 7px; min-height: var(--control-size); font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-age { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; padding: 10px 0 0; }
body.creation-mode .creator-age-label { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing: .3px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-age output { font-size: calc(26px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-screen input[type="range"] { min-height: var(--control-size); margin: 0; }
body.creation-mode .creator-age-marks { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-age p { margin-top: 8px; font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; }
body.creation-mode .creator-age .creator-past-note { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-controls { min-height: 0; padding: 0 5px 10px 0; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; scroll-padding: 12px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-intro { margin-bottom: 14px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-intro h1 { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: calc(30px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.15; }
body.creation-mode .creator-intro p,
body.creation-mode .creator-note { font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.5; }
body.creation-mode .creator-screen input,
body.creation-mode .creator-screen select { min-height: var(--control-size); font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-name-field { margin-bottom: 12px; gap: 8px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-name-field > .button { min-height: var(--control-size); font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-identity-grid { gap: 10px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-screen .field-label { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-screen .field > small,
body.creation-mode .creator-heritage-field small { font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--serif); }
body.creation-mode .creator-origin-grid { gap: 8px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-origin { min-height: 0; padding: 12px; gap: 8px; border-color: #66563e; background: #1e1b16; }
body.creation-mode .creator-origin strong { margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-origin small { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.45; }
body.creation-mode .creator-footer { width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; padding: 8px 0 0; gap: 8px; min-height: 52px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-footer > span { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.35; }
body.creation-mode .creator-footer .button { min-width: var(--control-size); min-height: var(--control-size); padding: 8px 12px; font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-traits { margin-bottom: 14px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-traits > div { padding: 8px 0; }
body.creation-mode .creator-traits dt { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-traits dd { font-size: calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.35; }
body.creation-mode .creator-attribute { padding: 12px; }
body.creation-mode .trait-card { padding: 12px; font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .trait-card-heading strong { font-size: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { flex: 0 0 auto; width: min(100%,clamp(160px,30dvh,310px)); min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-gallery-modal.modal,
body.game-mode .portrait-gallery-modal.modal { width: min(1000px,100%); padding: 18px; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-gallery-header,
body.game-mode .portrait-gallery-header { grid-template-columns: 86px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 14px; margin: 12px 0; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-gallery-intro,
body.game-mode .portrait-gallery-intro { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.45; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-gallery-header p,
body.game-mode .portrait-gallery-header p { margin: 5px 0; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-heritages,
body.game-mode .portrait-heritages { margin: 10px 0; gap: 6px; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-heritage,
body.game-mode .portrait-heritage { min-height: var(--control-size); font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .portrait-age-locks,
body.game-mode .portrait-age-locks { padding: 6px 0; gap: 4px; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-age-lock,
body.game-mode .portrait-age-lock { padding: 5px; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-age-lock strong,
body.game-mode .portrait-age-lock strong { font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .portrait-age-lock small,
body.game-mode .portrait-age-lock small { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .portrait-gallery-filters,
body.game-mode .portrait-gallery-filters { margin: 10px 0 6px; gap: 8px; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-gallery-grid,
body.game-mode .portrait-gallery-grid { gap: 8px; }
body.creation-mode .portrait-choice-caption,
body.game-mode .portrait-choice-caption { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .portrait-choice small,
body.game-mode .portrait-choice small { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.creation-mode .portrait-gallery-pagination,
body.game-mode .portrait-gallery-pagination { margin: 12px 0; }

/* Title and saved lives fit the same screen, with intentional local scrolling at zoom. */
body.title-mode .title-screen {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(min-content,1fr) auto auto;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  padding: 18px 32px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
body.title-mode .title-topline,
body.title-mode .title-bottomline { position: relative; inset: auto; width: 100%; min-width: 0; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing: .8px; }
body.title-mode .title-topline { min-height: 32px; }
body.title-mode .title-content { align-self: center; width: min(600px,48%); max-height: none; margin: 0 0 0 min(7vw,120px); padding: 8px 10px; overflow: visible; }
body.title-mode .title-crest { margin-bottom: 12px; }
body.title-mode .title-wordmark { font-size: clamp(54px,6.4vw,92px); }
body.title-mode .title-tagline { margin: 16px 0; font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.45; }
body.title-mode .title-menu { margin: 0; width: min(355px,100%); }
body.title-mode .title-menu-item { min-height: var(--control-size); padding: 8px 10px; font-size: calc(20px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.title-mode .title-menu-item small { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.title-mode .title-screen > .title-settings { position: relative; inset: auto; width: auto; justify-self: start; margin: 8px 0; padding: 0; }
body.title-mode .title-settings .button { min-height: var(--control-size); font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.title-mode .title-bottomline { min-height: 28px; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }
body.title-mode .menu-screen { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 0; padding: 24px; overflow: hidden; }
body.title-mode .menu-panel { width: min(900px,100%); height: auto; max-height: 100%; min-height: 0; margin: 0; padding: 20px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.title-mode .menu-panel h1 { font-size: calc(30px * var(--reading-scale,1)); margin: 16px 0 10px; }
body.title-mode .menu-panel > p { font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.5; }
body.title-mode .save-slot { min-height: 92px; padding: 12px; gap: 12px; }
body.title-mode .slot-info strong { font-size: calc(23px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.title-mode .slot-info small,
body.title-mode .slot-info > span { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.title-mode .creator-topline .button { min-height: var(--control-size); font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }

/* The narrow rail keeps names available to assistive technology; mobile has one nav. */
@media (min-width:760px) and (max-width:1099px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life { grid-template-columns: 64px minmax(0,1fr); padding: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .sidebar { padding: 10px 5px; gap: 10px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .brand { padding: 8px 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.25; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: normal; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .nav-item { justify-content: center; padding: 10px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .game-rail .nav-item > span { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; margin: -1px; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(110px,auto) auto; gap: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place { padding-left: 9px; max-width: 230px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.25fr) minmax(225px,.8fr); gap: 10px; }
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .world-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .settlement-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace :is(.depths-layout,.dungeon-workspace) { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(215px,265px); gap: 10px; }
}
@media (max-width:759px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life { display: block; padding: 0; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .sidebar { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .main-shell { height: calc(100% - 54px - env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); border: 0; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .phone-header.game-header { padding: calc(7px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 10px 7px; gap: 6px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark { display: flex; min-height: var(--control-size); margin: 0; border: 0; gap: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark .header-booktitle { color: var(--game-muted); font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--serif); letter-spacing: .4px; white-space: normal; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap: 6px 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place { grid-column: 1 / -1; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; max-width: none; padding: 0; border: 0; gap: 4px 10px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place strong { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place small { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .identity-bar strong { font-size: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-resources { gap: 3px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-resources .button { padding: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .status-bars { gap: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .bar-caption { gap: 4px; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .game-content { padding: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
  body.game-mode .life-book { min-height: 0; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .life-current { padding: 12px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .story-scene h2 { font-size: calc(23px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-actions-shortcuts .button { gap: 4px; padding: 7px 4px; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .game-commandbar { min-height: 52px; gap: 8px; padding: 5px 8px; }
  body.game-mode .game-commandbar .age-up-button { min-width: 105px; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; }
  body.game-mode .game-commandbar .command-note { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); max-height: 60px; }
  body.game-mode .mobile-command-dock { position: fixed; inset: auto 0 0; display: block; padding: 0 0 env(safe-area-inset-bottom); min-height: 54px; height: calc(54px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); background: #171511; border-top: 1px solid #6f5e43; box-shadow: none; backdrop-filter: none; }
  body.game-mode .mobile-command-dock .bottom-nav { position: static; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr)); min-height: 53px; width: 100%; height: 53px; padding: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; }
  body.game-mode .bottom-nav button { min-width: 0; min-height: 53px; gap: 3px; padding: 5px 2px; }
  body.game-mode .bottom-nav .ui-glyph { width: 19px; height: 19px; }
  body.game-mode .mobile-command-dock .bottom-nav button > span:last-child { font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.15 var(--sans)!important; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  body.game-mode .toast { bottom: calc(64px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .world-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .settlement-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace :is(.depths-layout,.dungeon-workspace) { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,.75fr); gap: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .map-inspector,
  body.game-mode .settlement-inspector,
  body.game-mode :is(.depths-inspector,.dungeon-inspector) { padding: 10px; }
  body.game-mode .hex-board .map-toolbar { padding: 7px 9px; }
  body.game-mode .hex-board .map-legend { padding: 6px 8px; gap: 4px 10px; }
  body.game-mode .combat-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.game-mode .actor-heading > .fantasy-avatar { width: 56px; flex-basis: 56px; }
  body.game-mode .battle-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); height: auto; }
  body.game-mode .battle-help { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-screen { padding: 8px 12px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-topline { padding-bottom: 4px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-steps { margin: 4px 0 8px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-workspace { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(130px,.55fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap: 10px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-portrait { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows: auto auto; align-content: start; align-items: start; gap: 8px 10px; text-align: left; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / 3; width: 100px; height: 100px; min-height: 100px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-plate-caption { grid-column: 2; padding: 0; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-plate-caption h2 { font-size: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-age { grid-column: 2; border: 0; padding: 0; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-age output { font-size: calc(21px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-controls { padding-right: 3px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-intro h1 { font-size: calc(26px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-footer { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; padding-top: 6px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-footer > span { order: 2; flex-basis: 100%; margin: 0; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-footer .button { padding: 8px 10px; font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-origin-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-origin { min-height: 0; }
  body.title-mode .title-screen { padding: 12px 18px; }
  body.title-mode .title-content { width: 100%; max-width: 440px; margin: 0; padding: 10px 4px; }
  body.title-mode .title-wordmark { font-size: 54px; }
  body.title-mode .title-crest { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  body.title-mode .title-tagline { margin: 12px 0; font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.title-mode .title-menu-item { font-size: calc(19px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.title-mode .title-bottomline { flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.title-mode .title-bottomline > span { font-size: inherit; }
  body.title-mode .menu-screen { padding: 12px; }
  body.title-mode .menu-panel { padding: 14px; }
  body.title-mode .menu-panel h1 { font-size: calc(27px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.title-mode .save-slot { padding: 10px; gap: 8px; }
  body.title-mode .slot-info strong { font-size: calc(20px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .modal-overlay,
  body.title-mode .modal-overlay,
  body.creation-mode .modal-overlay { padding: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .modal,
  body.title-mode .modal,
  body.creation-mode .modal { max-height: calc(100dvh - 16px); padding: 14px; }
  body.game-mode .drawer-overlay { padding: 0; }
  body.game-mode .menu-drawer.modal { max-height: 100%; padding: 12px 16px; }
}
@media (max-width:419px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-resources { justify-content: flex-end; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place { grid-column: 1; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .status-bars { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 6px 14px; }
  body.game-mode .game-content .view-heading h1 { font-size: calc(22px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .action-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.game-mode :is(.spatial-tabs,.spatial-mode-tabs) .button { flex: 1 1 auto; padding: 8px 6px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-portrait { grid-template-columns: 84px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 8px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { width: 84px; height: 84px; min-height: 84px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-identity-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-topline { flex-wrap: nowrap; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-topline .button { font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); padding-inline: 4px; }
  body.creation-mode .portrait-gallery-header,
  body.game-mode .portrait-gallery-header { grid-template-columns: 64px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 10px; }
}
@media (max-height:500px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life { padding: 0; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .phone-header.game-header { padding: 5px 10px; gap: 5px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(110px,auto) auto; gap: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place { grid-column: auto; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 260px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .identity-bar .fantasy-avatar { width: 34px; flex-basis: 34px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .identity-bar strong { font-size: calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .status-bars { grid-template-columns: repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .main-shell { height: 100%; }
  body.game-mode .mobile-command-dock { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-bookmark { display: flex; min-height: var(--control-size); margin: 0; border: 0; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(220px,.8fr); }
  body.game-mode .life-book { min-height: 0; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout > .life-map-panel { max-height: none; min-height: 0; }
  body.game-mode .game-content { padding: 6px; }
  body.game-mode .game-commandbar { padding-block: 3px; min-height: 50px; }
  body.game-mode .game-content .view-heading { margin-bottom: 8px; padding-bottom: 6px; }
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .world-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .settlement-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace :is(.depths-layout,.dungeon-workspace) { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(205px,.7fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-screen { padding: 6px 12px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-topline { min-height: var(--control-size); padding: 0; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-steps { margin: 2px 0 6px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-workspace { grid-template-columns: minmax(180px,.75fr) minmax(0,1.25fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 14px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-portrait { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { flex: 0 0 110px; width: 110px; height: 110px; min-height: 110px; align-self: center; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-footer { min-height: 50px; padding-top: 5px; }
  body.title-mode .title-content { padding: 6px 4px; }
  body.title-mode .title-wordmark { font-size: 44px; }
  body.title-mode .title-topline { min-height: 24px; }
  body.title-mode .title-tagline { margin: 8px 0; }
}
@media (max-height:500px) and (max-width:419px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place { grid-column: 1; flex-direction: row; max-width: none; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .status-bars { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .life-phone-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .world-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .settlement-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace :is(.depths-layout,.dungeon-workspace) { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,.6fr); overflow: hidden; }
  body.creation-mode .creator-workspace { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(100px,.5fr) minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-portrait { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 76px minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { width: 76px; height: 76px; min-height: 76px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
  body.game-mode *, body.creation-mode *, body.title-mode * { scroll-behavior: auto; animation: none; transition: none; }
}

/* v22 workspace contracts: navigation is the last normal-flow row of the frame. */
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .main-shell { grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0,1fr) auto auto; height: 100%; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0,1fr) minmax(120px,auto) auto; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .menu-trigger { width: 44px; height: 44px; min-height: 44px; margin: 0; padding: 10px; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life button.header-place { min-height: 44px; padding: 4px 0 4px 14px; border: 0; border-left: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--game-bone); text-align: left; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life button.header-place:hover { background: #2b261d; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .brand-title { white-space: normal; font: inherit; color: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .brand > small { display: block; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--game-muted); font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .7px; }
body.game-mode .rail-footer { display: grid; gap: 6px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .rail-footer .button { width: 100%; min-height: 44px; padding: 8px 6px; justify-content: flex-start; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .rail-footer > small { padding: 4px 6px; color: var(--game-muted); font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .game-commandbar { min-height: 54px; padding-block: 5px; }
body.game-mode .game-commandbar .command-note { max-height: 44px; }
body.game-mode .game-content .latest-result { padding: 0; max-height: min(180px,30dvh); }
body.game-mode .latest-result > summary { min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.4; cursor: pointer; }
body.game-mode .latest-result > p { max-height: 110px; margin: 0; padding: 0 12px 10px; overflow: auto; }
body.game-mode .place-summary .nearby-faces { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 6px; margin: 8px 0; }
body.game-mode .nearby-faces > button { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; min-height: 44px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #67573e; border-radius: 0; background: #211d17; color: var(--game-bone); text-align: left; }
body.game-mode .nearby-faces > button:hover,
body.game-mode .nearby-person:hover { background: #352c1d; border-color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .nearby-faces > button > .fantasy-avatar { flex: 0 0 36px; width: 36px; height: auto; }
body.game-mode .nearby-faces > button > span { min-width: 0; font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--serif); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.game-mode .nearby-people { min-width: 0; margin: 12px 0; }
body.game-mode .nearby-people-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 6px; }
body.game-mode .nearby-person { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0,1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 10px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 44px; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #67573e; border-radius: 0; background: #211d17; color: var(--game-bone); text-align: left; }
body.game-mode .nearby-person > .fantasy-avatar { width: 44px; height: auto; }
body.game-mode .nearby-person strong { display: block; font: 400 calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.25 var(--serif); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.game-mode .nearby-person small { display: block; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--game-muted); font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .nearby-person > span:last-child { color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .place-summary .contact-card { width: 100%; }
body.game-mode .city-map-viewport { flex: 1 1 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; container-type: size; border: 1px solid #736449; background: var(--game-paper) url('__HO_ASSET_240a071485ee3235_0720__') center / cover; }
body.game-mode .battle-workspace { display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; gap: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .life-content .workspace-body:has(.battle-workspace) { overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .battle-topline { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 6px 14px; min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .battle-topline .view-heading { flex: 1 1 200px; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
body.game-mode .battle-topline .view-heading h1 { font-size: calc(22px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .battle-topline .view-heading p { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .battle-topline .turn-order { flex: 1 1 180px; justify-content: flex-end; margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .battle-workspace .battle-layout { flex: 1 1 auto; height: auto; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(245px,320px); grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr); }
body.game-mode .battle-field { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; padding-right: 3px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .battle-field .combat-grid { margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .battle-command-panel.panel { min-height: 0; padding: 12px; margin: 0; overflow: auto; }
body.game-mode .battle-command-panel .section-heading { margin-top: 0; }
body.game-mode .battle-command-panel details { padding-top: 10px; margin-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .battle-command-panel summary { min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 0; font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); cursor: pointer; }
body.game-mode .battle-recent-log { margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .battle-recent-log p { margin: 0 0 7px; font: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.45 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .relationships-content .workspace-body:has(.people-layout) { display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .relationships-content .workspace-body > .record-tabs { flex: 0 0 auto; }
body.game-mode .people-layout { flex: 1 1 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(155px,220px) minmax(0,1fr); align-items: stretch; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .people-layout > .contact-list { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; margin: 0; padding: 10px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22.conversation-thread { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; height: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-header { flex: 0 1 auto; min-width: 0; min-height: 44px; max-height: min(120px,35%); padding: 12px; overflow: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-identity { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-header > .fantasy-avatar { width: 56px; flex: 0 0 56px; height: auto; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-header h2 { font-size: calc(21px * var(--reading-scale,1)); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-header p { margin: 3px 0; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.35; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-messages { flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 0; padding: 12px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .dialogue-commands-v22 { flex: 0 1 auto; max-height: 60%; min-height: 44px; padding: 12px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 > .thread-empty { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; max-height: 100%; padding: 12px; overflow: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .dialogue-commands-v22 .choice-card { width: 100%; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .dialogue-commands-v22 .action-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .dialogue-commands-v22 .action-card { min-height: 66px; }
body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .dialogue-commands-v22 details > summary { min-height: 44px; padding-block: 10px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .inventory-content .workspace-body { display: flex; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .pack-workspace { display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; gap: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .pack-resources { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px 16px; max-height: 18dvh; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: #211e18; overflow: auto; font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .pack-resources > span { display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .pack-resources strong { color: var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .pack-body { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; padding-right: 3px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .pack-workspace > .disabled-reason { flex: 0 0 auto; margin: 0; max-height: 80px; overflow: auto; }
body.game-mode .pack-tabs .button[aria-current="page"],
body.game-mode .record-tabs .button[aria-current="page"] { border-color: #9d8459; background: #2d261b; color: #efdab2; }
@media (min-width:760px) and (max-width:1099px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0,1fr) minmax(110px,auto) auto; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .brand { font-size: 13px; }
  body.game-mode .rail-footer .button { justify-content: center; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); padding-inline: 2px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  body.game-mode .rail-footer > small { padding-inline: 0; font-size: 10px; text-align: center; }
  body.game-mode .battle-workspace .battle-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(215px,280px); }
  body.game-mode .people-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(145px,180px) minmax(0,1fr); }
}
@media (max-width:759px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .main-shell { height: 100%; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap: 5px 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .menu-trigger { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .identity-bar { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .header-resources { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life button.header-place { grid-column: 2 / -1; grid-row: 2; min-height: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
  body.game-mode .mobile-command-dock { position: relative; inset: auto; height: auto; min-height: 52px; padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom); }
  body.game-mode .mobile-command-dock .bottom-nav { min-height: 52px; height: auto; }
  body.game-mode .bottom-nav button { min-height: 52px; }
  body.game-mode .battle-workspace .battle-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); height: auto; }
  body.game-mode .battle-topline .turn-order { justify-content: flex-start; }
  body.game-mode .people-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(105px,140px) minmax(0,1fr); gap: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .people-layout > .contact-list { padding: 6px; }
  body.game-mode .people-layout .contact-card { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 5px; padding: 7px 5px; }
  body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-header { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 10px; }
  body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-header h2 { font-size: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-header > .fantasy-avatar { width: 44px; flex-basis: 44px; }
  body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-header > .badge { margin-left: auto; }
  body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-messages,
  body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .dialogue-commands-v22 { padding: 10px; }
  body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .message-entry { padding: 10px; max-width: 100%; }
}
@media (max-width:419px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0,1fr) auto; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .header-resources { justify-content: flex-end; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person .header-place { grid-column: 2 / -1; }
  body.game-mode .people-layout { grid-template-columns: 90px minmax(0,1fr); }
  body.game-mode .people-layout .contact-card strong { font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.game-mode .people-layout .contact-card .fantasy-avatar { width: 36px; }
  body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22 .thread-header > .fantasy-avatar { width: 36px; flex-basis: 36px; }
}
@media (max-height:500px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .phone-header.game-header { padding: 1px 8px; gap: 0; }
  body.game-mode .conversation-panel-v22.conversation-thread { overflow: auto; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0,1fr) minmax(110px,auto) auto; gap: 8px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .menu-trigger,
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .identity-bar,
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .header-resources { grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life button.header-place { grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; min-height: 0; padding: 0 0 0 8px; border-left: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
  body.game-mode .game-commandbar { min-height: 48px; padding-block: 2px; }
  body.game-mode .mobile-command-dock { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .battle-topline .view-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 3px; }
  body.game-mode .battle-workspace .battle-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(205px,.7fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr); }
}
@media (max-height:500px) and (max-width:419px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap: 4px 6px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .menu-trigger { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .identity-bar { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .header-resources { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life button.header-place { grid-column: 2 / -1; grid-row: 2; padding: 0; border: 0; }
  body.game-mode .battle-workspace .battle-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); }
}

/* At narrow portrait widths, resources may wrap; the person's name must not
   collapse into a tall column that consumes the entire play area. */
@media (max-width:419px) and (min-height:501px) {
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .menu-trigger { order: 0; flex: 0 0 44px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .identity-bar { order: 1; flex: 1 1 150px; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .header-person > .header-resources { order: 2; flex: 0 0 auto; margin-left: auto; }
  body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life button.header-place { order: 3; flex: 0 0 100%; }
}

/* A phone shows one exploration pane at a time, so chart and commands both
   receive the complete remaining game window. Desktop keeps the shared table. */
body.game-mode .spatial-focus-tabs,
body.game-mode .mobile-inspector-title { display: none; }
@media (max-width:759px) {
  body.game-mode .spatial-focus-tabs { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  body.game-mode .spatial-focus-tabs .button { flex: 1 1 0; min-height: 44px; }
  body.game-mode .spatial-focus-tabs .button.active { border-color: #9d8459; background: #2d261b; color: #efdab2; }
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .world-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .settlement-layout,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace .dungeon-workspace { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr); overflow: hidden; }
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace[data-spatial-pane="map"] .map-inspector,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace[data-spatial-pane="map"] .settlement-inspector,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace[data-spatial-pane="map"] .dungeon-inspector { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace[data-spatial-pane="actions"] .world-map-panel,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace[data-spatial-pane="actions"] .settlement-map,
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace[data-spatial-pane="actions"] .dungeon-graph { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .mobile-inspector-title { display: block; flex: 0 0 auto; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  body.game-mode .hex-board:not(.compact) .map-toolbar > div:first-child { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .hex-board .map-legend { padding: 4px 8px; }
}
@media (max-height:500px) and (max-width:759px) {
  body.game-mode .spatial-context > div:first-child { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .spatial-context { gap: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }
  body.game-mode .exploration-workspace[data-spatial-pane="map"] .spatial-objective { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .hex-board .map-legend,
  body.game-mode .hex-board .map-selection-caption { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .hex-board .map-toolbar { padding: 2px 8px; }
}

/* v23: saved lives center on both axes; only the slot list can scroll. */
body.title-mode .save-slots-screen {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr);
  grid-template-rows: minmax(0,1fr);
  place-items: center;
}
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  width: min(780px,100%);
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  max-height: 100%;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 24px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid #585044;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #09090880,0 24px 80px #0005;
}
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel::before,
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel::after { display: none; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel > .creator-topline { flex: 0 0 auto; min-height: 44px; margin: 0 0 18px; padding-bottom: 10px; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-heading { flex: 0 0 auto; margin-bottom: 16px; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-heading h1 { margin: 8px 0; font-size: calc(28px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.2; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-heading p { margin: 0; font: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--serif); }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel > .notice { flex: 0 0 auto; max-height: 100px; overflow: auto; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-list {
  flex: 0 1 auto;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 6px;
  gap: 8px;
  overflow: auto;
  overscroll-behavior: contain;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
}
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .save-slot { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 24px 46px minmax(0,1fr) auto; min-height: 88px; padding: 10px 12px; gap: 10px; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-number { min-width: 0; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-portrait { width: 46px; height: 62px; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-info strong { font-size: calc(22px * var(--reading-scale,1)); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .save-slot > .menu-arrow { margin: 0; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-footer { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #413d37; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-footer .slot-tools { flex: 0 0 auto; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-footer .button { min-height: 44px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.title-mode .save-slots-footer .form-note { margin: 0; color: #aaa192; font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.45 var(--serif); }
@media (max-width:599px) {
  body.title-mode .save-slots-panel { padding: 14px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-panel > .creator-topline { margin-bottom: 10px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: nowrap; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-panel > .creator-topline > span { max-width: 130px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-heading { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-heading h1 { font-size: calc(24px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .save-slot { grid-template-columns: 20px 38px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 8px; padding: 10px 8px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-portrait { width: 38px; height: 56px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-info strong { font-size: calc(19px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .save-slot > .menu-arrow { grid-column: 3; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-footer { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-footer .slot-tools { width: auto; }
}
@media (max-height:500px) {
  body.title-mode .save-slots-screen { padding: 8px 12px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-panel { padding: 10px 14px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-panel > .creator-topline { margin-bottom: 6px; padding-bottom: 4px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-heading { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-heading .eyebrow { display: none; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-heading h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: calc(23px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-footer { margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; gap: 12px; }
}
@media (max-width:599px) and (max-height:500px) {
  body.title-mode .save-slots-heading > p,
  body.title-mode .save-slots-footer .save-backup-hint { display: none; }
  body.title-mode .save-slots-footer { gap: 5px; }
}

/* The map is a printed sheet in the same charcoal command frame as the game. */
body.game-mode .paper-chart { border-color: var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-shell); color: var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-toolbar { background: var(--game-pane); border-color: var(--game-rule); padding: 8px 10px; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-toolbar strong { font-size: calc(17px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-toolbar .eyebrow { color: var(--game-muted); font-size: calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing: 1px; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-controls { display: flex; gap: 2px; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-controls .button { min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; padding: 6px 10px; border-color: transparent; color: var(--game-bone); font-size: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-controls .map-fit { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-map-scroll { padding: 10px; background: #121210; box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #0008; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-map-canvas { box-shadow: 0 2px 12px #0007; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell {
  width: min(44px,var(--hex-hit-width));
  height: min(40px,var(--hex-hit-height));
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: #534b3b;
  text-shadow: none;
  background: transparent;
  font-size: 15px;
}
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell.current { font-size: 15px; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell.selected { outline: none; background: transparent; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell:hover { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #4a3c2cab; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #30291e; outline-offset: 2px; background: #e9dcb847; z-index: 3; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell.fogged { color: #4b463c; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-selection-caption { padding: 9px 12px; background: var(--game-pane); border-top-color: var(--game-rule); color: var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-selection-caption strong { font: 400 calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.25 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-selection-caption span { color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-key { flex: 0 0 auto; margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-key > summary { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; min-height: 44px; padding: 8px 12px; color: var(--game-muted); cursor: pointer; font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-key > summary::after { content: '+'; color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-key[open] > summary::after { content: '−'; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-key > summary span { margin-left: auto; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-legend { padding: 0 12px 12px; background: var(--game-shell); border: 0; color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-key[open] .map-legend { display: flex; max-height: min(150px,30dvh); overflow: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; }
body.game-mode .city-map-viewport { padding: 10px; background: #121210; border-color: var(--game-rule); box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #0008; }
body.game-mode .paper-city-map { box-shadow: 0 2px 12px #0007; }
body.game-mode .paper-city-map circle { fill: #c7bba2; stroke: #5c5445; }
body.game-mode .paper-city-map circle.current { fill: #766956; stroke: #393329; }
body.game-mode .settlement-map { background: var(--game-pane); }
@media (max-height:500px) {
  body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-map-scroll,body.game-mode .city-map-viewport { padding: 5px; }
  body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-toolbar { padding: 4px 8px; }
  body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-toolbar .eyebrow { display: none; }
  body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-selection-caption { padding: 5px 8px; }
}

/* Complete transformation portraits, neutral ink, no layer compositing. */
.raster-portrait.condition-vampire .preset-portrait-img,.raster-portrait.condition-lycanthrope .preset-portrait-img{filter:grayscale(1)}
/* Compact additions stay inside the established game window. */
.depth-disclosure{border:1px solid var(--border,#46413a);background:rgba(8,8,8,.28);margin:8px 0;padding:10px 12px}.depth-disclosure>summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.94rem}.depth-disclosure>summary span{font-size:.72rem;opacity:.65}.depth-circle{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:12px 0}.depth-circle article{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}.depth-circle p{font-size:.78rem;margin:5px 0}.depth-dungeon{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.25fr) minmax(240px,.8fr);gap:16px;min-height:0;max-height:64dvh;overflow:hidden}.depth-dungeon-map{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.depth-dungeon-map svg{display:block;width:100%;max-height:42dvh;border:1px solid #5c554b}.depth-dungeon-map svg text{fill:#38362f;stroke:none}.depth-dungeon-actions{min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain}.depth-dungeon-map .current circle{fill:#817b6d}.depth-project p{font-size:.85rem}.pack-tabs{flex-wrap:wrap}.depth-disclosure .activity-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr))}@media(max-width:760px){.depth-dungeon{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-height:none;overflow:visible}.depth-dungeon-map svg{max-height:32dvh}.depth-dungeon-actions{max-height:48dvh}.depth-circle{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-height:650px) and (min-width:761px){.depth-dungeon{max-height:59dvh}.depth-dungeon-map .small-copy{display:none}}

/* v0.25: a deliberate journal, a useful pack, and readable places. */
.quest-categories,.people-scope,.gear-filters {display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0 20px}
.quest-categories .active,.people-scope .active,.gear-filters .active {background:#302d28;color:#eee6d6;border-color:#9b8c70}
.quest-journal h1 {font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.5rem);margin:4px 0 10px}
.quest-journal .quest-card p {max-width:65ch;line-height:1.65}
.quest-journal .quest-card .button {margin:6px 5px 6px 0}
.quest-journal .quest-objective {padding:16px;background:#201f1c;border-left:2px solid #a89673;margin:18px 0}
.quest-tracker {padding:12px 16px;background:#201f1c;border:1px solid #5b5242;margin:14px 0}
.quest-tracker p {margin:6px 0;font-size:.85rem;color:#beb49f}
.misc-errand {padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #35332e}
.contact-pagination {display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:14px}
.people-search {display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:14px}
.people-search input {min-width:0;flex:1;padding:10px;background:#191918;border:1px solid #464239;color:#e1d7c5;border-radius:3px}
.contact-list .contact-card {min-height:68px}
.contact-card small {line-height:1.5}
.item-art {display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:82px;aspect-ratio:1;background-image:url('__HO_ASSET_047ff6d7ef2e2095_0718__');background-size:400% 400%;background-repeat:no-repeat;border:1px solid #4d4840;border-radius:4px;background-color:#11100f;filter:var(--illustration-tone)}
.equipment-slots {display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(80px,.8fr) minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-rows:repeat(5,minmax(76px,auto));gap:10px;margin:20px 0}
.loadout-person {grid-column:2;grid-row:1/6;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;min-width:0;padding:10px}
.loadout-person .fantasy-avatar {max-width:100%;width:150px!important}
.loadout-person .avatar-frame,.loadout-person img {max-width:100%}
.equipment-slot {display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;text-align:left;padding:8px;background:#191918;border:1px solid #4e463a;border-radius:4px;color:#dfd7c6;min-width:0;min-height:76px;cursor:pointer}
.equipment-slot>span:last-child {display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;min-width:0}
.equipment-slot strong {font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.equipment-slot small {font-size:.68rem;color:#b8ad96}
.equipment-slot .item-art {width:54px}
.empty-slot-mark {display:grid;place-items:center;width:54px;height:54px;font-size:28px;color:#847b68;flex-shrink:0;border:1px dashed #524b3e}
.loadout-score {font-size:2.4rem;color:#d8c399;text-align:center;line-height:1.1}
.loadout-score small {display:block;font:11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
.loadout-bonuses {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;padding:14px 0;border-block:1px solid #3d3930}
.gear-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
.gear-card {display:flex;gap:12px;padding:15px;background:#191918;border:1px solid var(--rarity,#4b4740);border-radius:4px;min-width:0}
.gear-card .item-art {width:74px;align-self:flex-start}
.gear-card-copy {min-width:0;flex:1}
.gear-card h3 {font-size:1rem;margin:4px 0 8px;line-height:1.35}
.gear-slot {font:10px system-ui;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--rarity,#b0a594)}
.gear-score {display:block;font:14px system-ui;margin-bottom:10px}
.gear-score small {font-size:11px}
.positive {color:#d2c5a9}.negative {color:#ae9b81}
.gear-bonuses {display:flex;gap:6px 12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font:12px/1.6 system-ui}
.gear-description {font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.55;color:#bbb09c;margin:10px 0}
.rarity-common {--rarity:#908c80}.rarity-uncommon {--rarity:#a19a87}.rarity-rare {--rarity:#b2a78e}.rarity-epic {--rarity:#c1b396}.rarity-legendary {--rarity:#cdbb96}
.equipment-slot {border-color:var(--rarity,#4e463a)}
.equipped {box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #b4a580}
.set-bonuses {display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:18px}
.equipment-comparison { border-top: 1px solid #4b4438; padding-top: 8px; margin: 10px 0; min-width: 0; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); color: #c7bdab; }
.gear-card .equipment-comparison p, .equipment-comparison p { margin: 6px 0; font-size: inherit; line-height: 1.55; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.comparison-context { color: #d0bea0; font-weight: 600; }
.comparison-delta { color: #d7c9b1; }
.set-change { border-left: 2px solid #938165; padding-left: 8px; }
.equipment-comparison summary { cursor: pointer; min-height: 36px; padding: 7px 0; }
.equipment-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; }
.equipment-compare-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: inherit; }
.equipment-compare-table th, .equipment-compare-table td { padding: 5px; text-align: right; border-bottom: 1px solid #413b32; }
.equipment-compare-table th:first-child { text-align: left; }
.equipment-compare-table caption { text-align: left; padding: 6px 0; color: #b8ab94; }
.combat-equipment-values { display: grid; gap: 5px; margin: 8px 0; }
.combat-equipment-values > div { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 10px; }
.combat-equipment-values dd { margin: 0; }
.build-preference { padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #514737; background: #211e19; margin: 8px 0; }
.build-preference > span { color: #cebc9d; }
.build-preference .quick-actions { margin: 6px 0; }
.build-preference .active { border-color: #b3a080; background: #373025; }
.build-preference p { margin: 6px 0 0; }
.set-progress { border: 1px solid #5a4f3c; padding: 8px 10px; flex: 1 1 180px; }
.set-progress p { margin: 5px 0 0; }
.affix-purpose { display: block; line-height: 1.55; color: #bfb298; }
.equipment-shop-offer { min-width: 0; width: 100%; }
.equipment-shop-offer > .activity-row { width: 100%; }
.equipment-shop-offer > .equipment-comparison { padding: 8px 12px; margin-top: 0; border: 1px solid #4b4438; border-top: 0; }
.radiant-chart { min-width: 0; }
.road-route-options { display: grid; gap: 9px; margin: 10px 0; }
.road-route-option { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 9px; padding: 11px; border: 1px solid #655b4a; background: #24211c; color: #d3c7b2; cursor: pointer; min-width: 0; }
.road-route-option:has(input:checked) { border-color: #a08c6a; background: #302a20; }
.road-route-option > span { display: grid; gap: 5px; min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.road-route-option input { margin-top: 4px; accent-color: #a08c6a; }
.road-route-option small { color: #b7ac98; line-height: 1.5; }
.travel-plan fieldset { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
.travel-plan fieldset:disabled { opacity: .65; }
.map-inspector .travel-plan { margin: 12px 0; padding: 12px; border-color: #554b3b; }
.saved-road-legs { display: grid; gap: 5px; margin: 12px 0; }
.saved-road-legs p { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 0; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #51483a; }
.saved-road-legs span { color: #b7ac98; }
.area-illustration.scene-collection-c { background-image: url('__HO_ASSET_13b14471ea8121e1_0739__'); background-size: 300% 100%; }
.radiant-purpose { border-left: 3px solid #97856a; padding: 5px 10px; margin: 8px 0; background: #26221c; color: #d4c5aa; }
.radiant-purpose p { margin: 5px 0; }
.radiant-map-scroll { min-width: 0; overflow: auto; border: 1px solid #6e614c; }
.radiant-map-scroll svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 460px; max-height: 400px; }
.radiant-edges { stroke: #6b6254; stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
.radiant-room { cursor: pointer; }
.radiant-room circle { fill: #cec4b0; stroke: #655a48; stroke-width: 2; }
.radiant-room.current circle { fill: #a19277; stroke: #453d30; }
.radiant-room.resolved circle { stroke-width: 3; }
.radiant-room.selected circle, .radiant-room:focus circle { stroke: #312b22; stroke-width: 4; }
.radiant-room text { fill: #2d2923; font: 10px var(--sans); }
.area-scene {position:relative;overflow:hidden;height:clamp(170px,24vw,245px);margin:0 0 20px;border:1px solid #595042;border-radius:4px;background:#161512}
.area-illustration {position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;background-image:url('__HO_ASSET_773f1fe00ace874e_0740__');background-size:300% 200%;background-repeat:no-repeat;filter:var(--illustration-tone)}
.area-scene figcaption {position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0;padding:25px 14px 14px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,#151411 75%);color:#eee5d4}
.area-scene figcaption span {display:block;font-size:1.15rem}
.area-scene figcaption small {display:block;color:#c2b6a0;margin-top:5px}
.dungeon-map-scroll {overflow:auto;scrollbar-width:thin;background:#1a1916;border:1px solid #514838;border-radius:4px}
.dungeon-map-scroll svg {display:block;width:100%;min-width:480px;max-height:none}
.dungeon-graph svg line {stroke:#857759;stroke-width:2;stroke-dasharray:4 3}
.dungeon-room-node {cursor:pointer;outline:none}
.dungeon-room-node rect {fill:#24231e;stroke:#7f7056;stroke-width:1.5}
.dungeon-room-node text {fill:#d9c9ac;font:9px system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;pointer-events:none}
.dungeon-room-node text.room-label {font:10px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:0;fill:#e5ddcf}
.dungeon-room-node.current rect {fill:#514532;stroke:#e2c592;stroke-width:2}
.dungeon-room-node.unseen rect {fill:#1d1c19;stroke-dasharray:4 3}
.dungeon-room-node.reachable:hover rect,.dungeon-room-node:focus rect {stroke:#ecdfc5;stroke-width:3}
.depth-dungeon-map g[role=button] {cursor:pointer}
.depth-dungeon-map g[role=button]:focus circle,.depth-dungeon-map g[role=button]:hover circle {stroke:#877a60;stroke-width:3}
.life-stage-track {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px;margin:20px 0}
.life-stage-track span {border-top:2px solid #484338;padding-top:9px;color:#807768;font:11px/1.4 system-ui}
.life-stage-track span.reached {color:#d5c4a4;border-color:#aa9470}
.life-stage-track small {display:block;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:5px}
.upbringing-panel h2,.school-term-guide h2 {font-size:1.35rem}
.upbringing-panel .action-grid {margin-top:14px}
.story-context {padding:10px 0;font-size:.9em;color:#c5bbaa}
.city-map-door {touch-action:manipulation}
.dungeon-room-node,.hex-board [data-op] {touch-action:manipulation}
@media(max-width:700px){
  .equipment-slots {grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-rows:auto repeat(5,minmax(76px,auto));gap:8px}
  .loadout-person {grid-column:1/3;grid-row:1;flex-direction:row;justify-content:center;padding:10px;min-height:88px}
  .loadout-person .fantasy-avatar {width:58px!important}
  .equipment-slot {grid-row:auto!important;grid-column:auto!important;gap:6px;padding:6px}
  .equipment-slot .item-art,.empty-slot-mark {width:40px;height:40px}
  .equipment-slot strong {font-size:.72rem}
  .gear-grid {grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .gear-card {padding:12px}.gear-card .item-art {width:66px}
  .quest-categories {gap:3px}.quest-categories .button {font-size:11px;padding:9px 7px;min-height:38px}
  .life-stage-track {gap:3px}.life-stage-track span {font-size:9px}
  .area-scene {max-height:210px}
}


.depth-dungeon-map {overflow:auto}
.depth-dungeon-map svg {min-width:480px;max-height:none}
.descent-room-track {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:6px;margin:16px 0}
.descent-room-track>span {display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:10px 4px;border:1px dashed #635a49;color:#a79b84;font:14px system-ui}
.descent-room-track>span.current {border:1px solid #d4b781;background:#423828;color:#ead6ae}
.descent-room-track>span.cleared {border-style:solid;color:#c1bba9}
.descent-room-track small {font-size:9px;margin-top:5px}

/* Warnings use the same bone and old brass as portraits, with explicit labels. */
.enemy-portrait .preset-portrait-img {filter:var(--illustration-tone)}
body :is(.badge.warning,.badge.danger,.badge.red,.notice.warning) {color:#c7b89d;background:#25221c;border-color:#80715b}
body .button.danger {color:#c7b89d;background:#29251e;border-color:#80715b}
body .button.danger:hover {background:#373127;border-color:#a49276}

/* Quest records keep the existing paper palette; only spacing changes here. */
.quest-command {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:4px 12px;margin:8px 0}
.quest-command > .living-cost-note,.quest-command > .disabled-reason {flex-basis:100%}
.quest-journal .decision-trail {padding-inline-start:24px}
.quest-journal .decision-trail li {margin-block:16px}
.quest-journal .decision-trail li p {margin-block:6px}
.quest-journal #quest-archive-search {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
.quest-journal #quest-archive-search .field {flex:1 1 240px}

body.game-mode .battle-topline .combat-outlook { flex: 1 1 100%; max-height: 18vh; overflow: auto; margin: 0; }

/* Focus 14: one reading surface, one subject at a time, the same old-paper palette. */
body.game-mode #main-content { min-width: 0; min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .game-content { display: block; height: 100%; min-height: 0; overflow: auto; padding: clamp(16px,2.4vw,32px); scroll-padding-block: 16px; }
body.game-mode .game-content .workspace-body,
body.game-mode .inventory-content .workspace-body,
body.game-mode .relationships-content .workspace-body { display: block; height: auto; max-height: none; min-height: 0; overflow: visible; padding: 0; }
body.game-mode .workspace-page { min-width: 0; width: 100%; max-width: 1280px; margin-inline: auto; }
body.game-mode .workspace-sections { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0 18px; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto 24px; padding: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .workspace-sections .button { min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 2px; border: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; border-radius: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--game-muted); font: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .workspace-sections .button[aria-pressed=true] { color: var(--game-bone); border-bottom-color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(.chapter-heading,.workspace-introduction) { max-width: 900px; padding: 0 0 22px; margin: 0 0 16px; border: 0; }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(h1,h2,h3) { line-height: 1.25; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.game-mode .game-content h1 { font-size: clamp(25px,3vw,36px); margin: 4px 0 12px; }
body.game-mode .game-content h2 { font-size: calc(21px * var(--reading-scale,1)); margin: 0 0 12px; }
body.game-mode .game-content h3 { font-size: calc(17px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .game-content p { max-width: 75ch; line-height: 1.65; }
body.game-mode .game-content .eyebrow { color: var(--game-muted); letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .game-content .panel { min-width: 0; max-height: none; margin: 0; padding: 22px 0; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; box-shadow: none; background: transparent; }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(.career-grid,.commission-grid,.blueprint-grid,.calling-grid,.lore-grid,.rpg-contracts,.companion-grid,.quest-grid,.gear-grid,.structure-grid,.heir-grid,.health-grid) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 0; }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(.career-card,.blueprint-card,.lore-card,.gear-card,.heir-card,.structure-card,.quest-card,.health-card) { min-width: 0; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; padding: 22px 0; margin: 0; background: transparent; box-shadow: none; }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(.record-tabs,.pack-tabs,.quest-categories,.people-scope,.gear-filters,.spatial-mode-tabs,.spatial-focus-tabs) { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 0 0 18px; }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(.record-tabs,.pack-tabs,.quest-categories,.people-scope,.gear-filters,.spatial-mode-tabs,.spatial-focus-tabs) .button { min-height: 42px; padding: 9px 12px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); border-radius: 0; }
body.game-mode .game-content [aria-pressed=true] { border-color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .game-content .quick-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 0; margin: 12px 0; }
body.game-mode .game-content .activity-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 24px minmax(0,1fr) minmax(48px,auto) 14px; gap: 14px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 68px; margin: 0; padding: 16px 8px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; background: transparent; text-align: left; }
body.game-mode .game-content .activity-row:hover { background: var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .activity-copy { min-width: 0; display: grid; gap: 5px; }
body.game-mode .activity-copy strong { font: 600 calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .activity-copy :is(span,small) { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.55; }
body.game-mode .activity-cost { align-self: start; text-align: right; font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.6 var(--sans); color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(details.construction-section,details.depth-disclosure,.activity-section) { border: 0; border-block-end: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; background: transparent; padding: 12px 0; margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .game-content summary { min-height: 44px; padding-block: 10px; cursor: pointer; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .game-content .story-scene { padding: clamp(18px,3vw,32px); border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .story-scene .choice-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 0; }
body.game-mode .story-scene .choice-card { min-height: 58px; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; padding: 16px 0; background: transparent; }
body.game-mode .choice-card .choice-description { display: block; margin-top: 5px; }
body.game-mode .life-day-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(240px,300px); gap: 36px; align-items: start; }
body.game-mode .life-day-story,.life-day-story .life-current { min-width: 0; max-height: none; overflow: visible; padding: 0; }
body.game-mode .life-surroundings { padding-inline-start: 24px; border-inline-start: 1px solid var(--game-rule); min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .life-surroundings .area-scene { height: 190px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
body.game-mode .life-surroundings p { font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .life-surroundings .nearby-person { border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); padding: 12px 0; background: transparent; }
body.game-mode .life-surroundings .people-at-place { margin-top: 28px; }
body.game-mode .recent-moments { margin-top: 30px; }
body.game-mode .recent-moments .remembered-entry { padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .recent-moments .remembered-entry p { font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .life-feed-list { height: auto; max-height: none; overflow: visible; padding: 0; }
body.game-mode .pack-workspace,.pack-body { display: block; height: auto; max-height: none; overflow: visible; min-height: 0; }
body.game-mode .pack-resources { margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 12px 0; border: 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: transparent; max-height: none; }
body.game-mode .equipment-slots { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); grid-template-rows: auto; gap: 0 24px; }
body.game-mode .loadout-person { grid-column: 1/-1; grid-row: auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: flex-start; padding: 16px 0; }
body.game-mode .loadout-person .fantasy-avatar { width: 86px!important; }
body.game-mode .equipment-slot { grid-column: auto!important; grid-row: auto!important; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; background: transparent; padding: 14px 0; min-height: 84px; }
body.game-mode .gear-card .item-art { width: 62px; }
body.game-mode .equipment-comparison { margin-block: 12px; }
body.game-mode .people-records-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(260px,.7fr) minmax(0,1.3fr); gap: 32px; align-items: start; }
body.game-mode .people-register { min-width: 0; padding-inline-end: 24px; border-inline-end: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .person-register-list { display: grid; }
body.game-mode .person-record-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap: 12px; align-items: center; min-width: 0; min-height: 76px; padding: 12px 6px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: transparent; color: var(--game-bone); text-align: left; }
body.game-mode .person-record-row > span { min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .person-record-row small { display: block; margin-top: 5px; color: var(--game-muted); line-height: 1.4; }
body.game-mode .person-record-row > span:last-child { font-size: 11px; color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .person-record-row[aria-pressed=true] { background: var(--game-pane); border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .person-memory { min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .person-memory-heading { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 22px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
body.game-mode .person-memory-heading .fantasy-avatar { width: 104px!important; }
body.game-mode .person-memory > section { margin-top: 30px; }
body.game-mode .memory-facts { display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 18px 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .memory-facts > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 12px; }
body.game-mode .memory-facts dt { color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .memory-facts dd { margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .recorded-words { margin-top: 24px; }
body.game-mode .recorded-words ol { padding-inline-start: 20px; }
body.game-mode .recorded-words li { padding-block: 12px; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-scene { min-width: 0; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(16px,3vw,28px); border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .dialogue-setting { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; padding-bottom: 18px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); color: var(--game-muted); font-size: 12px; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-stage { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 140px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 26px; align-items: start; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-speaker { text-align: center; min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-speaker .fantasy-avatar { width: 126px!important; max-width: 100%; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-speaker h2 { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 18px; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-speaker p { margin: 6px 0; font-size: 12px; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-window { min-width: 0; padding: 20px 24px; border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-shell); }
body.game-mode .dialogue-window .speaker-name { display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--game-brass); font: 600 13px var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .dialogue-window > p { font-size: calc(17px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.75; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-window > .small-copy,.dialogue-window > .dialogue-presence-v22 { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .dialogue-choices { margin-top: 24px; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-choice { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0,1fr) 12px; gap: 14px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 58px; padding: 16px 8px; text-align: left; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; color: var(--game-bone); background: transparent; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-choice:hover { background: var(--game-shell); }
body.game-mode .dialogue-choice small { display: block; margin-top: 5px; color: var(--game-muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-choice .dialogue-reply-preview { display: block; margin-top: 5px; font-size: calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.6; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
body.game-mode .dialogue-choices .dialogue-choice-note { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .dialogue-footer { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .settlement-meeting { width: 100%; max-width: 980px; margin-inline: auto; }
body.game-mode .settlement-meeting > .area-scene { height: 180px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
body.game-mode .exploration-workspace { height: auto; min-height: 0; max-height: none; overflow: visible; }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(.world-layout,.settlement-layout,.dungeon-workspace,.depth-dungeon) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.25fr) minmax(280px,.85fr); grid-template-rows: auto; gap: 24px; height: auto; min-height: 0; max-height: none; overflow: visible; align-items: start; }
body.game-mode :is(.world-map-panel,.settlement-map,.map-inspector,.settlement-inspector,.dungeon-inspector,.depth-dungeon-actions) { height: auto; max-height: none; min-height: 0; overflow: visible; }
body.game-mode :is(.map-inspector,.settlement-inspector,.dungeon-inspector) { padding-top: 0; padding-inline-start: 20px; border-inline-start: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .hex-board:not(.compact):not(.journey-world-map) { height: auto; min-height: 0; }
body.game-mode .hex-map-scroll { height: clamp(320px,60dvh,620px); min-height: 320px; max-height: 66dvh; overflow: auto; }
body.game-mode .city-map-viewport { min-height: 300px; max-height: none; container-type: normal; }
body.game-mode .paper-city-map { width: 100%; height: auto; min-width: 360px; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-map-scroll svg { max-height: none; }
body.game-mode .life-activity-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0 28px; }
body.game-mode .activity-category { border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; background: transparent; padding: 20px 0; }
body.game-mode .drawer-links .nav-item { border-radius: 0; min-height: 44px; }
body.game-mode .menu-drawer { width: min(640px,95vw); }
body.game-mode .latest-result { margin-bottom: 16px!important; }
@media(max-width:1100px) {
 body.game-mode .life-day-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
 body.game-mode .life-surroundings { padding: 24px 0 0; border-inline-start: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
 body.game-mode .life-surroundings .area-scene { max-width: 620px; }
 body.game-mode .game-content :is(.world-layout,.settlement-layout,.dungeon-workspace,.depth-dungeon) { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
 body.game-mode :is(.map-inspector,.settlement-inspector,.dungeon-inspector) { padding-inline-start: 0; border-inline-start: 0; }
 body.game-mode .exploration-workspace[data-spatial-pane=actions] :is(.world-map-panel,.settlement-map,.dungeon-graph) { display: none; }
 body.game-mode .exploration-workspace[data-spatial-pane=map] :is(.map-inspector,.settlement-inspector,.dungeon-inspector) { display: none; }
}
@media(max-width:760px) {
 body.game-mode .game-content { padding: 16px 12px 28px; }
 body.game-mode .workspace-sections { flex-wrap: nowrap; overflow-x: auto; gap: 16px; padding-bottom: 2px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
 body.game-mode .workspace-sections .button { flex: 0 0 auto; }
 body.game-mode .people-records-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 28px; }
 body.game-mode .people-register { padding-inline-end: 0; border-inline-end: 0; }
 body.game-mode .person-register-list { max-height: 330px; overflow: auto; }
 body.game-mode .dialogue-stage { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 18px; }
 body.game-mode .dialogue-speaker { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 68px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 4px 16px; text-align: left; align-items: center; }
 body.game-mode .dialogue-speaker .fantasy-avatar { width: 68px!important; grid-row: 1/3; }
 body.game-mode .dialogue-speaker h2 { margin: 0; }
 body.game-mode .dialogue-window { padding: 16px; }
 body.game-mode .game-content .activity-row { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) 45px 10px; gap: 10px; padding: 16px 0; }
 body.game-mode .activity-row .activity-symbol { display: none; }
 body.game-mode .life-activity-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
 body.game-mode .equipment-slots { gap: 0 12px; }
 body.game-mode .equipment-slot .item-art { width: 40px; }
 body.game-mode .bottom-nav span { white-space: normal; line-height: 1.2; }
 body.game-mode .memory-facts > div { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 4px; }
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { body.game-mode * { scroll-behavior: auto!important; transition-duration: 0s!important; animation-duration: 0s!important; } }
body.game-mode .life-content .workspace-body:has(.battle-workspace) { overflow: visible; }
body.game-mode .battle-workspace { max-height: none; height: auto; overflow: visible; }
body.game-mode .battle-workspace .battle-layout { height: auto; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(300px,1fr); grid-template-rows: auto; align-items: start; }
body.game-mode .battle-workspace :is(.battle-field,.battle-command-panel) { max-height: none; overflow: visible; }
body.game-mode .battle-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 12px; }
body.game-mode .battle-action-option { padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .battle-action-option .button { width: 100%; min-height: 44px; }
body.game-mode .battle-action-option p { margin: 8px 0 0; }
body.game-mode .battle-recent-log { max-height: 220px; overflow: auto; }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(input,select,textarea) { max-width: 100%; min-height: 42px; border-radius: 0; }
body.game-mode .game-content :is(.form-grid,.preference-grid,.attribute-grid,.skill-grid) { gap: 18px; }
@media(max-width:600px) { body.game-mode .battle-actions { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); } }
@media(max-width:1000px) { body.game-mode .battle-workspace .battle-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows: auto; } }

/* Review follow-up: compact creation and one muted brass scrollbar treatment. */
:root { --scroll-thumb: #a38c59; --scroll-track: #171615; }
body,body * { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: var(--scroll-thumb) var(--scroll-track); }
body :is(.workspace-body,.game-content,.creator-controls,.creator-portrait,.modal,.slot-list,.menu-panel,.hex-map-scroll,.person-register-list,.battle-field,.battle-command-panel) { scrollbar-color: var(--scroll-thumb) var(--scroll-track); }
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track,::-webkit-scrollbar-corner { background: var(--scroll-track); }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--scroll-thumb); border: 2px solid var(--scroll-track); border-radius: 0; }
body.title-mode .title-screen { min-height: 520px; height: 100%; overflow-y: auto; }
body.title-mode .title-crest { margin-bottom: 6px; }
body.title-mode .title-wordmark { font-size: clamp(48px,min(6vw,11dvh),84px); }
body.title-mode .title-tagline { margin-block: 10px; }
body.title-mode .title-menu-item { min-height: 42px; padding-block: 5px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-controls { padding-inline-end: 12px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-age .creator-past-note,body.creation-mode .portrait-roll-help { display: none; }
.trait-slots { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-block: 16px; }
.trait-slot { position: relative; min-width: 0; min-height: 110px; padding: 14px 12px; border: 1px solid #51483b; background: #151411; color: #d4cbbd; text-align: center; }
.trait-slot.empty { display: grid; place-content: center; cursor: pointer; }
.trait-slot.empty > span { font: 32px/1 var(--serif); color: #a38c59; }
.trait-slot small { display: block; margin-top: 8px; font: 11px/1.5 var(--sans); color: #aaa192; }
.trait-slot p { font: 12px/1.5 var(--serif); margin: 8px 0 0; }
.trait-remove { position: absolute; top: 2px; right: 3px; min-width: 28px; min-height: 28px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: #c8b78f; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer; }
.trait-picker-modal { width: min(720px,100%); }
.trait-selection-list { display: grid; gap: 0; }
.trait-option { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; width: 100%; min-height: 66px; padding: 14px 8px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #51483b; color: #d4cbbd; background: transparent; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; }
.trait-option small,.trait-option > span > span { display: block; margin-top: 5px; font: 12px/1.5 var(--sans); color: #aaa192; }
.trait-option:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }
.trait-option:not(:disabled):hover { background: #27231a; }
.attribute-allocation { margin-top: 26px; }
.attribute-buy-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) 40px 44px 40px; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #51483b; }
.attribute-buy-row strong { display: block; font: 16px var(--serif); }
.attribute-buy-row small { display: block; margin-top: 5px; color: #aaa192; font: 11px/1.5 var(--sans); }
.attribute-buy-row output { text-align: center; color: #c8b78f; }
.attribute-buy-row .button { min-height: 40px; padding: 4px!important; }
@media(max-width:600px) { .trait-slots { gap: 6px; }.trait-slot { padding: 12px 6px; }.trait-slot p { display: none; }.trait-slot strong { font-size: 13px; } }
@media(max-height:600px) { body.title-mode .title-screen { padding-block: 8px; min-height: 440px; }body.title-mode .title-crest,body.title-mode .title-tagline { display: none; }body.title-mode .title-wordmark { font-size: 48px; }body.title-mode .title-menu-item { min-height: 40px; font-size: 18px; } }

/* A portrait, equipped slots and a real backpack grid share one inventory. */
body.game-mode .inventory-heading,body.game-mode .place-heading,body.game-mode .explore-heading,body.game-mode .dungeon-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-heading h1,body.game-mode .place-heading h1,body.game-mode .explore-heading h1,body.game-mode .dungeon-heading h1 { margin: 4px 0; }
body.game-mode .inventory-gold { color: var(--game-brass); font: 16px var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .inventory-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 290px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 28px; align-items: start; }
body.game-mode .inventory-character { min-width: 0; padding-right: 24px; border-right: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .inventory-character > header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 18px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-character h2 { font-size: 22px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-character > header p { font-size: 12px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-doll { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px minmax(0,1fr) 56px; grid-template-rows: repeat(5,58px); gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
body.game-mode .inventory-portrait { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1/6; align-self: stretch; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: radial-gradient(ellipse,#4b443129,transparent 70%); }
body.game-mode .inventory-portrait > .fantasy-avatar { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 170px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-equip-slot { position: relative; width: 56px; height: 58px; padding: 3px; border: 1px solid var(--rarity,var(--game-rule)); background: var(--game-shell); color: var(--game-muted); cursor: pointer; }
body.game-mode .inventory-equip-slot .item-art { width: 38px; height: 38px; margin: 0 auto; }
body.game-mode .inventory-equip-slot > span:not(.item-art) { display: block; font-size: 24px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-equip-slot > small { display: block; position: absolute; inset: auto 0 2px; font: 9px/1.15 var(--sans); color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .inventory-stat-line { display: grid; gap: 10px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); margin-top: 18px; font: 13px var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .inventory-stat-line > div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-stat-line dd { margin: 0; color: var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .inventory-bonuses { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 16px; margin-block: 14px; color: var(--game-muted); font: 12px/1.5 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .inventory-backpack { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px,1fr) minmax(220px,.8fr); gap: 0 24px; min-width: 0; align-items: start; }
body.game-mode .inventory-toolbar,body.game-mode .inventory-categories,body.game-mode .inventory-backpack > [data-view-results] { grid-column: 1/-1; }
body.game-mode .inventory-toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 14px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-toolbar > input { flex: 1 1 160px; width: 100%; min-width: 100px; padding: 10px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-toolbar > label:not(.sr-only) { display: grid; gap: 4px; flex: 0 1 130px; font: 10px var(--sans); color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .inventory-toolbar select { width: 100%; padding: 8px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-categories { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-categories .button { min-height: 38px; padding: 7px 10px; font-size: 11px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(50px,1fr)); gap: 5px; max-height: 56dvh; overflow: auto; padding: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-shell); }
body.game-mode .inventory-cell { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 100%; height: 58px; min-width: 0; padding: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--rarity,var(--game-rule)); background: var(--game-pane); cursor: pointer; }
body.game-mode .inventory-cell .item-art { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 50px; margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .inventory-cell.empty { opacity: .3; cursor: default; }
body.game-mode .inventory-cell.selected,body.game-mode .inventory-cell:hover:not(.empty),body.game-mode .inventory-equip-slot:hover { border-color: var(--game-brass); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--game-brass); background: #2b271d; }
body.game-mode .inventory-cell .item-quantity { position: absolute; right: 4px; bottom: 2px; color: var(--game-bone); font: 11px var(--sans); text-shadow: 0 1px #000; }
body.game-mode .item-equipped { position: absolute; top: 1px; left: 3px; color: var(--game-brass); font-size: 10px; }
body.game-mode .supply-art { font-size: 28px; color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .inventory-detail { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 4/span 3; min-width: 0; padding: 0 0 16px 18px; border-left: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .inventory-detail .section-heading { display: block; margin-top: 0; }
body.game-mode .inventory-detail h2 { font-size: 21px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-detail p { font-size: 13px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-detail .inventory-comparison { margin-top: 16px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-set { padding-block: 8px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-empty { grid-column: 1; font-size: 13px; }

/* Explore is a chart; the selected point has a concise commitment underneath. */
body.game-mode .hex-exploration { min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .explore-heading { margin-bottom: 14px; }
body.game-mode .country-chart { height: clamp(300px,57dvh,740px); min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .country-chart .hex-board { height: 100%; }
body.game-mode .country-chart .hex-map-scroll { min-height: 0; height: auto; max-height: none; }
body.game-mode .hex-inspection { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 18px; }
body.game-mode .hex-inspection:has(> :only-child) { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
body.game-mode .hex-inspection p { margin: 7px 0; font-size: 13px; }
body.game-mode .hex-inspection .button { margin-top: 8px; }
body.game-mode .known-road > details { border: 0; }

/* Places use illustrated areas, rather than a second map or map/action tabs. */
body.game-mode .place-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(210px,280px) minmax(0,1fr); gap: 32px; align-items: start; }
body.game-mode .place-areas { min-width: 0; padding-right: 24px; border-right: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .place-area { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 70px minmax(0,1fr) 12px; gap: 12px; align-items: center; width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 78px; padding: 10px 0; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: transparent; color: var(--game-bone); text-align: left; cursor: pointer; }
body.game-mode .place-area .area-scene { width: 70px; height: 56px; min-height: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
body.game-mode .place-area .area-scene figcaption { display: none; }
body.game-mode .place-area strong { display: block; font: 16px/1.3 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .place-area small { display: block; margin-top: 5px; color: var(--game-muted); font: 10px/1.4 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .place-area.current { border-bottom-color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .place-area.current strong { color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .place-area:disabled { opacity: .45; cursor: default; }
body.game-mode .place-current { min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .place-current > .area-scene { height: clamp(180px,28dvh,300px); margin-block: 20px; }
body.game-mode .place-services { margin-block: 26px; }
body.game-mode .place-current .nearby-people { margin-top: 30px; }

/* The current dungeon room owns the scene. Its pocket map is optional. */
body.game-mode .dungeon-crawler { max-width: 1180px; margin-inline: auto; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-heading > div { flex: 1 1 250px; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-room-stage { position: relative; height: clamp(250px,40dvh,440px); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-shell); isolation: isolate; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-room-stage > .area-scene { position: absolute; inset: 0; height: 100%; width: 100%; min-height: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-room-stage > .area-scene figcaption { display: none; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-room-stage .area-illustration { height: 100%; filter: grayscale(1) brightness(.52); }
body.game-mode .dungeon-perspective { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-left-wall,body.game-mode .dungeon-right-wall { fill: #171714d9; stroke: #5b5545; stroke-width: 1; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-floor { fill: #333025ad; stroke: #6c6247; stroke-width: 1; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-ceiling { fill: #0f100de6; stroke: #3c3b31; stroke-width: 1; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-stone-lines { fill: none; stroke: #7b72543f; stroke-width: 2; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-doors { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-door { position: absolute; top: 22%; left: var(--door-position); transform: translateX(-50%); width: min(21%,170px); height: 70%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: end; gap: 5px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--game-bone); text-align: center; cursor: pointer; }
body.game-mode .door-arch { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 74%; height: 64%; min-height: 75px; border: 6px solid #5e5746; border-radius: 45% 45% 0 0; background: linear-gradient(#090a08,#131510,#28291e); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #a18c55,inset 0 0 30px #000; }
body.game-mode .door-arch > span { color: #8f835c; font: 24px var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .dungeon-door strong { font: 14px/1.25 var(--serif); text-shadow: 0 2px 5px #000; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-door small { font: 10px/1.4 var(--sans); color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .dungeon-door:hover .door-arch,body.game-mode .dungeon-door.selected .door-arch,body.game-mode .dungeon-door:focus-visible .door-arch { border-color: #a18c55; box-shadow: 0 0 18px #b29b4f45,inset 0 0 20px #000; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-sealed { position: absolute; inset: 25%; display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; gap: 14px; color: var(--game-bone); text-shadow: 0 2px 7px #000; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-sealed > span { font-size: 30px; color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .dungeon-travel-strip { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 24px; padding-block: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); font: 12px var(--sans); color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .dungeon-door-inspection { padding: 18px 22px; margin-block: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .dungeon-room-account { margin-block: 24px; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-room-account .story-scene { border-inline: 0!important; padding-inline: 0!important; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-party-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr)); gap: 16px; border-block: 1px solid var(--game-rule); padding-block: 16px; margin-block: 24px; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-party-strip strong,body.game-mode .dungeon-party-strip span { display: block; font: 13px/1.5 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .dungeon-party-strip span { color: var(--game-muted); font-size: 11px; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-objective,body.game-mode .dungeon-pocket-map { margin-block: 12px; padding-block: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .dungeon-pocket-map svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 400px; background: #1a1b15; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-map-paths { fill: none; stroke: #7e7557; stroke-width: 2; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-pocket-map circle { fill: #37392b; stroke: #b4a172; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-pocket-map text { fill: #c4b894; stroke: none; font-size: 12px; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-pocket-map .current circle { fill: #81734e; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-map-caption { font-size: 9px!important; }
body.game-mode .dungeon-pocket-map g[role=button] { cursor: pointer; }
body.game-mode .bottom-nav { grid-template-columns: repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr)); }
body.game-mode .bottom-nav span { font-size: 10px!important; line-height: 1.15; }
@media(max-width:1250px) { body.game-mode .inventory-backpack { display: block; }body.game-mode .inventory-detail { margin-top: 22px; padding: 18px 0 0; border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); } }
@media(max-width:1000px) { body.game-mode .inventory-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }body.game-mode .inventory-character { width: min(100%,360px); padding-right: 0; margin-inline: auto; border-right: 0; }body.game-mode .place-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(180px,.6fr) minmax(0,1.4fr); gap: 20px; } }
@media(max-width:700px) { body.game-mode .place-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }body.game-mode .place-areas { padding-right: 0; border-right: 0; }body.game-mode .place-areas h2 { margin-top: 0; }body.game-mode .place-area { grid-template-columns: 84px minmax(0,1fr) 16px; min-height: 68px; padding: 6px 0; }body.game-mode .hex-inspection { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 18px; }body.game-mode .dungeon-door { width: 25%; }body.game-mode .dungeon-door strong { font-size: 12px; }body.game-mode .door-arch { border-width: 4px; width: 74%; }body.game-mode .dungeon-door small { display: none; }body.game-mode .dungeon-room-stage { min-height: 240px; } }

/* Focus 14 / Explore follow-up: a chart to handle and places to inhabit. */
.item-art.supplies-art { background-image: url('__HO_ASSET_c1981d05db8f137a_0719__'); }
body.game-mode .inventory-detail > .item-art { width: 92px; margin: 14px 0; }
body.game-mode .explore-weather,body.game-mode .place-weather { margin: 5px 0 0; color: var(--game-muted); font: 12px/1.5 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .explore-header-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
body.game-mode .map-find { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px 0 12px; }
body.game-mode .map-find label { color: var(--game-muted); font-size: 12px; }
body.game-mode .map-find select { max-width: 360px; min-width: 0; flex: 1; padding: 9px; }
body.game-mode .map-zoom-level { align-self: center; min-width: 42px; text-align: center; color: var(--game-muted); font: 11px/1.2 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-controls .map-fit { width: auto; white-space: nowrap; }
body.game-mode .hex-map-scroll[data-map-viewport] { cursor: grab; touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; scroll-behavior: auto; }
body.game-mode .hex-map-scroll.is-panning,body.game-mode .hex-map-scroll.is-panning .hex-cell { cursor: grabbing; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell { cursor: inherit; }
body.game-mode .hex-map-scroll:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--game-brass); outline-offset: -3px; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart #country-map-help { padding: 8px 12px; margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: var(--game-muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .country-chart { height: clamp(380px,62dvh,780px); }
body.game-mode .country-chart .hex-board { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 0; }
body.game-mode .map-popout-overlay { padding: 12px; }
body.game-mode .modal.map-popout { position: relative; width: min(1200px,92vw); max-width: none; height: auto; max-height: 88dvh; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--game-brass); background: var(--game-shell); box-shadow: none; }
body.game-mode .map-popout > .map-only { height: auto; aspect-ratio: var(--atlas-ratio); max-height: calc(88dvh - 2px); border: 0; }
body.game-mode .map-popout .hex-map-scroll { padding: 0; min-height: 0; max-height: none; height: auto; box-shadow: none; }
body.game-mode .map-popout .hex-map-canvas { box-shadow: none; }
body.game-mode .map-popout .modal-close { position: absolute; z-index: 5; top: 6px; right: 6px; float: none; width: 44px; height: 44px; min-height: 44px; padding: 0; margin: 0; border: 0; box-shadow: none; background: var(--game-shell); color: var(--game-bone); font: 24px/1 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .map-popout .modal-close:hover { color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .place-current > header { margin-bottom: 18px; }
body.game-mode .place-current > header > p { color: var(--game-muted); max-width: 64ch; }
body.game-mode .place-residents,body.game-mode .place-other-services { border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); margin-top: 24px; }
body.game-mode :is(.place-residents,.place-other-services) > summary { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 0; cursor: pointer; color: var(--game-bone); font: 16px/1.4 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .place-residents > summary span { color: var(--game-muted); font: 11px/1.6 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .place-residents .nearby-people { margin-top: 0; }
body.game-mode .market-scene .preset-portrait-img { filter: var(--illustration-tone); }
body.game-mode .shop-dialogue { padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-top: 0; background: var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .shop-spoken { max-width: 65ch; margin: 0 0 22px; font: calc(20px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.6 var(--serif); color: var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .shop-replies { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; }
body.game-mode .shop-replies .button { text-align: left; }
body.game-mode .trade-workspace { border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-shell); }
body.game-mode .trade-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .trade-merchant { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .trade-merchant h3 { font-size: calc(21px * var(--reading-scale,1)); margin: 5px 0 0; }
body.game-mode .trade-toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; padding: 12px 16px; }
body.game-mode .trade-toolbar input { flex: 1 1 140px; width: 140px; min-width: 0; padding: 10px; font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .trade-toolbar label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .trade-toolbar select { width: auto; padding: 9px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .trade-inventories { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); }
body.game-mode .trade-inventories > section { min-width: 0; padding: 0 16px 14px; }
body.game-mode .trade-inventories > section + section { border-left: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .trade-inventories .section-heading { margin: 0 0 12px; min-height: 40px; gap: 8px; }
body.game-mode .trade-inventories h4 { margin: 0; font: calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .trade-item-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(76px,1fr)); align-content: start; gap: 6px; min-height: 126px; max-height: 340px; overflow: auto; padding: 2px; }
body.game-mode .trade-cell { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; min-width: 0; min-height: 116px; border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); padding: 8px 4px; background: var(--game-pane); color: var(--game-bone); cursor: pointer; }
body.game-mode .trade-cell .item-art { width: 54px; height: 54px; border: 0; }
body.game-mode .trade-item-name { display: block; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--sans); text-align: center; }
body.game-mode .trade-cell small { font: calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--sans); color: var(--game-muted); margin-top: auto; }
body.game-mode .trade-cell.selected,body.game-mode .trade-cell:focus-visible { border-color: var(--game-brass); outline: 1px solid var(--game-brass); outline-offset: 1px; }
body.game-mode .trade-cell.untradeable .item-art { filter: var(--illustration-tone) grayscale(.9); opacity: .55; }
body.game-mode .trade-count { position: absolute; top: 3px; right: 3px; min-width: 19px; padding: 2px 5px; background: var(--game-brass); color: var(--game-shell); font: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .trade-offer { border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 14px; }
body.game-mode .trade-offer h4 { color: var(--game-brass); margin-bottom: 8px; }
body.game-mode .trade-offer-row { display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: center; padding-block: 4px; }
body.game-mode .trade-offer-row > span { flex: 1; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .trade-offer-row small { display: block; color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .trade-offer-row .button { min-width: 36px; padding: 6px; }
body.game-mode .trade-inspector { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .trade-inspector .item-art { width: 76px; height: 76px; }
body.game-mode .trade-inspector > div { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .trade-inspector h3 { margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: calc(20px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .trade-inspector p { margin: 5px 0; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .trade-inspect-help { padding: 16px; margin: 0; font-size: calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .trade-settlement { padding: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); background: var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .trade-totals { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 20px; }
body.game-mode .trade-totals > span { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; color: var(--game-muted); font-size: calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .trade-totals strong { color: var(--game-bone); font: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .trade-confirm { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }
body.game-mode .trade-settlement > p { margin-bottom: 0; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
@media(max-width:950px) {
 body.game-mode .place-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(170px,210px) minmax(0,1fr); gap: 20px; }
 body.game-mode .place-areas { padding-right: 16px; }
 body.game-mode .place-area { grid-template-columns: 52px minmax(0,1fr) 10px; gap: 8px; }
 body.game-mode .place-area .area-scene { width: 52px; }
 body.game-mode .trade-inventories > section { padding-inline: 10px; }
 body.game-mode .trade-item-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(65px,1fr)); }
 body.game-mode .trade-cell .item-art { width: 48px; height: 48px; }
 body.game-mode .trade-inspector { flex-wrap: wrap; }
}
@media(max-width:700px) {
 body.game-mode .place-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
 body.game-mode .place-areas { padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
 body.game-mode .place-areas h2 { width: 100%; margin: 0; font-size: 16px; }
 body.game-mode .place-area { width: calc(50% - 4px); min-height: 62px; grid-template-columns: 45px minmax(0,1fr) 8px; padding: 5px 0; }
 body.game-mode .place-area .area-scene { width: 45px; height: 45px; }
 body.game-mode .place-area strong { font-size: 13px; }
 body.game-mode .place-area small { font-size: 9px; }
 body.game-mode .explore-heading { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
 body.game-mode .map-find { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
 body.game-mode .map-find label { width: 100%; }
 body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-toolbar { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }
 body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-toolbar > div:first-child { display: none; }
 body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-controls { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
 body.game-mode .shop-dialogue { padding: 18px; }
 body.game-mode .shop-spoken { font-size: calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
 body.game-mode .trade-heading { flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 12px; }
 body.game-mode .trade-inventories .section-heading { display: block; }
 body.game-mode .trade-inventories .section-heading h4 { font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
 body.game-mode .trade-item-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(58px,1fr)); max-height: 300px; }
 body.game-mode .trade-cell { min-height: 110px; }
 body.game-mode .trade-cell .item-art { width: 44px; height: 44px; }
 body.game-mode .trade-item-name { font-size: calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
 body.game-mode .trade-inspector > div { flex-basis: calc(100% - 92px); }
 body.game-mode .trade-offer-row { flex-wrap: wrap; }
 body.game-mode .trade-offer-row > span { flex-basis: 100%; }
 body.game-mode .trade-totals > span { min-width: calc(50% - 12px); }
}


/* The creation portrait keeps its measured size without a surrounding frame. */
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { width: fit-content; height: auto; min-height: 0; max-width: 100%; align-self: center; margin-inline: auto; border: 1px solid var(--game-brass, #a38c59); padding: 5px; box-shadow: none; background: #171615; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage :is(.fantasy-avatar,.raster-portrait,.preset-window) { border: 0; border-radius: 0; box-shadow: none; background: transparent; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { width: clamp(150px, 27dvh, 280px); margin: 0; flex: none; }

/* World-first screens: names have their own column; portrait crops never overlap it. */
body.game-mode .person-record-row { grid-template-columns: 52px minmax(0,1fr) auto; }
body.game-mode .person-record-row > .fantasy-avatar { width: 48px!important; max-width: 48px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .person-record-row strong { display: block; overflow-wrap: anywhere; line-height: 1.3; }
body.game-mode .person-memory-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 104px minmax(0,1fr); align-items: center; }
body.game-mode .person-memory-heading > .fantasy-avatar { min-width: 0; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
body.game-mode .person-memory-heading > div { min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .person-memory-heading h1 { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.local-service-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr)); gap: 8px; }
.local-residents { margin-block: 20px; }
.service-meeting { max-width: 850px; margin-inline: auto; }
.service-meeting .dialogue-speaker { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 104px minmax(0,1fr); align-items: center; gap: 20px; margin-block: 20px; }
.service-meeting .dialogue-speaker > .fantasy-avatar { width: 104px!important; min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
.service-meeting .dialogue-window { margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 22px; border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--game-brass); background: var(--game-pane); font-size: 1.15em; line-height: 1.7; }
.service-offer { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
.service-offer h3,.service-offer p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
.service-offer .disabled-reason { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.service-profession { display: grid; gap: 10px; padding-block: 16px; }
.service-profession select { width: 100%; }
.service-current-health { color: var(--game-brass); }
.activities-simple,.simple-journal { max-width: 1000px; margin-inline: auto; }
.activities-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 24px; }
.journal-quest { padding-block: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
.journal-quest > header { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.journal-search { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-block: 20px; }
.journal-search input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
#player-note { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
#player-note textarea { width: 100%; color: var(--game-bone); background: var(--game-pane); border: 1px solid var(--game-rule); padding: 14px; font: inherit; resize: vertical; }
.inventory-cell[draggable=true] { cursor: grab; }
.inventory-cell.gear-held { opacity: .55; cursor: grabbing; }
.inventory-equip-slot.drop-ready { outline: 1px dashed var(--game-brass); outline-offset: 3px; }
.inventory-equip-slot.drop-over { outline: 2px solid var(--game-brass); background: #38332a; }
@media(max-width:700px) {
 body.creation-mode .creator-portrait { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px minmax(0,1fr); align-items: center; text-align: left; }
 body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / 3; width: 100px; height: 100px; min-height: 0; padding: 3px; }
 body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { width: 92px; }
 body.game-mode .person-memory-heading { grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 14px; }
 body.game-mode .person-memory-heading .fantasy-avatar { width: 80px!important; }
 .service-meeting .dialogue-speaker { grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 14px; }
 .service-meeting .dialogue-speaker > .fantasy-avatar { width: 80px!important; }
 .service-offer { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
 .service-offer > .button { justify-self: start; }
}

body.game-mode .preset-portrait-img, body.creation-mode .preset-portrait-img { filter: var(--illustration-tone); }

/* Compact daily life and a continuous, room-by-room dungeon chart. */
.activity-tabs { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin:12px 0 22px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); padding-bottom:12px; }
.activity-tabs .button[aria-pressed=true] { color:var(--game-bone); border-color:var(--game-brass); background:#302c24; }
.activity-category > h2 { margin-top:0; }
.compact-activities { display:grid; gap:0; }
.compact-activity { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap:12px; align-items:center; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); padding:13px 2px; }
.compact-activity strong,.compact-activity small { display:block; }
.compact-activity strong { font-size:calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1)); font-weight:500; line-height:1.5; }
.compact-activity small { color:var(--game-muted); font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); margin-top:3px; }
.compact-activity details { margin-top:5px; font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); max-width:65ch; }
.compact-activity details summary { cursor:pointer; color:var(--game-brass); }
.compact-activity details p { margin-block:7px; }
.travel-energy-summary { padding:12px 0; max-width:65ch; }
.travel-energy-summary p { margin:6px 0; }
.home-listings { margin-block:22px; }
.romantic-identity { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; align-items:end; padding:18px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
.romantic-identity h3 { flex-basis:100%; margin:0; }
.romantic-identity label { display:grid; gap:6px; font-size:12px; }
.romantic-identity select { color:var(--game-bone); background:var(--game-pane); border:1px solid var(--game-rule); padding:9px; }
.runestone-game { max-width:440px; margin:20px auto; }
.runestone-board { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:8px; }
.runestone { min-height:68px; border:1px solid var(--game-brass); background:#242321; color:var(--game-brass); font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:26px; cursor:pointer; }
.runestone.revealed { background:#39362e; color:var(--game-bone); opacity:1; }
.maze-workspace { max-width:1320px; margin:auto; }
.maze-heading { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; padding-bottom:16px; }
.maze-heading h1 { margin:5px 0; }
.maze-layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,1.15fr) minmax(260px,1fr); gap:28px; align-items:start; }
.maze-chart { position:sticky; top:12px; }
.maze-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(var(--maze-size),1fr); aspect-ratio:1; max-width:600px; border:1px solid var(--game-brass); padding:10px; background:#151514; gap:0; }
.maze-cell { display:block; min-width:0; aspect-ratio:1; margin:0; padding:0; border:1px solid transparent; color:#c1b181; background:#292826; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(12px,1.8vw,21px); cursor:pointer; opacity:1; border-radius:0; }
.maze-cell:disabled { opacity:1; cursor:default; }
.maze-cell.fog { background:#161615; color:transparent; }
.maze-cell.wall-north { border-top:2px solid #777064; }
.maze-cell.wall-east { border-right:2px solid #777064; }
.maze-cell.wall-south { border-bottom:2px solid #777064; }
.maze-cell.wall-west { border-left:2px solid #777064; }
.maze-cell.current { color:#f0e9d1; background:#665a3e; box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #b7a46e; }
.maze-cell:not(:disabled):hover,.maze-cell:focus-visible { background:#494332; outline:2px solid #b7a46e; outline-offset:-2px; }
.maze-direction-controls { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-top:12px; }
.maze-cell { position:relative; }
.maze-cell.route-room { background:#46402c; }
.maze-cell.current.route-room { background:#665a3e; }
.maze-cell.inspected { outline:2px dotted var(--game-brass); outline-offset:-4px; }
.maze-mark,.maze-route-dot { position:absolute; pointer-events:none; font-size:.55em; line-height:1; }
.maze-mark { right:2px; bottom:2px; }
.maze-route-dot { top:2px; left:2px; }
.maze-map-modes,.maze-map-edit-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-block:12px; }
.maze-map-memory,.maze-recorded-route { border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-block:12px; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.maze-map-memory h3,.maze-recorded-route h3 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:1rem; }
.maze-map-memory h4 { margin-block:14px 6px; }
.maze-map-memory form,.maze-map-memory fieldset { display:grid; gap:8px; min-width:0; }
.maze-map-memory fieldset { border:0; margin:10px 0 0; padding:0; }
.maze-map-memory label { font-size:.9rem; }
.maze-map-memory input,.maze-map-memory select { width:100%; min-width:0; min-height:44px; }
.maze-map-memory button,.maze-map-modes button,.maze-recorded-route button { min-height:44px; }
.maze-recorded-route ol { padding-left:24px; max-height:220px; overflow-y:auto; }
.maze-recorded-route li { margin-block:4px; }
.maze-current > h2 { margin-top:0; }
.maze-expedition { margin-block:16px; padding-block:12px; border-block:1px solid var(--line); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.maze-expedition h3 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:1rem; }
.maze-expedition p { margin:8px 0; }
.maze-field-assists { margin-block:16px; padding-block:12px; border-block:1px solid var(--line); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.maze-field-assists h3 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:1rem; }
.maze-field-assists .field-assist { margin-block:12px; }
.maze-field-assists .button { max-width:100%; white-space:normal; text-align:left; }
.maze-expedition summary { cursor:pointer; color:var(--game-brass); font-size:.85rem; padding-block:6px; }
.maze-reserves { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:8px 0; display:grid; gap:7px; }
.maze-reserves li { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:2px 12px; font-size:.82rem; }
.maze-reserves span { color:var(--muted); }

.maze-current .area-scene { max-height:200px; overflow:hidden; margin-block:14px; }
.maze-current .area-illustration { height:170px; }
@media(max-width:850px) { .maze-layout { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:22px; } .maze-chart { position:static; } .maze-grid { margin-inline:auto; max-width:480px; } .maze-cell { font-size:19px; } .maze-current .area-scene { display:none; } }
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .maze-cell,.runestone { transition:none; } }

/* Carried charts: printed geography with an optional, separate travel grid. */
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-toolbar { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 14px; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-sheet-tools { display:flex; align-items:center; flex:1 1 270px; gap:10px; min-width:0; }
body.game-mode .chart-sheet-picker { display:flex; align-items:center; flex:1; gap:8px; margin:0; color:var(--game-muted); font-size:11px; }
body.game-mode .chart-sheet-picker select { min-width:0; width:100%; max-width:250px; min-height:36px; margin:0; padding:5px 27px 5px 9px; color:var(--game-bone); background:var(--game-shell); border:1px solid var(--game-rule); font:12px var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .chart-grid-toggle { flex:0 0 auto; min-height:36px; margin:0; padding:5px 9px; white-space:nowrap; font-size:11px; color:var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .chart-grid-toggle[aria-pressed=true] { color:var(--game-bone); border-color:var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-controls { flex:0 1 auto; justify-content:flex-end; margin-left:auto; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-map-canvas { isolation:isolate; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .paper-map-svg { filter:saturate(.45); }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell:hover { background:#b7a46e24; box-shadow:none; outline:1px dashed #615839a8; outline-offset:0; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #3e3e30; outline-offset:1px; background:#d6c99b4a; }
@media(max-width:650px) {
 body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-toolbar { padding:5px 8px; }
 body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-sheet-tools { flex-basis:100%; }
 body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-controls { width:100%; justify-content:center; }
 body.game-mode .paper-chart .map-controls .button { min-height:36px; min-width:36px; }
 body.game-mode .chart-sheet-picker select { max-width:none; }
 body.game-mode .country-chart { height:clamp(380px,67dvh,680px); }
}
body.game-mode .paper-chart :is(.paper-site,.paper-place-label,.paper-player) { cursor:pointer; }
body.game-mode .hex-map-scroll.is-panning :is(.paper-site,.paper-place-label,.paper-player) { cursor:grabbing; }
body.game-mode .paper-chart .hex-cell.known-place { height:min(52px,var(--hex-hit-height)); }

/* Regional context and marked travel sit beside the paper, never inside the map popup. */
body.game-mode .regional-map-context { margin:12px 0; border-block:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .regional-map-context summary { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:5px 18px; padding:12px 4px; cursor:pointer; color:var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .regional-map-context summary small { color:var(--game-muted); font:12px var(--font-body,serif); }
body.game-mode .regional-map-context > div { padding:0 4px 14px; max-width:75ch; }
body.game-mode .regional-map-context p { margin:7px 0; }
body.game-mode .regional-conflict { padding-left:12px; border-left:2px solid var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .regional-conflict small { display:block; color:var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .planned-trail { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin:14px 0; padding:14px; border:1px solid var(--game-brass); background:#aaa1770a; }
body.game-mode .planned-trail strong { display:block; margin-top:4px; }
body.game-mode .planned-trail p { margin:5px 0; }
body.game-mode .planned-trail small { color:var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .regional-account { max-width:68ch; padding:12px 0; }
body.game-mode .regional-account article { margin:14px 0; border-left:2px solid var(--game-brass); padding-left:12px; }
@media(max-width:650px){body.game-mode .planned-trail { flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; } body.game-mode .planned-trail .quick-actions { flex-wrap:wrap; }}

/* A destination, a journey, a place. The atlas is one continuous draggable map. */
body.game-mode .destination-exploration { width:100%; min-width:0; }
body.game-mode .journey-heading { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:14px; margin-bottom:18px; }
body.game-mode .journey-heading h1 { margin:3px 0 0; font-size:30px; }
body.game-mode .journey-where { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-end; gap:4px; min-width:0; }
body.game-mode .journey-current-place { min-height:38px; max-width:100%; padding:4px 0; color:var(--game-bone); background:none; border:0; font:15px var(--serif); text-align:right; overflow-wrap:anywhere; cursor:pointer; }
body.game-mode .journey-current-place:hover { color:var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .journey-where small { color:var(--game-muted); font-size:11px; }
body.game-mode .journey-workspace { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(240px,290px); gap:22px; align-items:start; min-width:0; }
body.game-mode .journey-map-column { display:flex; flex-direction:column; min-width:0; gap:12px; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination-picker { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr); align-items:center; gap:12px; margin:0; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination-picker > span { color:var(--game-muted); font:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .journey-destination-picker select { width:100%; min-width:0; min-height:44px; margin:0; padding:9px 30px 9px 12px; background:var(--game-shell); border:1px solid var(--game-rule); color:var(--game-bone); font:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .journey-destination-picker select:disabled { opacity:.65; }
body.game-mode .hex-board.journey-world-map { position:relative; display:block; flex:none; width:100%; min-width:0; height:auto; border:1px solid var(--game-rule); background:var(--game-shell); overflow:hidden; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .hex-map-scroll { flex:1 1 auto; height:auto; min-height:0; max-height:none; padding:0; box-shadow:none; container-type:normal; background:#aaa591; scrollbar-width:thin; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .hex-map-canvas { width:max(100%,calc(1120px * var(--map-scale,1))); min-width:0; height:auto; margin:auto; box-shadow:none; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .paper-map-svg { filter:grayscale(1) sepia(.14); }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .destination-pin { position:absolute; z-index:2; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); width:44px; height:44px; min-width:44px; min-height:44px; margin:0; padding:0; border:0; border-radius:50%; background:transparent; box-shadow:none; cursor:inherit; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .destination-pin:hover { background:#af9f6138; outline:1px solid #514c38; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .destination-pin:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #3e3e30; outline-offset:1px; background:#d6c99b4a; }
body.game-mode .journey-map-position { position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; pointer-events:none; }
body.game-mode .journey-map-tools { position:absolute; z-index:3; right:10px; bottom:38px; display:flex; gap:1px; padding:2px; border:1px solid var(--game-rule); background:var(--game-shell); }
body.game-mode .journey-map-tools .button { width:44px; height:44px; min-width:44px; min-height:44px; margin:0; padding:4px; border:0; color:var(--game-bone); font:22px var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .journey-map-tools .button:hover { color:var(--game-brass); background:var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .journey-map-hint { flex:0 0 auto; margin:0; padding:8px 12px; color:var(--game-muted); background:var(--game-shell); font:10px var(--sans); letter-spacing:.15px; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination { min-width:0; border-left:1px solid var(--game-rule); padding-left:22px; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination > .area-scene { width:100%; height:116px; min-height:0; padding:0; margin:0 0 16px; border:0; background:var(--game-shell); overflow:hidden; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination > .area-scene .area-illustration { width:100%; height:100%; filter:grayscale(1); }
body.game-mode .journey-destination > .area-scene figcaption { display:none; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination h2 { margin:6px 0; font-size:calc(25px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height:1.22; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination p { font-size:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height:1.6; margin:12px 0; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination .destination-region { margin:6px 0 17px; color:var(--game-muted); font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .journey-destination .button.primary,body.game-mode .journey-destination .button.secondary { width:100%; margin:10px 0 0; min-height:46px; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination .ghost { margin:8px 0 0; padding-inline:0; text-align:left; min-height:40px; font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .journey-destination .small-copy { color:var(--game-muted); font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .destination-quote { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:4px 12px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .destination-quote strong { font:calc(22px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--serif); color:var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .destination-quote span { font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); color:var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .journey-destination .destination-via { font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); color:var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .destination-background { margin-top:18px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule); font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .destination-background summary { min-height:32px; color:var(--game-muted); cursor:pointer; }
body.game-mode .destination-background p { font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .journey-destination .destination-quest { padding:8px 0; color:var(--game-brass); font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .journey-destination .journey-warning { color:var(--game-brass); font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .journey-progress { width:100%; height:3px; margin:22px 0 12px; background:var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .journey-progress > span { display:block; height:100%; background:var(--game-brass); transition:width .25s; }
body.game-mode .journey-distance strong,body.game-mode .journey-distance small { display:block; }
body.game-mode .journey-distance strong { font:calc(20px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .journey-distance small { color:var(--game-muted); font-size:calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1)); margin-top:5px; }
body.game-mode .journey-energy { margin:22px 0 8px; }
body.game-mode .journey-energy > div { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .journey-energy > div span { color:var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .journey-energy meter { display:block; width:100%; height:7px; margin-top:8px; border:0; background:var(--game-rule); accent-color:var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .journey-energy meter::-webkit-meter-bar { border:0; background:var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .journey-energy meter::-webkit-meter-optimum-value { background:var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .journey-energy meter::-moz-meter-bar { background:var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .journey-energy p,body.game-mode .journey-destination .journey-footnote { font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); color:var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .journey-camp small { display:block; color:var(--game-muted); font-size:calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1)); margin-top:6px; }
body.game-mode .journey-destination .journey-stop-reason { margin:0; }
body.game-mode .map-popout > .journey-world-map.map-only { height:auto; max-height:84dvh; aspect-ratio:var(--atlas-ratio); }
body.game-mode .map-popout .journey-world-map .hex-map-canvas { width:max(100%,calc(1120px * var(--map-scale,1))); }
@media(max-width:1000px) {
 body.game-mode .journey-workspace { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 245px; gap:16px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination { padding-left:16px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination-picker { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:5px; }
}
@media(max-width:740px) {
 body.game-mode .journey-heading { margin-bottom:12px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-heading h1 { font-size:25px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-where { max-width:60%; }
 body.game-mode .journey-current-place { font-size:13px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-where small { font-size:10px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-workspace { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:14px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-map-column { display:contents; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination-picker { order:1; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination { order:2; border-left:0; border-block:1px solid var(--game-rule); padding:14px 0; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination > .area-scene { display:none; }
 body.game-mode .journey-world-map { order:3; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination h2 { font-size:calc(24px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination .destination-region { margin-bottom:10px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination .button.primary { margin-top:8px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination .destination-background { margin-top:10px; padding-top:8px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination .destination-quote { padding-top:10px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-destination .destination-via { margin-block:5px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-energy { margin-top:14px; }
 body.game-mode .journey-map-hint { font-size:9px; }
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { body.game-mode .journey-progress > span { transition:none; } }

/* Focus 14: plain activity panels, reliable origin choices, independently scrolling maps. */
body.creation-mode .creator-origin-grid > input[type="hidden"] { display:none; }
body.creation-mode button.creator-origin { width:100%; margin:0; text-align:left; color:inherit; font:inherit; border-radius:0; min-height:112px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-origin.is-selected { border-color:var(--game-brass,#aa985f); background:#292820; box-shadow:inset 3px 0 #aa985f; }
body.creation-mode .creator-origin:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #b3a16a; outline-offset:2px; }
body.game-mode .activities-simple .activity-category { display:block; width:100%; min-width:0; min-height:0; margin:0; padding:18px 0; border:0; background:none; }
body.game-mode .activities-simple .activity-category:hover { background:none; }
body.game-mode .activities-simple .compact-activities { display:block; max-width:900px; }
body.game-mode .activities-simple .compact-activity { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto; align-items:center; gap:16px; min-width:0; padding:17px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .activities-simple .compact-activity strong { font:calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--serif); color:var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .activities-simple .compact-activity small { display:block; margin-top:5px; color:var(--game-muted); font:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .activities-simple .activity-description { margin:7px 0 0; max-width:66ch; font:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.6 var(--serif); color:var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .activity-intro { max-width:68ch; margin:0 0 12px; font-size:calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height:1.6; }
body.game-mode .crime-choices { max-width:900px; }
body.game-mode .crime-option { padding:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .crime-option summary { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:18px; min-height:64px; padding:14px 0; cursor:pointer; color:var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .crime-option summary strong { font:calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .crime-option summary span { flex-shrink:0; color:var(--game-muted); font:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .crime-option summary strong::before { content:'＋'; margin-right:10px; color:var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .crime-option[open] summary strong::before { content:'−'; }
body.game-mode .crime-attempt { display:block; max-width:60ch; padding:0 0 18px; }
body.game-mode .crime-attempt label { display:grid; gap:8px; font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .crime-attempt select { font-size:calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); width:100%; min-height:44px; background:var(--game-shell); color:var(--game-bone); border:1px solid var(--game-rule); padding:9px; }
body.game-mode .crime-attempt p { font-size:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height:1.6; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .hex-map-scroll { display:block; flex:none; height:clamp(320px,54dvh,660px); min-height:320px; overflow:hidden; scrollbar-width:none; scrollbar-color:var(--scroll-thumb) var(--scroll-track); }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .hex-map-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; width:0; height:0; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .hex-map-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background:var(--scroll-thumb); border:3px solid var(--scroll-track); }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .hex-map-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track,body.game-mode .journey-world-map .hex-map-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-corner { background:var(--scroll-track); }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .hex-map-canvas { flex:none; margin:0; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .destination-pin,body.game-mode .journey-world-map .destination-pin:hover { border-radius:2px; background:transparent; outline:none; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .destination-pin:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #424234; outline-offset:-8px; background:transparent; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .destination-pin-name { position:absolute; top:100%; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); width:max-content; max-width:220px; padding:5px 8px; border:1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius:2px; color:var(--game-bone); background:var(--game-shell); font:12px/1.4 var(--serif); white-space:normal; pointer-events:none; visibility:hidden; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .destination-pin:is(:hover,:focus-visible) { z-index:4; cursor:pointer; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .destination-pin:is(:hover,:focus-visible) .destination-pin-name { visibility:visible; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map .is-panning .destination-pin .destination-pin-name { visibility:hidden; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map [data-op="destination-select"] { cursor:pointer; }
body.game-mode .field-place { max-width:980px; }
body.game-mode .field-place header > .eyebrow { display:block; margin-top:20px; }
body.game-mode .field-place h1 { margin-top:5px; }
body.game-mode .field-atmosphere { max-width:65ch; font-size:calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height:1.7; color:var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .field-controls { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin:20px 0; }
body.game-mode .field-paths article { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap:20px; align-items:center; padding:18px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .field-paths strong { font:calc(19px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--serif); }
body.game-mode .field-paths small { display:block; margin:7px 0; color:var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .field-paths p { max-width:65ch; font-size:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height:1.6; color:var(--game-muted); }
@media(max-width:580px){body.game-mode .crime-option summary { gap:8px; } body.game-mode .crime-option summary strong { font-size:calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1)); } body.game-mode .activities-simple .compact-activity { gap:10px; } body.game-mode .activities-simple .compact-activity strong { font-size:calc(17px * var(--reading-scale,1)); } body.game-mode .field-paths article { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:8px; }}

/* A definite viewport survives the general auto-height map rules. */
body.game-mode .map-popout > .hex-board.journey-world-map.map-only { height:80dvh; max-height:80dvh; aspect-ratio:auto; }
body.game-mode .map-popout .journey-world-map .hex-map-scroll { height:100%; min-height:0; }
body.game-mode .journey-world-map [data-map-viewport] * { touch-action:none; }
body.game-mode .journey-map-hint { margin:0; padding:9px 12px; }

body.game-mode .inn-replies,body.game-mode .school-shortcuts { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin:14px 0; }
body.game-mode .inn-rumor { border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule); padding-top:18px; margin-top:18px; }

/* Country names yield to individual places as the camera moves closer. */
body.game-mode :is(.paper-region-title,.paper-geographic-label,.map-region-label) { opacity:clamp(0,calc(2 - var(--map-scale,1) * 1.1),.8); transition:opacity 180ms ease; pointer-events:none; }
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){body.game-mode :is(.paper-region-title,.paper-geographic-label,.map-region-label){transition:none;}}
body.game-mode .leisure-groups { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:22px 32px; }
body.game-mode .leisure-group { min-width:0; }
body.game-mode .leisure-group > h3 { margin:12px 0 0; padding-bottom:9px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); font:calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--serif); color:var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .activities-simple .leisure-group .compact-activity { padding:12px 0; gap:12px; }
body.game-mode .activities-simple .leisure-group .compact-activity strong { font-size:calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .leisure-group .activity-description { font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
@media(max-width:900px){body.game-mode .leisure-groups { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:18px; }}

body.game-mode .inn-service-choice { display:grid; gap:5px; }
body.game-mode .inn-service-choice .button { text-align:left; }
body.game-mode .inn-replies .inn-room-terms { margin:0 0 6px; max-width:50ch; }



.scene-collection-b {background-image:url('__HO_ASSET_2e7833c99e2e5500_0741__')}

body.game-mode .service-meeting .preset-portrait-img { filter:var(--illustration-tone); }

/* Consistent choices and neutral portrait treatment on every screen. */
body .fantasy-avatar { filter:grayscale(1); }
body .preset-portrait-img { filter:var(--illustration-tone); }
body .button { overflow-wrap:normal; word-break:normal; }
body.game-mode .consistent-meeting { max-width:980px; margin-inline:auto; }
body.game-mode .consistent-meeting > .meeting-back { max-width:100%; padding-inline:0; margin:0 0 16px; white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .consistent-meeting > .dialogue-speaker { display:grid; grid-template-columns:104px minmax(0,1fr); gap:24px; align-items:center; margin:0 0 24px; text-align:left; }
body.game-mode .consistent-meeting .dialogue-speaker > div { min-width:0; }
body.game-mode .consistent-meeting .dialogue-speaker h1 { margin:5px 0 0; font-size:calc(28px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height:1.2; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .consistent-meeting .dialogue-speaker .eyebrow { margin:0; }
body.game-mode .consistent-meeting .dialogue-window { margin:0 0 24px; padding:18px 20px; border:1px solid var(--game-rule); border-left:2px solid var(--game-brass); font:calc(17px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.7 var(--serif); background:var(--game-pane); }
.interaction-options { display:grid; gap:0; width:100%; min-width:0; }
body.game-mode .interaction-choice { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 20px; align-items:center; gap:20px; width:100%; min-width:0; min-height:56px; margin:0; padding:16px 10px; border:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius:0; background:transparent; color:var(--game-bone); text-align:left; font:calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--serif); cursor:pointer; overflow-wrap:normal; word-break:normal; }
body.game-mode .interaction-choice:hover,body.game-mode .interaction-choice:focus-visible { background:#26241f; color:#e2d9c5; }
.interaction-copy { display:grid; gap:5px; min-width:0; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.interaction-copy > strong { font:500 calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--serif); }
.interaction-quote { color:var(--game-brass); font:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--sans); }
.interaction-description { max-width:76ch; color:var(--game-muted); font:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.65 var(--sans); }
.interaction-arrow { color:var(--game-brass); font:22px/1 var(--serif); text-align:center; }
body.game-mode .interaction-choice.quiet-choice { min-height:48px; padding-block:12px; }
.quiet-choice .interaction-copy > strong { color:var(--game-muted); font-size:calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .interaction-choice:disabled { cursor:default; color:var(--game-muted); background:transparent; }
.interaction-choice:disabled .interaction-arrow { opacity:.3; }
.interaction-choice .disabled-reason { display:block; margin:0; font:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .activities-simple { max-width:980px; }
body.game-mode .activities-content .view-heading { max-width:980px; margin-inline:auto; }
body.game-mode .activity-tabs { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0 24px; margin:12px 0 18px; padding:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .activity-tabs .button { flex:0 0 auto; width:auto; min-width:0; max-width:100%; min-height:46px; margin:0; padding:10px 0; border:0; border-bottom:2px solid transparent; background:transparent; color:var(--game-muted); font:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--sans); white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .activity-tabs .button[aria-pressed=true] { color:var(--game-bone); background:transparent; border-bottom-color:var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .activity-tabs .button:hover { color:var(--game-bone); }
body.game-mode .activity-category > .interaction-choice { margin-bottom:6px; }
body.game-mode .service-profession { padding:14px 0 24px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .service-profession > .button,.school-shortcuts > .button { justify-self:start; white-space:nowrap; }
.daily-record { padding:8px 0 22px; margin:0 0 20px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
.daily-record h2 { margin:4px 0 8px; font-size:28px; }
.daily-record p { margin:0; color:var(--game-muted); font:14px/1.5 var(--serif); }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-list { overflow-x:hidden; }
.save-slot-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); align-items:center; min-width:0; }
.save-slot-row.occupied-slot-row { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto; border:1px solid var(--game-rule,#4e4943); }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .occupied-slot-row .save-slot { border:0; background:transparent; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .save-slot { width:100%; min-width:0; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-delete { min-width:68px; margin:0 8px; padding:8px; color:#b4a78d; white-space:nowrap; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .save-slot > .menu-arrow { white-space:nowrap; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .creator-topline .button,body.title-mode .save-slots-footer .button { white-space:nowrap; }
@media(max-width:650px){
 body.game-mode .consistent-meeting > .dialogue-speaker { grid-template-columns:80px minmax(0,1fr); gap:16px; }
 body.game-mode .consistent-meeting .dialogue-speaker h1 { font-size:calc(24px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
 body.game-mode .activity-tabs { gap:0 18px; }
 body.game-mode .interaction-choice { padding-inline:6px; gap:12px; }
 body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-delete { min-width:54px; font-size:11px; margin-inline:2px; }
}

/* A saved inbox with quiet, temporary corner receipts. */
body.game-mode .header-inbox { position:relative; flex:0 0 44px; }
.inbox-count { position:absolute; top:1px; right:0; min-width:16px; padding:1px 3px; border:1px solid var(--game-brass); border-radius:8px; color:var(--game-bone); background:var(--game-shell,#171614); font:10px/1.1 var(--mono); }
.inbox-overlay { align-items:stretch; justify-content:flex-end; padding:0; }
.inbox-drawer { width:min(540px,100%); max-height:100dvh; height:100%; margin:0; padding:36px 28px; border:0; border-left:1px solid var(--game-rule,#49453c); background:var(--game-shell,#171614); overflow-y:auto; }
.inbox-heading { padding-bottom:20px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule,#49453c); }
.inbox-heading h2 { margin:5px 0 10px; font-size:30px; }
.inbox-heading p { margin:0; color:var(--game-muted,#a69e8e); font:12px/1.5 var(--sans); }
.inbox-heading > .button { margin-top:12px; padding-inline:0; }
.inbox-entry { border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule,#49453c); }
.inbox-entry-open { display:grid; grid-template-columns:8px minmax(0,1fr) 16px; gap:12px; align-items:center; width:100%; min-height:72px; padding:16px 0; border:0; background:none; color:var(--game-bone,#d4cbb8); text-align:left; cursor:pointer; }
.inbox-entry-open > span:nth-child(2) { display:grid; gap:6px; min-width:0; }
.inbox-entry-open strong { font:500 17px/1.4 var(--serif); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.inbox-entry-open small { color:var(--game-muted,#a69e8e); font:11px/1.4 var(--sans); }
.inbox-unread-dot { width:5px; height:5px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--game-brass,#9b8b60); }
.inbox-entry.read .inbox-unread-dot { background:transparent; }
.inbox-entry-open:hover strong { color:#e3d9c1; }
.inbox-letter { padding:0 0 18px 20px; color:var(--game-bone,#d4cbb8); font:16px/1.8 var(--serif); }
.inbox-letter p { white-space:pre-line; }
.inbox-empty { padding:32px 0; line-height:1.7; }
.notification-toast-stack { position:fixed; right:24px; bottom:80px; z-index:85; display:grid; gap:10px; width:min(370px,calc(100vw - 32px)); pointer-events:none; }
.notification-toast-stack[inert] { visibility:hidden; }
.notification-toast { position:relative; pointer-events:auto; border:1px solid #635d4e; border-left:3px solid #9b8b60; background:#1c1b17; box-shadow:0 8px 24px #0005; }
.notification-toast-open { display:grid; gap:5px; width:100%; min-height:86px; padding:16px 42px 16px 17px; color:#d8cfbc; background:transparent; border:0; text-align:left; cursor:pointer; }
.notification-toast-open small { color:#a99b77; font:10px/1.4 var(--mono); letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; }
.notification-toast-open strong { font:500 17px/1.35 var(--serif); }
.notification-toast-open > span { color:#aaa394; font:12px/1.6 var(--sans); }
.notification-dismiss { position:absolute; top:6px; right:5px; width:34px; height:34px; border:0; background:transparent; color:#b0a68e; font:22px var(--serif); cursor:pointer; }
.notification-toast-more { margin:0; text-align:right; pointer-events:auto; }
.notification-toast-more .link-button { font:11px/1.6 var(--mono); letter-spacing:.6px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#a99b77; background:transparent; border:0; padding:4px 2px; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:underline dotted; }
@media(max-width:650px){.notification-toast-stack { right:16px; bottom:138px; }.inbox-drawer { padding:32px 20px; }}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.notification-toast { animation:none; }}
.inbox-tools { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px 18px; margin-top:12px; }
.inbox-tools .button { padding-inline:0; min-height:38px; }

/* A quiet household landing, with deliberate property changes. */
body.game-mode .place-home > .area-scene { height: 130px; margin-block: 16px; }
.home-overview { padding: 6px 0; }
.home-overview > h3 { font-size: 28px; margin: 5px 0 6px; }
.home-address { margin: 0 0 6px; }
.home-overview > .small-copy { margin: 0 0 16px; }
.home-shortcuts { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-block: 12px 20px; }
.home-disclosure { border-top: 1px solid var(--game-rule); padding: 16px 0; }
.home-disclosure > summary { cursor: pointer; color: inherit; font-family: var(--font-display, Georgia, serif); font-size: 17px; }
.home-disclosure[open] > summary { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.home-offer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
.home-offer h4 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 19px; }
.home-offer p { margin: 4px 0; }
.home-offer small { color: var(--game-muted); }
.home-offer > button { flex-shrink: 0; }
.home-move { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) auto minmax(0,1fr); align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--game-rule); margin: 18px 0; }
.home-move > div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.home-move small,.home-move span { color: var(--game-muted); }
.home-move strong { font: 23px Georgia,serif; }
.family-responsibilities,.family-adoption { margin-top: 20px; }
@media(max-width:700px) {
 body.game-mode .place-home > .area-scene { height: 100px; }
 .home-offer { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }
 .home-move { gap: 10px; }
 .home-move strong { font-size: 20px; }
}

/* The craftsperson shares the merchant counter language, with a reviewed result
   instead of a second trading offer. Keep every column shrinkable on phones. */
body.game-mode .craft-summary {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 28px;padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule);font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1));color:var(--game-muted)}
body.game-mode .craft-summary strong {color:var(--game-bone);margin-left:5px}
body.game-mode .craft-tabs {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;padding:12px 16px 0}
body.game-mode .craft-tabs .active {color:var(--game-shell);background:var(--game-bone)}
body.game-mode .craft-columns {display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule)}
body.game-mode .craft-catalog-pane,body.game-mode .craft-detail {min-width:0;padding:16px}
body.game-mode .craft-catalog-pane>h4 {margin:0 0 14px;font:calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--serif)}
body.game-mode .craft-catalog-pane>h4 small {display:block;margin-top:5px;font:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--sans);color:var(--game-muted)}
body.game-mode .craft-design-grid {max-height:510px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(90px,1fr))}
body.game-mode .craft-detail {border-left:1px solid var(--game-rule);background:var(--game-pane);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
body.game-mode .craft-detail h4 {font:calc(24px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--serif);margin:6px 0 14px}
body.game-mode .craft-detail h5 {font:calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--serif);margin:20px 0 10px}
body.game-mode .craft-detail p {font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1));line-height:1.6}
body.game-mode .craft-result-art {float:right;margin:0 0 10px 12px}
body.game-mode .craft-result-art .item-art {width:76px;height:76px}
body.game-mode .craft-terms {clear:both;margin:14px 0 0;font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))}
body.game-mode .craft-terms>div {display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(85px,.65fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule);padding:9px 0}
body.game-mode .craft-terms dt {color:var(--game-muted)}
body.game-mode .craft-terms dd {margin:0;line-height:1.6}
body.game-mode .craft-ingredients {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(150px,100%),1fr));gap:8px}
body.game-mode .craft-ingredient {display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--game-rule);font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))}
body.game-mode .craft-ingredient .item-art {width:38px;height:38px;flex:0 0 38px}
body.game-mode .craft-ingredient small {display:block;font-size:calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1));color:var(--game-muted);margin-top:3px}
body.game-mode .craft-ingredient.missing {border-color:var(--game-muted)}
body.game-mode .craft-ingredient.missing small {color:var(--game-bone)}
body.game-mode .craft-confirm {border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule);margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px}
body.game-mode .craft-confirm>.button {min-width:130px}
body.game-mode .craft-empty {padding:30px 4px}
body.game-mode .craft-stock {padding:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule)}
body.game-mode .craft-stock .resource-grid {margin-top:14px}
body.game-mode .craft-project {margin:14px 16px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--game-rule);background:var(--game-pane)}
body.game-mode .craft-project h4 {margin:6px 0;font-size:calc(20px * var(--reading-scale,1))}
body.game-mode .craft-project p,body.game-mode .craft-project summary {font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1));line-height:1.6}
@media(max-width:700px){
 body.game-mode .craft-columns {grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
 body.game-mode .craft-detail {border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule)}
 body.game-mode .craft-design-grid {grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(80px,1fr));max-height:300px;min-height:0}
 body.game-mode .craft-catalog-pane,body.game-mode .craft-detail {padding:12px}
 body.game-mode .craft-workspace .trade-toolbar label {flex:1 1 130px;justify-content:space-between}
 body.game-mode .craft-workspace .trade-toolbar select {max-width:160px;min-width:0}
 body.game-mode .craft-workspace .trade-toolbar input {flex-basis:100%;width:100%}
 body.game-mode .craft-tabs {padding:12px 10px 0;gap:4px}
 body.game-mode .craft-tabs .button {padding:9px;font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1))}
 body.game-mode .craft-summary {padding:12px;gap:10px 20px}
}

/* Accepted commitments share the Journal's existing type scale and quiet disclosure. */
.journal-commitments > summary { cursor: pointer; }
.journal-commitment > header { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.journal-commitment h3,.journal-commitment p { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.journal-commitment .quest-command > p { flex-basis: 100%; }
.journal-commitments .journal-commitment:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
/* Exact-item bookmarks live quietly beside the existing inventory character. */
body.game-mode .gear-loadouts { margin-top:18px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule); min-width:0; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadouts > summary { cursor:pointer; font:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .gear-loadout-body { padding-top:10px; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadout-row { padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .gear-loadouts h3 { margin:0 0 6px; font-size:calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1)); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadouts p,body.game-mode .gear-loadout-issues { overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadout-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:4px; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadouts form { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-top:14px; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadouts form label { flex-basis:100%; font:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)) var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .gear-loadouts form input:not([type=hidden]) { width:100%; min-width:0; padding:8px; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadouts .button { max-width:100%; white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadout-detail { margin-top:16px; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadout-issues { padding-left:20px; }
body.game-mode .gear-loadout-issues li { margin-bottom:8px; }
body.game-mode .inventory-cell .item-favorite { position:absolute; top:2px; right:3px; color:var(--game-brass); font-size:12px; text-shadow:0 1px #000; }
/* Quiet, optional explanation alongside the shared action quotations. */
.first-day-guide { margin:0 0 16px; padding:12px 16px; border:1px solid var(--game-border,#55564d); border-radius:8px; }
.first-day-guide > summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:600; font-size:calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.first-day-guide > ol { margin:8px 0; padding-left:22px; }
.first-day-guide li { padding:4px 0; min-width:0; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.first-day-guide li > p { margin:4px 0; }
.first-day-guide li > strong { font-size:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.first-day-guide .button { max-width:100%; white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.action-cost-help { margin: 10px 0 16px; color: var(--game-muted, #aaa99e); }
.action-cost-help > summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale, 1)); }
.action-cost-help .small-copy { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale, 1)); line-height: 1.6; }
.interaction-choice .interaction-cost-details { display: block; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale, 1)); line-height: 1.6; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

/* Reading-size preferences enlarge prose, never the art or the icon columns.
   Let the counter/workbench grow vertically rather than truncate fine print. */
body.game-mode .trade-workspace :is(.trade-merchant > div,.trade-offer-row > span,.trade-totals > span,.craft-ingredient > span) { min-width:0; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .trade-workspace .inventory-gold { font-size:calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .trade-toolbar label { min-width:0; max-width:100%; flex-wrap:wrap; }
body.game-mode .trade-toolbar select { min-width:0; max-width:100%; }
body.game-mode .trade-workspace .button { max-width:100%; white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .service-profession > .button,body.game-mode .school-shortcuts > .button { max-width:100%; white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
body.game-mode .crime-option summary { flex-wrap:wrap; }
@media(max-width:420px){
 body.game-mode .craft-terms>div { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:4px; }
}

/* Browser-only save health is quiet unless progress needs a file escape. */
.save-health { display:flex; flex:0 0 auto; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px 14px; min-width:0; padding:7px 0; color:#aaa192; font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height:1.4; }
.save-health-copy { min-width:0; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:baseline; gap:2px 10px; }
.save-health [data-save-label] { color:#c7bca8; }
.save-health small { font:inherit; }
.save-health [data-save-problem] { flex:1 0 100%; color:#e8c68b; }
.save-health [hidden] { display:none !important; }
.save-health-warning { border-left:2px solid #af8950; padding-left:10px; }
.save-health-warning [data-save-label] { color:#f0d39f; }
.save-health .button { min-height:44px; white-space:normal; }
.title-content > .save-health { max-width:440px; margin-top:10px; }
.save-slot-row > .save-health { grid-column:1 / -1; padding:3px 10px 8px; }
.drawer-tools + .save-health,.drawer-section-label + .save-health { margin-bottom:8px; }
@media (max-height:500px) { .title-content > .save-health { margin-top:3px; padding-block:3px; } }

/* Return-to-life details share the existing scrollable, three-slot list. */
.slot-row-actions { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; gap:3px; padding:8px; min-width:76px; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-row-actions .button { margin:0; min-width:0; min-height:44px; white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:anywhere; font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-info .slot-pending-context { color:#d0c3a9; margin-top:4px; }
body.title-mode .save-slots-panel .slot-info .slot-source-note { color:#e8c68b; margin-top:4px; }
/* Which rules a life lives by: on the slot, the title card and the import review. */
.slot-rules { display:inline-block; margin-top:4px; padding:1px 7px; border:1px solid rgba(232,198,139,0.45); border-radius:999px; font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing:0.02em; color:#d0c3a9; }
.slot-rules.old-rules { color:#e8c68b; border-color:rgba(232,198,139,0.75); }
.slot-archive-note { grid-column:1 / -1; padding:8px 12px 10px; border-top:1px solid rgba(232,198,139,0.25); color:#d0c3a9; font-size:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.slot-archive-note p { margin:0 0 6px; }
.slot-archive-note .slot-row-actions { flex-direction:row; flex-wrap:wrap; padding:0; min-width:0; }
.import-rules .slot-rules { margin-top:0; }
.save-slot-row [hidden] { display:none !important; }
@media(max-width:420px) {
 .slot-row-actions { min-width:64px; padding:5px; }
}

/* Personal reminders keep exact text and use the same readable scale as life. */
.simple-journal .remembered-entry p,.personal-note-dialog .personal-note-text {
 font-size:calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1));overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}
.personal-note-text { white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.personal-notes { margin-top:28px;min-width:0; }
.journal-paging { margin-block:16px; }
.journal-paging p { margin-block:8px; }
.journal-paging .quick-actions,.personal-notes .quick-actions { flex-wrap:wrap; }
.personal-note-dialog #personal-note-edit-form { display:grid;gap:12px; }
.personal-note-dialog textarea {
 width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:9em;resize:vertical;padding:14px;
 color:var(--game-bone);background:var(--game-pane);border:1px solid var(--game-rule);
 font:inherit;font-size:calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1));line-height:1.6;
}
@media(max-width:500px){.journal-search { flex-wrap:wrap; }.journal-search input { flex-basis:100%; }}
/* Detached tactics rehearsal: the life shell stays inert behind this dialog. */
.modal.practice-modal{width:1240px;max-width:100%;padding:28px;}
.practice-modal .practice-heading{margin-bottom:12px;}
.practice-modal .practice-notice{padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #81704e;background:#272319;font:14px/1.6 var(--sans);}
.practice-lessons,.practice-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:14px 0;}
.practice-lessons .button{flex:1 1 160px;}
.practice-status{padding:10px 14px;border-left:3px solid #b2a477;background:#25221d;}
.practice-modal .practice-status p{margin:4px 0;font:14px/1.6 var(--sans);}
.practice-hint{margin:12px 0;}
.practice-actor-emblem{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;border:1px solid #827968;border-radius:50%;color:#d1c4a6;font-size:25px;}
.practice-modal .battle-command-panel h2{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:12px;}
@media(max-width:700px){.modal.practice-modal{padding:22px 14px;}.practice-modal .battle-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);}.practice-modal .practice-heading{font-size:27px;}.practice-lessons .button{flex-basis:40%;}}

/* The offline panel is local UI state, never a game/save transition. */
.offline-download { margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #514b43; min-width: 0; }
.offline-download h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; }
.offline-download p { margin: 8px 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.offline-download-size { font-weight: 600; }
.offline-download-source { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.6; color: #b8afa2; }
.offline-download progress { display: block; width: 100%; height: 14px; margin: 12px 0; accent-color: #b6a073; }
.offline-download-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }
.offline-download-actions .button { flex: 1 1 170px; white-space: normal; }
.offline-download [hidden] { display: none; }

/* UI 028–030: shared life-book review and personal-note entry controls. */
.journal-notes-entry { display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 24px;margin-block:16px; }
.journal-notes-entry > div { flex:1 1 220px;min-width:0; }
.journal-notes-entry p { margin-block:8px; }
.personal-note-actions { display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px; }
.journal-notes-entry .button,.personal-note-actions .button,.herbal-care-dialog .button { min-height:46px;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.personal-notes #note-text { scroll-margin-block:24px; }
.herbal-care-dialog { min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.herbal-care-dialog p { font-size:calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1));line-height:1.6; }
.herbal-care-dialog .modal-buttons { flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px; }
.herbal-care-dialog .button:disabled,.personal-note-actions .button:disabled { color:#b0a797;background:#24221f;border-color:#625b50;cursor:not-allowed;box-shadow:none; }
@media(max-width:500px) { .journal-notes-entry > .button,.personal-note-actions .button,.herbal-care-dialog .modal-buttons .button { flex:1 1 100%; } }

/* Creation and QoL review: one document scroll, stable controls and local reviews. */
body.creation-mode { height:auto; min-height:100dvh; overflow:auto; }
body.creation-mode .creator-screen { display:block; height:auto; min-height:100dvh; max-height:none; overflow:visible; padding:20px clamp(12px,4vw,64px); }
body.creation-mode #character-form { display:block; height:auto; overflow:visible; }
body.creation-mode .creator-workspace { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,.7fr) minmax(0,1.6fr); grid-template-rows:auto; align-items:start; gap:28px; height:auto; overflow:visible; }
body.creation-mode :is(.creator-portrait,.creator-controls) { height:auto; max-height:none; overflow:visible; min-width:0; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait { display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { display:block; width:192px; inline-size:192px; height:192px; block-size:192px; min-height:0; aspect-ratio:1; max-width:100%; flex:0 0 auto; grid-column:auto; grid-row:auto; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { display:block; width:100%; inline-size:100%; height:100%; block-size:100%; aspect-ratio:1; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage .raster-portrait { height:100%; block-size:100%; }
body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage .raster-portrait::before { display:none; }
body.creation-mode .creator-footer { position:static; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-block:20px; padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,12px); }
body.creation-mode .creator-screen :is(button,input,select) { min-height:46px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-screen button { white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:normal; word-break:normal; }
body.creation-mode .creator-steps { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-block:16px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-step { flex:1 1 150px; }
.creator-history-controls { display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px; }
body.creation-mode .creator-topline .creator-undo { display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:0 0 46px;width:46px;height:46px;padding:10px;border:1px solid #625b50; }
.creator-undo svg { display:block;flex:none; }
.creator-error { color:#e8b8a7;line-height:1.6;margin-block:12px; }
.creator-fate { margin-top:24px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid #625c4e; }
.creator-locks,.creator-random-actions,.creator-review-edits { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-block:12px; }
.creator-locks [aria-pressed="true"] { border-color:var(--game-brass,#aa985f); color:var(--game-brass,#aa985f); }
.creator-review dl { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(100px,.5fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap:12px 20px; }
.creator-review dd { margin:0; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.creator-review dt { color:var(--game-brass,#aa985f); }
.creator-review p,.creator-fate p { line-height:1.65; }
.age-precise { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:12px; }
.age-precise input { max-width:100px; }
.attribute-buy-row .attribute-limit { grid-column:1/-1; font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height:1.5; color:#b9b2a3; }
.portrait-candidate { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(100px,210px) minmax(0,1fr); gap:20px; margin-block:20px; padding:16px; border:1px solid var(--game-brass,#aa985f); }
.portrait-candidate > div { min-width:0; }
.portrait-candidate .fantasy-avatar { width:100%; }
.portrait-candidate .button,.portrait-gallery-filters .button { min-height:46px; white-space:normal; }
.portrait-gallery-count { scroll-margin-block:24px; }
.runestone-completion { margin-top:16px; padding:16px; border:1px solid var(--game-brass); }
.runestone-completion .button { min-height:46px; width:100%; }
.reading-preview { font:calc(17px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.7 var(--serif); padding:12px; border:1px solid #625c4e; }
.reading-shortcuts { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; }
.reading-shortcuts input { flex:0 0 24px; min-height:46px; }
.help-topic { padding-block:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #625c4e; }
.help-topic summary { min-height:46px; cursor:pointer; padding-block:10px; }
html[data-reading-font="plain"] { --font-display:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; --font-serif:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; }
@media(max-width:767px) {
 body.creation-mode .creator-workspace { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows:auto; gap:20px; }
 body.creation-mode .creator-portrait { position:static; inset:auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:88px minmax(0,1fr); align-items:start; gap:12px; }
 body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage.portrait-stage { width:88px; inline-size:88px; height:88px; block-size:88px; grid-column:1; grid-row:1; }
 body.creation-mode .creator-portrait-stage > .fantasy-avatar { width:100%; inline-size:100%; }
 body.creation-mode .creator-plate-caption { grid-column:2; }
 body.creation-mode .creator-age { grid-column:1/-1; }
 .creator-review dl { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:4px; }
 .creator-review dd { margin-bottom:14px; }
 .portrait-candidate { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); }
 .portrait-candidate > div:first-child { max-width:200px; margin-inline:auto; }
}

body.creation-mode.has-dialog { overflow:hidden; }
.journal-categories { display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-block:16px; }
.journal-categories .button { min-height:46px;white-space:normal; }
.journal-offers { margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--game-rule,#625c4e); }

.portrait-stage-filter { display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px;min-height:46px;white-space:normal; }
.portrait-stage-filter[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color:var(--game-brass,#aa985f);color:var(--game-brass,#aa985f); }

body.creation-mode #app { height:auto; min-height:100dvh; }

/* The opening and title share one quiet, legible threshold into the world. */
body.title-mode .title-screen {
 display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; width:100%; height:100%; min-height:0;
 padding:24px clamp(20px,4vw,64px); padding-top:max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-top));
 padding-bottom:max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); overflow-x:hidden; overflow-y:auto;
 overscroll-behavior:contain; scroll-padding-block:24px;
}
body.title-mode .title-screen::after { inset:12px; border-color:#8c79502b; box-shadow:inset 0 0 70px #0005; }
.title-screen .title-backdrop,.boot-screen .title-backdrop { animation:none; }
.title-screen .title-backdrop::after,.boot-screen .title-backdrop::after {
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0c0c0bf5 0%,#0c0c0be6 29%,#0c0c0b9c 49%,#0c0c0b15 76%,#0c0c0b44);
}
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-topline { position:relative; inset:auto; flex:0 0 auto; min-height:46px; gap:16px; font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); color:#bbb09e; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-topline .button { min-height:46px; white-space:normal; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-content {
 flex:1 0 auto; align-self:flex-start; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;
 width:min(500px,52%); min-width:0; max-height:none; margin:0 0 0 clamp(0px,4vw,64px);
 padding:clamp(24px,4vh,52px) 0; overflow:visible; animation:none;
}
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-wordmark,.boot-card .boot-wordmark {
 margin:0; font:400 clamp(54px,6vw,88px)/.94 var(--serif); letter-spacing:-.045em;
 color:#e0d8c8; text-transform:uppercase; text-shadow:0 3px 24px #000a;
}
.title-screen .title-wordmark > span,.boot-wordmark > span { display:block; }
.title-screen .title-wordmark > span + span,.boot-wordmark > span + span { margin-top:5px; }
.title-screen .title-wordmark em,.boot-wordmark em { color:#b49b6b; font-size:.68em; font-weight:400; font-style:italic; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-tagline { display:block; margin:20px 0 24px; color:#bdb5a7; font:italic calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--serif); }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-menu { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; width:100%; margin:0; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-menu-item {
 min-width:0; min-height:48px; padding:11px 14px; gap:12px; margin:0;
 border:1px solid #71634770; color:#d7cebd; background:#11110fe8;
 font:400 calc(19px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--serif); letter-spacing:0;
 scroll-margin-block:24px; overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}
.title-screen .title-item-copy { display:block; flex:1; min-width:0; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-menu-item small { display:block; margin-top:4px; color:#b6ad9d; font:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--sans); letter-spacing:0; }
.title-screen .title-menu-item .menu-arrow { flex:0 0 auto; opacity:.8; transform:none; color:#bba374; font-size:20px; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-menu-item:not(:disabled):is(:hover,:focus-visible) { color:#f0e6d3; border-color:#bba374; background:#2b271eea; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-menu-item:disabled { color:#8f897d; border-color:#625c4e60; background:#10100fd9; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-menu-item:disabled small { color:#999183; }
.title-screen .title-menu-item:disabled .menu-arrow { visibility:hidden; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-begin { min-height:94px; padding:20px; color:#eee2c9; border-color:#a38b59; background:linear-gradient(110deg,#403727ed,#1c1b16f5); font-size:calc(24px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.title-screen .title-life { min-width:0; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-continue-card { display:grid; grid-template-columns:72px minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap:16px; padding:18px; border-color:#9d875a; background:linear-gradient(110deg,#302b20ed,#131410f5); }
.title-screen .title-life-portrait { display:block; width:72px; height:90px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #bba37465; background:#11110e; }
.title-screen .title-life-portrait .fantasy-avatar { width:72px; height:90px; min-width:0; max-width:none; border:0; border-radius:0; padding:0; }
.title-screen .title-life-portrait .raster-portrait { width:100%; height:100%; border:0; border-radius:0; }
.title-screen .title-life-copy { display:block; min-width:0; }
.title-screen .title-action-label { display:block; color:#e9dcc1; font:calc(24px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.2 var(--serif); margin-bottom:7px; }
.title-screen .title-life-copy strong { display:block; font:400 calc(19px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.3 var(--serif); color:#e2d8c6; }
.title-screen .title-life-place,.title-screen .title-life-context { display:block; margin-top:5px; font:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.45 var(--sans); color:#bdb39f; }
.title-screen .title-life-context { color:#d4c4a5; margin-top:9px; }
.title-screen .title-source-note { margin:0; padding:10px 14px; border-inline:1px solid #71634770; background:#15140ff5; color:#e0c89c; font:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--sans); }
/* A life kept for the archive: shown, never opened here; its note carries the export and the way there. */
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-kept-card { grid-template-columns:72px minmax(0,1fr); cursor:default; border-color:#71634780; background:linear-gradient(110deg,#25221bed,#121210f5); }
.title-screen .title-life-kept .slot-archive-note { border:1px solid #71634770; border-top:0; background:#11110fed; }
.save-slot[data-refused-life] { opacity:1; cursor:default; }
.save-slot[data-refused-life] .menu-arrow { color:#c9b78f; }
.save-slot[data-refused-life]:disabled > .menu-arrow { display:inline; }
.slot-info .slot-rules { width:fit-content; }
.title-screen .title-life .save-health { margin:0; border:1px solid #71634770; border-top:0; background:#11110fed; padding:10px 14px; }
.title-screen .title-life .save-health-warning { border-color:#a38b59; }
.title-screen .title-life-actions { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(150px,100%),1fr)); gap:10px; }
.title-screen .title-secondary { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:2px 10px; padding-top:10px; border-top:1px solid #71634765; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-secondary .title-menu-item { padding:10px 4px; border-color:transparent; background:transparent; font-size:calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.title-screen .title-secondary .menu-arrow { display:none; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-content > .save-health { max-width:none; margin-top:14px; }
.title-screen .title-footer { flex:0 0 auto; min-width:0; padding-top:8px; }
.title-screen .title-footer .title-settings { position:static; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:10px 16px; margin:0 0 12px; padding:0; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-settings .button { min-height:46px; font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.title-screen .title-settings > span,.title-screen .title-save-note { font:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.5 var(--sans); color:#b1a795; letter-spacing:0; }
.title-screen .title-save-note { margin:0 0 14px; }
body.title-mode .title-screen .title-bottomline { position:static; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px 20px; min-height:24px; border-top:1px solid #71634745; padding-top:12px; color:#a69a85; font-size:calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }

.boot-screen { position:relative; isolation:isolate; min-height:100vh; min-height:100svh; display:flex; align-items:center; padding:40px clamp(24px,6vw,88px); color:#ded6c8; background:#0c0c0b; }
.boot-screen::after { content:''; position:absolute; z-index:-1; inset:12px; border:1px solid #8c79502b; pointer-events:none; }
.boot-card { width:min(520px,100%); margin-left:clamp(0px,4vw,64px); text-align:left; padding-block:28px; }
.boot-card .boot-kicker { margin-bottom:28px; color:#b49b6b; font:11px/1.5 var(--mono); letter-spacing:2px; }
.boot-card .boot-tagline { margin:24px 0 32px; color:#bdb5a7; font:italic 17px/1.5 var(--serif); }
.boot-loading { width:min(280px,100%); height:2px; overflow:hidden; background:#71634765; }
.boot-loading > span { display:block; width:35%; height:100%; background:#b49b6b; animation:book-opening 1.8s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
.boot-card #boot-message { margin:18px 0 5px; color:#d8cbb1; font:14px/1.5 var(--sans); }
.boot-card .boot-caption { color:#a99e8b; font:italic 14px/1.5 var(--serif); }
.boot-card #boot-recovery { max-width:440px; margin-top:22px; padding-top:18px; border-top:1px solid #71634780; }
.boot-card #boot-recovery p,.boot-card noscript p { font:14px/1.65 var(--sans); color:#c3b9a7; }
.boot-card #boot-retry { min-height:46px; border-color:#a38b59; }
.boot-screen[data-phase="failed"] .boot-loading,.boot-screen[data-phase="failed"] .boot-caption { display:none; }
@keyframes book-opening { from { transform:translateX(0); opacity:.55; } to { transform:translateX(185%); opacity:1; } }
@media(max-width:900px) {
 body.title-mode .title-screen .title-content { width:min(500px,68%); margin-left:2vw; }
 .title-screen .title-backdrop { background-position:67% 50%; }
 .title-screen .title-backdrop::after { background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0c0c0bf5,#0c0c0bce 50%,#0c0c0b4d); }
}
@media(max-width:600px) {
 body.title-mode .title-screen { padding-inline:24px; }
 body.title-mode .title-screen .title-content { width:100%; margin:0; padding-block:28px; }
 body.title-mode .title-screen .title-wordmark,.boot-card .boot-wordmark { font-size:clamp(48px,12vw,68px); }
 body.title-mode .title-screen .title-topline { align-items:center; font-size:calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1)); letter-spacing:.6px; }
 body.title-mode .title-screen .title-continue-card { grid-template-columns:58px minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap:12px; padding:14px; }
 .title-screen .title-life-portrait,.title-screen .title-life-portrait .fantasy-avatar { width:58px; height:76px; }
 .title-screen .title-secondary { gap:2px 14px; }
 .title-screen .title-backdrop::after,.boot-screen .title-backdrop::after { background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0c0c0be8,#0c0c0bcf); }
 .boot-card { margin-left:0; }
}
@media(max-height:620px) and (min-width:601px) {
 body.title-mode .title-screen .title-wordmark { font-size:52px; }
 body.title-mode .title-screen .title-content { padding-block:20px; }
 body.title-mode .title-screen .title-tagline { margin-block:14px 18px; }
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .boot-loading > span { animation:none; width:100%; opacity:.7; } }

/* Final semantic control roles; decorative ledger rules keep their own tone. */
:root { --interactive-rule:#91846c; --control-size:46px; }
body.game-mode .button { min-height:46px; }
.button:disabled,body.game-mode .button:disabled,body.creation-mode .button:disabled {
 color:#a9a497; background:#24231f; border-color:#625e54; cursor:not-allowed;
 opacity:1; box-shadow:none; transform:none; filter:none;
}
.button:disabled:is(:hover,:active),body.game-mode .button:disabled:is(:hover,:active) {
 color:#a9a497;background:#24231f;border-color:#625e54;box-shadow:none;transform:none;
}
:is(button,input,select,textarea):focus-visible { outline:2px solid #d7be86;outline-offset:3px; }
body.game-mode :is(.dialogue-setting,.dialogue-speaker p,.dialogue-choice small) { font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .dialogue-speaker h2 { font-size:calc(18px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .dialogue-window .speaker-name { font-size:calc(13px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.inbox-heading h2 { font-size:calc(30px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.inbox-heading p,.notification-toast-open > span { font-size:calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.inbox-entry-open strong,.notification-toast-open strong { font-size:calc(17px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.inbox-entry-open small { font-size:calc(11px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.notification-toast-open small { font-size:calc(10px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.inbox-letter { font-size:calc(16px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
.inbox-tools .button,.notification-dismiss { min-width:46px;min-height:46px; }
.notification-toast-open { padding-inline-end:56px; }
.home-move strong { font-family:var(--serif); }
.menu-drawer,.inbox-drawer {
 padding-top:max(36px,env(safe-area-inset-top));
 padding-bottom:max(28px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
 padding-inline-start:max(24px,env(safe-area-inset-left));
 padding-inline-end:max(24px,env(safe-area-inset-right));
 scroll-padding-block:24px;
}
.first-day-guide { border-radius:0;box-shadow:none; }
.decision-trail li { margin-block:16px; }
.recorded-conversation { margin-block:20px;padding:16px;border-inline-start:2px solid var(--interactive-rule); }
body.game-mode :is(.rail-label,.nav-label,.drawer-nav .button,.bottom-nav span) { overflow-wrap:normal;word-break:normal;white-space:normal; }
@media(max-height:700px) { body.creation-mode .creator-portrait { position:static;inset:auto; } }
html[data-reading-motion="reduced"] *,html[data-reading-motion="reduced"] *::before,html[data-reading-motion="reduced"] *::after { animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important; }
.inbox-paging { display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px; }
.reading-presets { display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-block:16px; }
.life-calendar article { border-block-end:1px solid var(--game-rule);padding-block:12px; }
.routine-planner article { padding-block:16px;border-block-end:1px solid var(--game-rule); }
@media(max-width:767px) {
 body.creation-mode .creator-topline { flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px; }
 body.creation-mode .creator-topline .button { flex:0 0 auto;min-width:90px; }
 body.game-mode .sidebar { min-width:0; }
}

/* v0.63 Voice: chapters in the book, and the numbers behind a choice for those who ask. */
.journal-chapter { margin: 34px 0 6px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 2px solid #5a534a; }
.journal-chapter .eyebrow { margin: 0; letter-spacing: 0.18em; }
.action-detail { display: block; color: #8e867b; font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono); margin-top: 6px; }
.right-now .section-heading .eyebrow { margin: 0; }
.right-now .quick-actions { margin-top: 10px; }

/* v0.71: the farmer's choice comes before the household's books. */
body.game-mode .farmer-day-content { padding-block-start: 12px; }
body.game-mode .farmer-day-content .workspace-sections { margin-block-end: 10px; }
body.game-mode .farmer-day { width: 100%; max-width: 940px; margin-inline: auto; }
body.game-mode .farmer-day :is(p,small,summary,.farm-choice-cost,.choice-description,.disabled-reason) { font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .farmer-day :is(.farm-decisions,.farm-scene) > h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: calc(21px * var(--reading-scale,1)); line-height: 1.2; }
body.game-mode .app-shell.has-life .game-content .farm-scene { padding: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; }
body.game-mode .farm-scene-lead { margin: 0 0 10px; max-width: 72ch; line-height: 1.5; }
body.game-mode .farm-choices { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 0; }
body.game-mode .farm-choices .farm-choice { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 5px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 48px; padding: 13px 12px; border: 0; border-block-start: 1px solid var(--game-rule); border-radius: 0; text-align: start; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; background: transparent; }
body.game-mode .farm-choice .choice-label { color: var(--game-bone); font: 600 calc(15px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.4 var(--sans); }
body.game-mode .farm-choice :is(.farm-choice-cost,.choice-description) { display: block; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
body.game-mode .farm-choice-cost { color: var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .farm-choice .choice-description { color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .farm-choices .farm-choice:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--game-pane); }
body.game-mode .farm-choices .farm-choice:disabled { background: #24231f; color: #a9a497; }
body.game-mode .farm-scene-account { padding-block: 12px; border-block-end: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .farm-scene-account p { margin-block: 8px; }
body.game-mode .farm-hearth { padding-block-start: 12px; }
body.game-mode .farm-hearth > details { border-block-end: 1px solid var(--game-rule); padding-block: 4px; }
body.game-mode .farm-hearth summary { min-height: 44px; line-height: 1.5; }
body.game-mode .farm-ambition { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 12px; padding-block: 10px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .farm-ambition > span { color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .farm-season { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 16px; padding-block: 14px; }
body.game-mode .farm-season p { flex: 1 1 220px; margin: 0; color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .farm-people-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 24px; padding-block: 8px 20px; }
body.game-mode .farm-person { min-width: 0; }
body.game-mode .farm-person > header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
body.game-mode .farm-person > header :is(h3,p) { margin: 0; }
body.game-mode .farm-person > header .fantasy-avatar { width: 52px; height: 66px; flex: 0 0 52px; }
body.game-mode .farm-person-regard { color: var(--game-muted); }
body.game-mode .farm-memory { padding-inline-start: 12px; border-inline-start: 1px solid var(--game-brass); }
body.game-mode .farm-book { max-width: 76ch; font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .farm-book :is(p,small,summary) { font-size: calc(14px * var(--reading-scale,1)); }
body.game-mode .farm-book-chapter { padding-block: 18px; border-block-end: 1px solid var(--game-rule); }
body.game-mode .farm-book-chapter h3 { margin-block: 0 12px; }
body.game-mode .farm-book :is(.farm-book-purpose,.farm-book-promises) { padding-block: 14px; }
body.game-mode .farm-further-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
body.game-mode .header-ambition { display: block; max-width: 32ch; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--game-brass); font: calc(12px * var(--reading-scale,1))/1.35 var(--sans); }
@media(max-width:760px) {
 body.game-mode .farmer-day-content { padding: 10px 12px 28px; }
 body.game-mode .farm-choices .farm-choice { padding-inline: 0; }
 body.game-mode .farm-people-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 20px; }
 body.game-mode .header-ambition { max-width: 18ch; }
}

/* v0.64.1 · the school page's second slice: institution, bond, credentials, studies, the bench */
.schooling-panel { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin: 12px 0; }
.schooling-row { border-top: 1px solid var(--line, rgba(255,255,255,.08)); padding-top: 10px; }
.schooling-row .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 4px; }
.schooling-row p { margin: 4px 0; }
.schooling-row .badge.muted { opacity: .6; }
.guild-block { margin-top: 8px; }

/* v0.65 · the world as it reaches this life */
.world-panel .world-event { margin: 6px 0; }
.world-panel .world-event small { opacity: .7; }
.world-panel .world-threads { border-top: 1px solid var(--line, rgba(255,255,255,.08)); margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; }
.world-panel .world-news summary { cursor: pointer; opacity: .8; }

/* The delve: a place with a history, room by room. */
.delve-workspace { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
.delve-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
.delve-heading h1 { margin: 2px 0 4px; }
.delve-premise { margin: 0; opacity: .8; max-width: 60ch; }
.delve-vitals { white-space: nowrap; opacity: .85; }
.delve-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(220px, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .delve-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.delve-room-panel p { margin: 6px 0; }
.delve-noticed { border-left: 2px solid var(--accent, #b08a4a); padding-left: 8px; }
.delve-log { border-top: 1px solid var(--line, rgba(255,255,255,.08)); margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; opacity: .85; }
.delve-doors { margin-top: 10px; }
.delve-acts { margin-top: 6px; }
.delve-side { display: grid; gap: 12px; align-content: start; }
.delve-rooms { list-style: none; margin: 6px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
.delve-room { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; opacity: .7; }
.delve-room.seen { opacity: 1; }
.delve-room.here { font-weight: 600; }
.delve-room.danger .delve-room-symbol { color: var(--danger, #c0504d); }
.delve-room.cleared .delve-room-symbol { opacity: .5; }
.delve-room-symbol { width: 1.2em; text-align: center; }
.delve-room small { opacity: .7; margin-left: 4px; }

/* v0.68 — the field */
.field-workspace{display:grid;gap:14px}
.field-ground{display:grid;gap:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line,rgba(120,100,70,.35));border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(40,30,22,.35),rgba(20,16,12,.55))}
.field-side{display:grid;gap:8px}
.field-line{height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(200,170,120,.5),transparent)}
.field-rank{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:stretch;position:relative;padding-left:40px;min-height:72px}
.field-rank-label{position:absolute;left:0;top:4px;width:34px;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.6}
.field-card{display:flex;gap:8px;min-width:200px;flex:1 1 200px;max-width:320px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
.field-card.enemy{background:rgba(60,20,18,.28)}
.field-card.current{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(220,180,110,.7)}
.field-card.down{opacity:.45;filter:grayscale(1)}
.field-card.out-of-reach{opacity:.75}
.field-portrait{position:relative;flex:0 0 auto}
.field-turn{position:absolute;right:-6px;top:-6px;font-size:.8rem;color:#e7c777}
.field-body{display:grid;gap:3px;flex:1;font-size:.86rem}
.field-body .stat-row{font-size:.74rem}
.field-down,.field-reach{font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.7;margin-left:6px}
.field-intent{margin:0;font-size:.78rem;opacity:.85}
.field-glyph{display:inline-block;width:1.1em;text-align:center;color:#e7c777}
.field-known{margin:0;font-size:.76rem;color:#c9b27a}
.field-pick{font-size:.76rem;opacity:.85}
.field-actions{display:grid;gap:6px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr))}
.field-action{display:grid;gap:2px}
.field-action .button.art{border-color:rgba(200,170,120,.6)}
.field-action small{opacity:.7;margin-left:4px}
.field-preview{margin:0;min-height:1.2em}
.field-recent p{margin:2px 0;font-size:.84rem}
.field-log summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:.8rem;opacity:.75}
.field-tree,.field-bestiary{list-style:none;margin:6px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:6px}
.field-tree ul{list-style:none;margin:2px 0 0;padding-left:12px;display:grid;gap:2px}
.field-tree li.learned>span{color:#e7c777}
.field-tree li.locked>span{opacity:.55}
.field-tree li small,.field-bestiary li small{opacity:.7;margin-left:6px}
.field-bestiary li p{margin:2px 0 0}
@media (max-width:640px){.field-card{min-width:0;flex:1 1 100%;max-width:none}.field-rank{padding-left:0;padding-top:16px}.field-rank-label{top:0}}
.field-help summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:.78rem;opacity:.7}
.field-help p{margin:4px 0}
</style>
    <noscript><style>#boot-message { display: none; } .boot-loading, .boot-caption { display: none; }</style></noscript>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="app">
      <main id="boot-state" class="boot-screen" data-phase="loading">
        <div class="title-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="title-vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <section class="boot-card" aria-labelledby="boot-title">
          <p class="boot-kicker">VOLUME I · THE BOOK OF A LIFE</p>
          <h1 id="boot-title" class="boot-wordmark"><span>Hearth</span> <span><em>&amp;</em> Oath</span></h1>
          <p class="boot-tagline">The world is old.<br>Your story is unwritten.</p>
          <div class="boot-loading" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
          <p id="boot-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Loading Hearth &amp; Oath…</p>
          <p class="boot-caption">Opening the book of a life.</p>
          <div id="boot-recovery" hidden>
            <p>A game file may be missing or blocked, or startup may have been interrupted. Check your connection and try again.</p>
            <p>This error does not mean your saved lives have been erased. Retry reloads the page without clearing them.</p>
            <button id="boot-retry" class="button" type="button">Retry</button>
          </div>
          <noscript><p>JavaScript is needed to open this game. Enable it for this page, then reload. This does not erase your saved lives.</p></noscript>
        </section>
      </main>
