xion":"deep","hairTone":"light","confidence":"clear","hairToneConfidence":"clear"},{"cell":58,"stage":"adult","presentation":"feminine","complexion":"deep","hairTone":"light","confidence":"clear","hairToneConfidence":"clear"},{"cell":59,"stage":"adult","presentation":"feminine","complexion":"medium","hairTone":"light","confidence":"uncertain","hairToneConfidence":"clear"},{"cell":60,"stage":"adult","presentation":"androgynous","complexion":"medium","hairTone":"light","confidence":"clear","hairToneConfidence":"clear"},{"cell":61,"stage":"adult","presentation":"androgynous","complexion":"medium","hairTone":"light","confidence":"clear","hairToneConfidence":"clear"},{"cell":62,"stage":"adult","presentation":"androgynous","complexion":"deep","hairTone":"light","confidence":"clear","hairToneConfidence":"clear"},{"cell":63,"stage":"adult","presentation":"androgynous","complexion":"medium","hairTone":"light","confidence":"uncertain","hairToneConfidence":"clear"}],"notes":"Final native 1254×1254 opaque PNG was inspected as a whole sheet and as all four two-row age crops. Eight genuine equal-size rows, eight columns, 64 complete independently drawn elf faces. This supplement provides light/silver/blond naturally visible hair at infant, child, adolescent and adult stages; the final adult block replaced the originally requested elder block after root found missing medium/deep adult light-hair coverage. The native skin classifications follow final visible forehead and cheek pigmentation rather than requested positions; monochrome intermediate pigmentation and infant presentation are marked uncertain. All 64 cells have clearly light hair; no covered hair, masks, headwear, armor or weapons, and no facial hair. Infants are naturally subtle in presentation, and androgynous portraits include diverse facial anatomy. Medium/deep shades are conservative visual categories within monochrome line art, not a precise ethnicity taxonomy. Whole faces, hair, ears and garments are painted together with original aspect preserved. The metadata sourceSha256 binds the encoded final AVIF; original PNG hash and full generation/edit provenance are in the manifest.","src":__offlineMedia["media-511"],"width":1254,"height":1254,"cells":[[0.07974481658692185,0.07974481658692185,12.360446570972886,12.280701754385964],[12.599681020733652,0.07974481658692185,12.360446570972886,12.280701754385964],[25.11961722488038,0.07974481658692185,12.200956937799043,12.280701754385964],[37.48006379585327,0.07974481658692185,12.440191387559809,12.280701754385964],[50.079744816586924,0.07974481658692185,12.360446570972886,12.280701754385964],[62.599681020733655,0.07974481658692185,12.121212121212121,12.280701754385964],[74.88038277511961,0.07974481658692185,12.360446570972886,12.280701754385964],[87.40031897926634,0.07974481658692185,12.519936204146731,12.280701754385964],[0.07974481658692185,12.519936204146731,12.360446570972886,12.360446570972886],[12.599681020733652,12.519936204146731,12.280701754385964,12.360446570972886],[25.039872408293462,12.519936204146731,12.280701754385964,12.360446570972886],[37.48006379585327,12.519936204146731,12.440191387559809,12.360446570972886],[50.079744816586924,12.519936204146731,12.360446570972886,12.360446570972886],[62.599681020733655,12.519936204146731,12.360446570972886,12.360446570972886],[75.11961722488039,12.519936204146731,12.280701754385964,12.360446570972886],[87.5598086124402,12.519936204146731,12.360446570972886,12.360446570972886],[0.07974481658692185,25.039872408293462,12.360446570972886,12.360446570972886],[12.599681020733652,25.039872408293462,12.280701754385964,12.360446570972886],[25.039872408293462,25.039872408293462,12.280701754385964,12.360446570972886],[37.48006379585327,25.039872408293462,12.440191387559809,12.360446570972886],[50.079744816586924,25.039872408293462,12.360446570972886,12.360446570972886],[62.599681020733655,25.039872408293462,12.360446570972886,12.360446570972886],[75.11961722488039,25.039872408293462,12.2009