 {id:'lantern_compact',name:'The Lantern Compact',regionId:'rainward',skill:'devotion',description:'A voluntary shelter network whose members disagree about who may hold a key.',missions:['A refuge has accepted more guests than its blankets can warm. Its keeper refuses to sell the guest list.','A flood has exposed the names of old donors; a patron wants priority for their descendants.','The compact must decide whether the next keeper may close a door for rest.']},
 {id:'salt_ledger',name:'The Salt Ledger',regionId:'saltreach',skill:'persuasion',description:'Harbor accountants who can make a debt legible or turn it into a weapon.',missions:['A storm-damaged cargo has three competing owners and one surviving crew.','The ledger records a payment the sailor never received; the merchant asks for a quiet correction.','A new trade table must choose who can inspect its fees and who may refuse a bargain.']},
