 {id:'rootward_circle',name:'The Rootward Circle',regionId:'blackgrove',skill:'survival',description:'Orchard keepers, charcoal burners and willing guides who argue over the forest’s changing edge.',missions:['The new seed bed lies where an old tenant still gathers food.','A walking orchard has damaged a road; its keeper offers an ungainly but useful repair.','The circle has room for a shared route, a paid harvest or an exclusive claim.']},
 {id:'ash_company',name:'The Ash Company',regionId:'ashplain',skill:'weapons',description:'A company of adult veterans choosing between service, wages and another commander.',missions:['A company chest contains fewer wages than its signatures promise.','A civilian relief wagon asks to cross a disputed military toll.','The next company charter can limit service or bind households to an armed patron.']},
 {id:'quiet_table',name:'The Quiet Table',regionId:'bellwater',skill:'stealth',description:'Private messengers and discreet traders; secrecy may protect a person or conceal coercion.',missions:['A sealed parcel belongs to a living recipient who may decline it.','A collector offers money for a courier’s private route.','A hidden meeting place needs a rule about who may bring an unwilling guest.']},
